### Quest Lines ###


## Quest Line: LV1 - Early Game
betterquesting.questline.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA.name=NV1 - Fase Inicial
betterquesting.questline.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA.desc=Este es el inicio de HBM's Nuclear Tech mod. En este capítulo aprenderás sobre las mecánicas básicas del mod, así como consejos y trucos que te ayudaran a progresar.

# Quest: Storage Drawers
betterquesting.quest.-7rSSbm6Q-qSPUPH2dapXA.name=Cajones de Almacenamiento
betterquesting.quest.-7rSSbm6Q-qSPUPH2dapXA.desc=Los cajones de almacenamiento son una forma fácil y barata de guardar grandes cantidades de objetos. Pueden ser mejorados para incrementar la capacidad de almacenamiento además de adquirir otras habilidades, como el vaciado. También pueden ser §dCincelados§r para cambiar el tipo de madera.%n%n§2Demaciados cajones puede causar tirones.

# Quest: You WILL eat ze bugs!
betterquesting.quest.-FdHmQJDSNCih5noZiI5-w.name=¡Tu TE comerás los bichos!
betterquesting.quest.-FdHmQJDSNCih5noZiI5-w.desc=Felicitaciones. Lo has hecho. De verdad lo has hecho.%n%nMIentras el resto del mundo se aferra desesperadamente a su carne y pan, tú - sí, TÚ - abriste tu inventario, agarraste un §6Gusano de seda§r, y pensaste: "si, Esto ahora es comida." Klaus está orgulloso. Klaus esta, de hecho, emocional. En algún lugar de un chalet%nsuizo, una sola lagrima cae por su cuello de tortuga. No tendrás nada. No tendrás barra de hambre. Y tú serás feliz.

# Quest: Stirling Engine
betterquesting.quest.-OxoBRz7Spqm0rVUNxRVpA.name=Motor Stirling
betterquesting.quest.-OxoBRz7Spqm0rVUNxRVpA.desc=El §3Motor Stirling§r usa él calor de un §3Horno de calentamiento§r o una §3§r§3Cámara de combustión§r para producir energía. Si un Horno de calentamiento se utiliza para calentar un Motor Stirling, lo más probable es que supere la velocidad máxima y dañe él motor mandando a volar él engrane principal. El Motor Stirling Pesado no tiene ese problema.%n%nUna cámara de combustión quemando carbón con un motor stirling produce §e2kHE/s§r, mientras que un horno de calentamiento con un motor stirling pesado produce §e10kHE/s§r.

# Quest: Additional Fluid Tools
betterquesting.quest.0-Ws1mY3SeeFcyIcv2LKNQ.name=Herramientas Adicionales de Fluidos
betterquesting.quest.0-Ws1mY3SeeFcyIcv2LKNQ.desc=El §6Sifón§r es una herramienta utilizada para extraer fluidos de la entrada de una máquina. Hacer click derecho en una máquina con fluido en su entrada llenará cualquier barril de fluido, tanque universal o pipeta (si la cantidad de fluido no puede llenar ninguna de las opciones anteriores).%n%nLas §6pipetas§r pueden ser utilizadas para insertar una cantidad especifica de fluido. Hacer click derecho o shift-click derecho incrementará o disminuirá la cantidad de fluido.

# Quest: Steam Engine
betterquesting.quest.1WdjJYUsRMKgt4MYnlmM7A.name=Motor de Vapor
betterquesting.quest.1WdjJYUsRMKgt4MYnlmM7A.desc=El §3Motor de Vapor§r es un método temprano para convertir §bvapor§r en energía. Requiere una fuente externa de vapor y una forma de ventilar o reprocesar él §bVapor de Baja Presión§r que produce. %n%nEl Motor de Vapor tiene una eficiencia energética del §e85%%§r, haciéndolo mejor que él §3Motor Stirling§r. Sin embargo, todavía tiene un límite de rendimiento pues solo puede contener hasta 2000 mB/t de vapor. Su taza máxima de consumo es 2000 mB/t, produciendo unos considerables §e3400 HE/t§r o §e68 kHE/s§r. Por lo tanto es el mejor generador disponible antes de las §3Turbinas de vapor§r.%n%nUna caldera siendo calentada por un horno de calentamiento usando carbón producirá §e17kHE/s§r.

# Quest: Automatic Thresher
betterquesting.quest.3o6RE2fyQyaYt65j_dZ2HQ.name=Trilladora Automática
betterquesting.quest.3o6RE2fyQyaYt65j_dZ2HQ.desc=La §3Trilladora Automática§r cosecha cultivos como §6Trigo§r, §6Cáñamo§r, §6Caña de Azúcar§r, ect en un área de 7x7 cuando se le suministra combustible. Eyectará todos los objetos por atrás.%n%n[F1] para más información.

# Quest: Abandoned Structures
betterquesting.quest.4d7s5-1MQxyI3YcrDSL98g.name=Estructuras Abandonadas
betterquesting.quest.4d7s5-1MQxyI3YcrDSL98g.desc=Las estructuras se generan a lo largo del mundo y están entre las mejores fuentes de recursos tempranos. Saquearlas antes de invertir fuertemente en producción puede salvarte una cantidad significativa de tiempo y recursos.%n%n§2La exploración rinde temprano - checa tus alrededores antes de farmear recursos que puede que encuentres gratis.§r

# Quest: Flare Stack
betterquesting.quest.4i9qqJhbSgC0UQ8pB9PD4g.name=Chimenea de Antorcha
betterquesting.quest.4i9qqJhbSgC0UQ8pB9PD4g.desc=La §3Chimenea de Antorcha§r es un generador que produce energía quemando líquidos y gases inflamables. Cualquier fluido marcado como inflamable puede servir de combustible - suminístralo a través de tuberías o directamente con contenedores.%n%nOperarla requiere tres pasos. Primero, llena él deposito interno (capacidad: §e64,000 mB§r) con combustible. Segundo, abre la §6válvula de flujo§r en la parte superior de la sección central para pasar combustible del depósito al sistema de combustión. Tercero, enciende el interruptor de §6ignición§r en la parte inferior de la sección central para quemar el combustible y comenzar a generar energía.%n%nLa eficiencia es baja: los gases se queman al §e50%%§r y los líquidos solo al §e10%%§r. La producción también varía según el tipo de combustible.%n%nDos mejoras están disponibles: la §6Mejora de Velocidad§r incrementa el consumo, y la §6Mejora de Efectividad§r mejora la eficiencia del combustible.

# Quest: Batteries
betterquesting.quest.5Cydbu41QH-GnEo1um0Qjw.name=Baterías
betterquesting.quest.5Cydbu41QH-GnEo1um0Qjw.desc=El §3Enchufe de Batería§r se utiliza para insertar §6Baterías§r o §6Condensadores§r.%n%nLas baterías tienen un mayor almacenamiento de energía, pero un tiempo de descarga más lento, lo que significa que solo una pequeña cantidad de energía almacenada puede ser suministrada a la red eléctrica.%n%nPor otro lado, los condensadores almacenan menos energía, pero la suministran más rápido.

# Quest: Stone Age
betterquesting.quest.63Mkw5ZqT6iefbQvFZ_EDQ.name=Edad de piedra
betterquesting.quest.63Mkw5ZqT6iefbQvFZ_EDQ.desc=Bienvenido a la Edad de Piedra. Esta etapa cubre las mecánicas esenciales de supervivencia que necesitaras para progresar, así como varios cambios realizados al Minecraft vanilla que afectan como juegas desde el mero inicio.%n%nCompleta las misiones de este capítulo para ponerte al día antes de continuar.%n%n§2Completa estas misiones antes de progresar - las siguientes etapas asumirán que ya sabes estas cosas.§r

# Quest: Nailed It!
betterquesting.quest.6l98ozdcQFqJOan6BC4kMA.name=¡En el clavo!
betterquesting.quest.6l98ozdcQFqJOan6BC4kMA.desc=El §6Martillo§r es una herramienta de §dEx Nihilo§r usada para triturar bloques en formas más finas. Su uso primario es producir los materiales necesarios para él §3Tamiz§r: la roca se tritura a grava, la grava a arena y la arena a polvo, cada uno de estos puede ser tamizado para obtener diferentes recursos.%n%nPara usarlo, simplemente rompe el bloque objetivo con el §6Martillo§r como lo harías con un pico. Los martillos vienen en los niveles estándar de herramienta -%nde madera a diamante - y se diferencian únicamente en la durabilidad. Pueden ser encantados, pero los encantamientos disponibles son diferentes a los del pico.%n%nLos minerales también pueden ser martillados a través de una cadena de trituración de varios pasos. Cada paso tiene una pequeña posibilidad de dar material%nextra, haciendo al §6martillo§r una forma básica de multiplicación de minerales antes de que máquinas de procesamiento dedicado estén disponibles.%n%n§2Martillar puede ser automatizado con máquinas que simulan romper bloques, como el Martillo Automático de §dEx Compressum§r§2.%n§2Checa NEI para ver la cadena de trituración de cualquier bloque.

# Quest: Cable Network Analysis Tool
betterquesting.quest.9FPuQxhjSHmPmrCwdfRZRw.name=Herramienta de análisis de red de cable
betterquesting.quest.9FPuQxhjSHmPmrCwdfRZRw.desc=La §6Herramienta de análisis de red de cable§r es utilizada para checar la integridad de redes eléctricas y analizar los principales componentes funcionales. Para hacer una prueba, has click derecho con el analizador en cables o mecanismos en la red eléctrica. El dispositivo mostrara la siguiente información:%n%n§eEnlaces§r - estos incluyen los cables y mecanismos que pueden conducir electricidad (e.j., unidades de almacenamiento de energía, postes de luz).%n%n§cProveedores§r - todos los mecanismos capaces de producir energía y/o alimentar a la red electrica (unidades de almacenamiento de energía en "§averde§r" y "§6onaranja§r" modos, turbinas, etc.).%n%n§9Receptores§r - todo lo que absorve energía de la red eléctrica (unidades de almacenamiento de energía en "§9azul§r" modo, moledores, y otros mecanismos).%n%n§2La herramienta de análisis no solo muestra los componentes anteriores pero también los cuenta. A cada red eléctrica se le asigna un código único.%n%n¡Las partículas solo aparecen en un radio de 20 bloques!

# Quest: Pipe Anchors
betterquesting.quest.9wRpAnjXSrGWFWSwKoTOhg.name=Anclajes de Tubería
betterquesting.quest.9wRpAnjXSrGWFWSwKoTOhg.desc=Los §3Anclajes de Tubería§r son conductos de fluido no sólidos que pueden ser usados en lugar de los conductos regulares.

# Quest: Automatic Buzz Saw
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA0A.name=Sierra Circular Automática
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA0A.desc=Con la §6§3Sierra Circular Automática§r uno puede automáticamente talar árboles para obtener §6madera§r, además de otras plantas como el §6Cáñamo§r y el §6trigo§r.%n%nLos §3ventiladores§r, cuando encendidos por redstone, pueden utilizarse para empujar los objetos soltados hacia tolvas o cintas transportadoras para almacenarlos. Usa un §6taladro§r en ellos para eliminar la disminución de la fuerza de empuje.

# Quest: Industrial Mixer
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA0w.name=Mezcladora Industrial
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA0w.desc=La §3Mezcladora Industrial§r es una máquina que permite mezclar un fluido con un objeto y/u otro fluido. Puede ser usada en vez de la §3Planta Química§r para algunas recetas.

# Quest: Anvil
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAw.name=Yunque
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAw.desc=Los §3yunques§r son una estación de creación con diferentes niveles que permiten la creación de diferentes máquinas, estructuras y objetos en algunos casos. Existen múltiples tipos de yunques con mayor nivel, siendo este primariamente correspondiente a una mayor cantidad de recetas disponibles.

# Quest: Burner Press
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABA.name=Prensa de Quemado
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABA.desc=Las §3Prensas§r son máquinas que pueden ser utilizadas para hacer §6Placas§r, §6Cables§r, §6Circuitos§r, §6Casquillos de bala§r así como §6Comprimir§r polvos no fundibles de vuelta a su forma original. Requieren §6Sellos§r para funcionar, los cuales pueden ser hechos a partir del §6Sello plano§r basico en el §6Yunque de hierro§r.%n%n§2Un precalentador puede ser colocado al lado de la Prensa de Quemado para incrementar su velocidad.

# Quest: Blast Furnace
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACQ.name=Alto Horno
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACQ.desc=El §3Alto Horno§r es un horno alimentado por combustibles sólidos, usado para crear diferentes aleaciones de dos ingredientes. Las principales aleaciones son: §6Cobre de Grado Minecraft§r y §6Acero§r. Insertar §bChorro de Aire Caliente§r, hecho al poner §bAire Comprimido§r en una §3Caldera§r, le da a todas las recetas un bonus de §e3x§r.%nLos §bGases de Combustión§r producidos al operar la máquina pueden ser quemados para producir energía o liberados a la atmósfera.%n%nLas herramientas de acero vienen equipadas con minado de vetas, haciéndolas herramientas excelentes para el juego temprano.%n%n§2Para herramientas más avanzadas en el futuro, presionar la tecla ALT mostrara un menú del que puedes seleccionar diferentes habilidades a la vez.§r

# Quest: Trench Mask
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADA.name=Máscara de Trinchera
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADA.desc=La §6Máscara de Trinchera§r es una máscara básica que protege al usuario de algunas partículas peligrosas suspendidas en el aire al minar Para hacer una, primero debes conseguir §6Paño§r y después orinarlo haciendo click derecho mientras lo sujetas.%n%n§2La cuerda puede ser fácilmente obtenida recogiendo cáñamo, encontrado en la naturaleza.%n%n§rOdio decirte esto, pero estas básicamente respirando tu propia orina...

# Quest: Hazmat Suits
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADw.name=Trajes de Protección
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADw.desc=Los §6Trajes de Protección§r ofrecen protección contra muchos peligros, principalmente radiación. La §6Tela de Protección§r puede ser reforzada aún más para crear trajes de protección más resistentes.%n%nPara proveer protección adicional, contra peligros ambientales, se necesita un §6Filtro de Máscara Antigás§r, el cual puede ser equipado al hacer click derecho mientras lo sujetas.

# Quest: Energy Cables
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEQ.name=Cables de Energía
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEQ.desc=El bloque más básico para transmitir energía es él §3Cable de Cobre Rojo§r, el cual viene en dos variantes, una forma de bloque y una forma de cable más delgada. La forma de bloque también tiene una versión pintable la cual puede ayudar a integrarlo mejor en tus diseños.%n%nPara mayor estética, y una distancia de transporte mucho mayor, un §l§r§6Tambor de cable§r con §3Conectores Eléctricos§r puede ser utilizado. Estas líneas eléctricas no son sólidas, pueden pasar a través de los suelos y las paredes.%n%n

# Quest: Pollution Detector
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEg.name=Detector de Contaminación
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEg.desc=El §6Detector de Contaminación§r monitorea y muestra los niveles de contaminación presentes en el ambiente. Altos niveles de contaminación reducirán la visibilidad, dan efectos negativos al jugador y hacen a los monstruos más fuertes, eso incluye esqueletos apareciendo con armas de fuego.

# Quest: Electricity
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEw.name=Electricidad
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEw.desc=§dHBM's NTM§r es un mod industrial, así que necesitaras §eelectricidad§r para continuar tu viaje. La energía es medida en §6HE (HBM Energy)§r.%n%n§2Si el generador de leña no es suficiente, puedes desbloquear fuentes de energía más avanzadas en el lado izquierdo de este libro de misiones, como el §3Motor Stirling§2, §3Caldera de Torre Solar§2, o el §3Motor Radial§2.§r

# Quest: Analog Circuit Board
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFA.name=Placa de Circuito Analógico
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFA.desc=El §6Circuito Analógico§r es la primer placa de circuitos de verdad utilizada para construir ciertas máquinas esenciales y herramientas como el §6Detector de Yacimientos de Petróleo§r, la §3Planta Química§r, y el §3Horno de Arco Eléctrico§r.%n%n§2Una receta más barata para los condensadores estará disponible si se posee una trituradora.

# Quest: Assembly Machine
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGQ.name=Máquina de Ensamblaje
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGQ.desc=La §3Máquina de Ensamblaje§r se utiliza en cada etapa del juego, está siendo utilizada para manufacturar prácticamente todas las otras máquinas complejas. Las recetas pueden ser escogidas dentro de la interfaz.%n%n§2Algunas recetas únicas requieren planos, que pueden ser encontrados en estructuras y/o comprados en Bobmazon.

# Quest: Shredder
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGg.name=Trituradora
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGg.desc=La §3Trituradora§r es una máquina que tritura recursos para convertirlos en polvos, o en muchos casos, sus ingredientes. También puede ser utilizada para duplicar minerales.%n%n§2Cuchillas de Trituradora son requeridas para que la máquina pueda funcionar.

# Quest: Soldering Station
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHA.name=Estación de Soldadura
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHA.desc=La §3Estación de Soldadura§r es la máquina en la que §6§rcomponentes de circuito§r pueden ser combinados§6§r para hacer §6Circuitos§r y donde §6Mejoras de Máquina§r pueden ser creadas.

# Quest: Crucible
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHQ.name=Crisol
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHQ.desc=El §3Crisol§r es una máquina importante pues es el componente central de la metalurgia. Es usado como un método de procesamiento de minerales, aleaciones y fundición de metales. Requiere una fuente de calor externa para fundir los ingredientes volviéndolos líquidos, cuando contiene líquido produce una cantidad constante de hollín que puede causar una cantidad considerable de contaminación que no puede ser mitigada. Algunas aleaciones, mencionadas anteriormente, pueden ser creadas alternativamente en un §3Alto Horno§r, sin embargo esto es normalmente más lento.%n%n[F1] para más información.

# Quest: Arc Welder
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHw.name=Soldadora de Arco
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHw.desc=La §3Soldadora de Arco§r es una máquina necesaria para la creación de muchos componentes, como §6Placas Soldadas§r, §6Partes de Misil§r y más. Algunas recetas requerirán insertar un fluido en la soldadora para funcionar.

# Quest: Combination Oven
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIQ.name=Horno Combinado
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIQ.desc=El §3Horno Combinado§r es un tipo único de horno que transforma objetos a sus respectivos productos y produce un subproducto líquido. Puede ser utilizado para producir §6Coque§r, §bAceite de Madera§r y §6Aluminio§r más eficientemente.

# Quest: Chemical Plant
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIg.name=Planta Química
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIg.desc=La §3Planta Química§r es una máquina necesaria para diferentes procesos, como la conversión de fluidos en otro tipo de fluido, la síntesis de diferentes compuestos, etc. Al igual que en la §3Máquina de ensamblaje§r, las recetas pueden ser seleccionadas dentro de la interfaz de la máquina.

# Quest: Strand Caster
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJA.name=Colada Continua
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJA.desc=La §3Colada Continua§r es un gran recipiente que puede moldear objetos en lotes de 9. También requiere §bAgua§r para moldear y produce §bVapor de Baja Presión§r que puede volver a ser convertido en agua.

# Quest: High-Speed Steel
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJQ.name=Acero de Alta Velocidad
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJQ.desc=El §3Acero de Alta Velocidad§r es una avancada y especializada forma de acero normal. Utilizada en varias recetas, como la §3Torre de Perforación Petrolífera§r y la §3Mezcladora Industrial§r.

# Quest: Conveyor Belt
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKg.name=Cinta Transportadora
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKg.desc=Los §3transportadores§r proporcionan la forma más fácil de mover objetos. Son varios bloques que pueden interactuar con máquinas así como objetos moviéndose en cintas transportadoras.%n%nLas §3cintas transportadoras§r son bloques utilizados para transportar objetos. Pueden recoger objetos del suelo o tomarlos de eyectores. Los insertadores pueden tomar objetos de las cintas transportadoras. Si no hay ningún insertador presente, el objeto será tirado al suelo al final de la línea de cintas transportadoras.%n%nLos §3insertadores§r son bloques que toman objetos de la cinta transportadora y los colocan en un espacio de almacenamiento. Los eyectores son lo opuesto, toman objetos de almacenamientos y los colocan en la cinta transportadora.%n%nLos insertadores tienen una opción para destruir objetos excedentes si el almacenamiento está lleno, de lo contrario los objetos que no puedan ser insertados en el destino ni en el búfer del insertador simplemente serán soltados.%n%nEl ejector tiene un sistema de lista blanca y negra (el modo por defecto es lista negra sin ninguna restricción - lo que significa que todo pasara). Hacer click derecho en la flecha blanca cambiara entre la lista blanca y negra. Un objeto puede ser agregado a la lista blanca/negra al "depositarlo" en el cuadrado del inventario azul - sin embargo, el objeto no será consumido.%n%nEl §3DIvisor de Transportador§r es un tipo de cinta transportadora que distribuye los objetos equivalentemente en 2 líneas.%n%nLos §3Clasificadores Transportadores§r son bloques que pueden clasificar diversos objetos redirigirlos a una cinta transportadora en específico. No poseen almacenamiento y simplemente mueven los objetos a cintas transportadoras conectadas basándose en los filtros que tengan, por los tanto pueden organizar objetos tan rápido como los reciben.%nEl clasificador tiene seis salidas con cinco recuadros cada una, haciendo que pueda redireccionar varios objetos a una sola cinta.

# Quest: Settings Tool
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMQ.name=Herramienta de Configuración
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMQ.desc=La §6Herramienta de Configuración§r es usada para copiar la configuración de máquinas. Es especialmente útil al construir grandes refinerías.

# Quest: Backpacks and Exploration
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOQ.name=Mochilas y Exploración
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOQ.desc=La exploración es una parte importante de la experiencia §dNTM§r pues recuperar estructuras abandonadas es una estrategia viable para el inicio del juego. También existen grandes cavernas en este modpack, así que no dudes en ir a explorarlas.%n%nLas §dmochilas§r serán de ayuda masiva, pues pueden ser utilizadas para llevar más objetos contigo. Las cajas también pueden ser utilizadas para transportar objetos, pero las mochilas también vienen con ranuras dedicadas para herramientas, una mesa de crafteo, así como una cama y tanques de fluidos.%n%nUna §dBrújula de la Naturaleza§r puede ser usada para fácilmente localizar biomas de interés.%n%nUna §6Manguera§r puede ser usada para rápidamente drenar y llenar fluidos almacenados en la mochila.

# Quest: Rotary Furnace
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPQ.name=Horno Rotatorio
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPQ.desc=El §3Horno Rotatorio§r es un largo horno que es alimentado por §bVapor§r y §6§rcombustible sólido.§rProduce material fundido que puede ser moldeado similarmente al producto de un §3Crisol§r y §3Horno de Arco§r. El Horno Rotatorio es la única máquina que puede producir §6Saturnita§r y §6Acero para Armas§r.

# Quest: Boiler and Steam Condenser
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAVQ.name=Caldera y Condensador de Vapor
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAVQ.desc=La §3Caldera§r, cuando recibe calor desde abajo, calienta fluidos. Dos usos importantes para la caldera son producir §bVapor§r y calentar §bPetróleo§r para su procesamiento el cual vendrá después. La Caldera puede explotar cuando la salida se llena al máximo.%n%nEl vapor, cuando es utilizado por máquinas, como reactores pasando vapor a travez de §3Turbinas§r o §3Fábricas Químicas§r producen §bVapor de Baja Presión§r. El vapor de baja presión puede ser reciclado para obtener 100% del agua devuelta utilizando un §3Condensador de Vapor§r.\nSe recomiendan circuitos cerrados de agua para reactores.

# Quest: Solar Tower Boiler
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAYg.name=Caldera de Torre Solar
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAYg.desc=La §3Caldera de Torre Solar§r es una máquina inicial que usa luz solar de espejos heliostáticos para evaporar agua generando vapor.%n%nLa Caldera de Torre Solar es calentada por espejos heliostáticos apuntando hacia ella. Apuntar un espejo a ella requiere la herramienta de ajuste de espejos, hacer click derecho en el boiler salvara su posición en la herramienta, subsecuentemente hacer click en los espejos hará que apunten al boiler seleccionado. El rango máximo de los espejos es 25 bloques, la eficiencia de los espejos no disminuye con la distancia. Un boiler consume 1mB de agua por cada 12.5 espejos cada tick al nivel máximo de luz y 100mB de vapor por cada mB de agua consumido. Sin embargo, la tasa de consumo de agua esta redondeada abajo al millibucket. Por lo tanto necesitas 13 espejos para generar tus primeros 100mB/t de vapor, 12 espejos para los siguientes cien, entonces 13, 12 y así.%n%nComo el calor proporcionado por cada espejo se basa en la luz del sol, espejos con bloques solidos encima de ellos no funcionaran, y la cantidad de calor disminuye con la cantidad de luz en la tarde hasta que no se produzca calor en la noche.%n%nLa caldera de torre solar solo puede producir vapor normal, por lo que el tipo de líquido no puede ser cambiado con un identificador de fluidos.

# Quest: Ammo Press and Guns
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAaA.name=Prensa de Munición y Armas de Fuego
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAaA.desc=Con la fundición disponible a través del §3Crisol§r, muchas partes de armas pueden ser creadas como §6Barriles§r and §6Empuñaduras§r. Una §3Prensa de Munición§r es usada para crear varias municiones que las pistolas usan.%n%nUna §3Mesa de Modificación de Armas§r puede ser utilizada para instalar modificaciones de armas. como los §6Silenciadores§r y §6Miras§r.%n%nLa §6Bolsa de Casquillos§r recuperara algunos de los casquillos cuando las armas son disparadas.

# Quest: Mining Charge
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAhQ.name=Carga de Minería
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAhQ.desc=Una §3Carga de Minería§r es un explosivo hecho con el expreso propósito de minar, por lo tanto es comúnmente usada para minar minerales profundos, ya que no destruye los objetos, antes de conseguir un pico que puede hacer lo mismo. Las Cargas de Minería son una gran forma de conseguir §6Circonio§r de minerales profundos para hacer barras de combustible nuclear.%n%nTiene un radio explosivo de aproximadamente 3 bloques y explota instantaneamente al ser energizado por redstone, al explotar no daña a entidades.%n%nHay otras dos variantes de esta, siendo la §3Carga de Minería Temporizada§r y la §b§3Carga de Minería Semtex§r, las dos son explosivos temporizados con la Carga Semtex siendo más fuerte que la regular y teniendo §eFortuna3§r, mientras tanto la carga de minería temporizada no parece tener capacidades mejoradas, además de tener un temporizador lo que la hace más conveniente de utilizar.

# Quest: Steel Anvil
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAuw.name=Yunque de Acero
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAuw.desc=Una versión mejorada del §3Yunque§r, [T2], la cual desbloquea recetas adicionales.

# Quest: Pollution and Smokestack
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAyg.name=Contaminación y Chimenea
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAyg.desc=La §6Contaminación§r es una mecánica que afecta a varias máquinas relacionadas con la industrialización. Debe ser propiamente mitigada o sufrirás las consecuencias de un mundo contaminado. Hay 3 subtipos de contaminación - hollín, veneno y metales pesados.%n%nEl §6hollín§r es el más común, producido por la quema de combustibles fósiles y otras fuentes. Este incrementa la vida y fuerza genérica de los monstruos. En concentraciones lo suficientemente altas se vuelve visible como esmog.%n%nEl §6veneno§r lastima a las entidades no protegidas cuando los niveles son altos, y es producido exclusivamente como la consecuencia de derramar líquidos como CO2 o varios subproductos del petróleo.%n%nLos §6metales pesados§r vienen de la combustión de combustibles con plomo. También aumenta la fuerza de los monstruos, pero los puede dañar en concentraciones altas.%n%nTambien puede ser dañino para entidades y jugadores si no traen una máscara antigás.%n%nMáquinas compatibles pueden ser conectadas con tubos de escape especiales, los cuales son básicamente conductos rectangulares especializados, para llevar los gases a una §6Chimenea§r reduciendo la cantidad de contaminación.%n%nLa §3Chimenea§r es utilizada para reducir la contaminación de las máquinas. Los §3Tubos de Escape§r, hechos en el yunque, pueden ser utilizados para transportar los gases a la Chimenea. La §3Chimenea Industrial§r es necesaria para producir §6Fullerita§r en la etapa avanzada.%n%nUn §3Cenicero§r puede ser instalado debajo de la Chimenea para recolectar §6Ceniza§r, la cual puede ser utilizada como una alternativa barata al tinte negro así como en la creación de §6Fertilizante Industrial§r.

# Quest: Player Decontaminator
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABCw.name=Descontaminador de Jugador
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABCw.desc=El §3Descontaminador de Jugador§r removerá radiación acumulada al pararse sobre él. Puede ser muy rentable, pues otros métodos como el §6RadAways§r requieren reposición constante.

# Quest: Machine Upgrade Template
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABSA.name=Plantilla de Mejora de Máquina
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABSA.desc=La §6Plantilla de Mejora de Máquina§r es la base de todas las mejoras de máquina. Las mejoras de máquina no solo se utilizan para incrementar la eficiencia de las máquinas sino también para desbloquear nuevas funciones.

# Quest: Drainage Pipe
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABdg.name=Tubería de Drenaje
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABdg.desc=La §3Tubería de Drenaje§r permite verter fluidos y gases al medio ambiente a costa de la contaminación.

# Quest: Do a Barrel!
betterquesting.quest.Ba9zHp22SvGkBCr8xF5oQQ.name=¡Haz un barril!
betterquesting.quest.Ba9zHp22SvGkBCr8xF5oQQ.desc=Los §3barriles§r son bloques de almacenamiento que pueden guardar fluidos y bloques sólidos. Los barriles de madera derramarán líquido lentamente y se quemarán si se llenan de lava, así que utiliza barriles de piedra para esas recetas.%n%nLos barriles puestos al aire libre recolectaran agua de lluvia durante las precipitaciones.%n%nCuando se llenan con materia orgánica, el barril comenzara a compostar cuando se llene por completo. Después de aproximadamente 100 segundos producirá un bloque de tierra, eyectado al hacer click derecho. Tierra dejada cerca de micelio será lentamente convertida en bloques de micelio, no hay necesidad de toque de seda.%n%nUn barril de madera lleno de §bAgua§r colocado al lado de roca lentamente la convertira a roca musgosa, costando §e100 mB§r por bloque. Los bloques al rededor no deben ser afectados por la lluvia. Colocar un barril en micelio convertirá el agua a §5Agua de Bruja§r, aunque puede que el barril desaparesca en el proceso. Agua fluyendo encima de un barril lleno de lava se convertirá a obsidiana.%n%nLos barriles de piedra pueden generar criaturas al ser tocados por una muñeca: un barril de lava con una muñeca enojada generar un Blaze y un barril de §5Agua de Bruja§r con una muñeca terrorífica generara un Enderman.%n%nLos barriles pueden convertir objetos usando fluidos: §5Agua de Bruja§r convierte arena en arena de almas, lava transforma redstone a piedra del nether, o polvo brillante a piedra del end, y §bAgua§r puede transformar polvo a arcilla, leche a bolas de slime o sopa de hongos a §5Agua de Bruja§r.%n%n§2Tolvas pueden ser usadas para insertar y eyectar objetos en los barriles, haciendo la composta fácil de automatizar.§r

# Quest: Sieving
betterquesting.quest.CAGBwqHLQBStKodq03kwyw.name=Tamizar
betterquesting.quest.CAGBwqHLQBStKodq03kwyw.desc=El §3Tamiz§r filtra, grava, tierra, piedra, y otros bloques para separar fragmentos de materiales útiles - incluyendo hierro, cobre, plomo y más.%n%nUsa el §3Tamiz Pesado§r con §6Bloques Comprimidos§r para obtener más fragmentos.%n%n§2Usa NEI para listar todos los posibles recursos.

# Quest: Charm of Protection
betterquesting.quest.D0bv2vfWSkK1soyqHDwqjQ.name=Amuleto de Protección
betterquesting.quest.D0bv2vfWSkK1soyqHDwqjQ.desc=El §6Amuleto de Protección§r desvía meteoritos lejos del jugador y evita que destruyan bloques. Es recomendado conseguir uno lo más rápido posible para prevenir daños costosos en el futuro.

# Quest: Diesel Generator
betterquesting.quest.Eh_ylJU8TiiScjLN2_qmMA.name=Generador de Diésel
betterquesting.quest.Eh_ylJU8TiiScjLN2_qmMA.desc=El §3Generador de Diésel§r es un compacto generador de un bloque que quema combustibles líquidos para producir energía. Su pequeño tamaño y compatibilidad con derivados comunes del petróleo lo hacen una opción fuerte para generar energía al inicio y la mitad del juego.%n%nPuede almacenar hasta §b4,000 mB§r de fluido internamente, consumiéndolo a un ritmo constante de §e20 mB/s§r. También tiene una batería interna de §e50 kHE§r - pero la combustión no se detiene cuando la batería está llena, así que el exceso de energía se pierde. Para evitar esto, asegúrate de que tus maquinas estan consumiendo energía constantemente.%n%nEl combustible puede ser suministrado a través de tuberías o colocando barriles en la interfaz interna. Un §6Identificador de Fluido§r puede ser insertado para bloquear el tipo de fluido que se acepta. No todos los combustibles son iguales - la efectividad varia por el grado: combustibles de grado medio funcionan al §e50%%%%§r de eficiencia, grado alto al §e75%%§r, y combustibles de aviación solo al §e10%%§r. Combustible de grado bajo y combustibles gaseosos son rechazados por completo.%n%n§2Consejo: Combustibles de grado alto como el diésel, gasolina y biocombustible dan el mejor rendimiento - prioriza refinar tu petróleo a estos cuando es posible.§r

# Quest: Wood-Burning Generator
betterquesting.quest.Ek7Xr3XfSm-U7BYuBOACSA.name=Generador de Leña
betterquesting.quest.Ek7Xr3XfSm-U7BYuBOACSA.desc=El §3Generador de Leña§r es un método básico para producir energía quemando madera. Puede funcionar con cualquier objeto combustible pero proporciona bonificaciones de tiempo de combustión a los troncos y madera. También puede funcionar con cualquier líquido combustible al hacer click derecho en la flecha abajo del botón de encendido/apagado, pero es considerablemente más ineficiente que otros generadores quemadores de fluidos.%n%nQuemar troncos en el generador produce §e2kHE/s.§r

# Quest: Flint Tools
betterquesting.quest.F5fyyqAZREWe-rhgYcbXZg.name=Herramientas de Pedernal
betterquesting.quest.F5fyyqAZREWe-rhgYcbXZg.desc=Las §6Herramientas de Pedernal§r se requieren para obtener la primera madera y piedra. Rompe algunas hojas de árbol para conseguir brotes, entonces conviértelos en palos.%n%nLas hachas rompen automáticamente los troncos del árbol de arriba hacia abajo para evitar árboles flotantes. Manten Shift para deshabilitar esto y romper bloques normalmente.

# Quest: Steel Furnace
betterquesting.quest.GOACXA8jRc-SMNzk2CsNUQ.name=Horno de Acero
betterquesting.quest.GOACXA8jRc-SMNzk2CsNUQ.desc=El §3Horno de Acero§r, a diferencia de los otros hornos, funciona con §eTU§r. Además puede procesar hasta tres objetos a la vez, pero cada hueco consume más TU, lo que lo hace lento sin una fuerte fuente de calor. También tiene un bonus de producto extra para minerales y madera, en el que cada objeto cocinado da §e25%%§r a la barra del bonus, lo que significa que cada 4 objetos generan un quinto objeto extra gratis (§e+15 objetos para un solo stack§r).

# Quest: Electric Furnace
betterquesting.quest.HONUf7SQRl-jcf3BC5242A.name=Horno Eléctrico
betterquesting.quest.HONUf7SQRl-jcf3BC5242A.desc=El §3Horno Eléctrico§r es un horno que funciona por electricidad. Es ligeramente más rápido que un horno normal, sin ninguna mejora. Consume de §e1 kHE/s§r sin mejoras hasta §e4 kHE/s§r.%n%nDebido a que solo es ligeramente más rápido que un horno normal, no se usa mucho más allá del inicio del juego, pero se puede usar para automatizar, si la velocidad no es tu prioridad.

# Quest: Storage Drawer Keys
betterquesting.quest.HTaQEgJ8QCWYNMB8n7Awug.name=Llaves de los Cajones de Almacenamiento
betterquesting.quest.HTaQEgJ8QCWYNMB8n7Awug.desc=Las §dLlaves de los Cajones de Almacenamiento§r pueden ser usadas para modificar los Cajones en varias maneras.%n%nLa §dLlave de Cajón bloquea los cajones§r, para que objetos diferentes no puedan ser insertados en el cajón cuando está vacío.%n%nLa §dLlave de Ocultación§r oculta el icono del contenido del cajón.%n%nLa §dLlave de Cantidad§r muestra la cantidad de objetos dentro del cajón.%n%nLa The §dLlave Personal§r proteje los cajones de otros jugadores (afuera de las áreas reclamadas).%n

# Quest: Bobmazon
betterquesting.quest.IAP1AGA2TV-TtMAv_QMrIA.name=Bobmazon
betterquesting.quest.IAP1AGA2TV-TtMAv_QMrIA.desc=§6Bobmazon§r es una tienda dentro del juego donde los jugadores pueden gastar §6Corcholatas§r para comprar varios objetos como bloques de construcción, plantas, recursos y mucho más. Para comprar objetos, uno debe haber desbloqueado los logros enlistados debajo como "Calificaciones".

# Quest: Charcoal Automation
betterquesting.quest.ItX_qnZpQCuDSxSoHuKmsA.name=Automatización de Carbón Vegetal
betterquesting.quest.ItX_qnZpQCuDSxSoHuKmsA.desc=§6Madera§r obtenida de una granja de árboles puede ser cocinada o procesada en un §3Horno Combinado§r para producir §6Carbon Vegetal§r, el cual tiene muchos usos, como combustible para §3Hornos§r o incluso el §3Alto Horno§r, §6Fundente§r o §6Carbono§r en un Crisol para producir §6Acero§r o incluso §6Pólvora§r para munición.

# Quest: HE to RF Converter
betterquesting.quest.JcBabPI8RzGGmai3SwlcLw.name=Convertidor HE a RF
betterquesting.quest.JcBabPI8RzGGmai3SwlcLw.desc=El §3Convertidor HE a RF§r convertirá energía producida por las máquinas de NTM a energía utilizable para la §dRed Materia Energía§r y §dOpenComputers§r. Tiene una capacidad de almacenamiento interno muy grande así que es recomendado utilizar un diodo para limitar el consumo de energía.

# Quest: Multi Fluid Identifier
betterquesting.quest.M3mauW7uTCej4mql-Wnhqg.name=Identificador Multi Fluido
betterquesting.quest.M3mauW7uTCej4mql-Wnhqg.desc=El §6Identificador Multi Fluido§r se usa para seleccionar el tipo de fluido que necesites. Has shift-click mientras lo sujetas para seleccionar un fluido.

# Quest: Known Issues
betterquesting.quest.MNH6qakfTrC7Jbky4i_Epw.name=Problemas Conocidos
betterquesting.quest.MNH6qakfTrC7Jbky4i_Epw.desc=¡No es un bug, es una &q&zFUNCIÓN§r!%n%nCuando consumes puede que tus manos se agiten de forma extraña, como si Steve estuviera EXTREMADAMENTE feliz por ese almuerzo.%n%nSi tú experimentar tirones o micro-lags mientras juegas, trata de prender/apagar el Vsync. Si eso no ayuda contáctanos en Discord #help.%n%nPor el momento no tenemos ni idea de cómo arreglar esos bugs, pero estamos haciendo nuestro mayor esfuerzo!

# Quest: Additional NTM Modes
betterquesting.quest.MWwrY8PcTaam9T_sc4yDtQ.name=Modos Adicionales de NTM
betterquesting.quest.MWwrY8PcTaam9T_sc4yDtQ.desc=§cNTNH§r es un pack de mods modular, así que tú eres libre de añadir/remover/modificar/configurar/mods si es que funcionan!%n%n§dNTM§r ofrece un archivo de configuración muy modular, el cual también contiene varios modos que uno puede activar. Estos pueden ser activados en el archivo hbm.cfg.%n%n§2Modo Caro§r hace todo más costoso al hacer que no solo requieran más recursos, sino también nuevos componentes. El libro de misiones no reflejara los cambios de progresión si es activado.%n%n§2Modo 528§r introduce barreras en la forma de planos que son desbloqueados al destruir una cierta cantidad de objetos en un §3Aniquilador§r. Adicionalmente, algunos objetos, mayormente circuitos, ahora se construyen con una probabilidad de éxito. A la par de eso, hay aún más cambios para hacer el juego más difícil, como que el §6Tántalo§r se genera en ciertas áreas, las minas terrestres aparecen más frecuentemente y todos los bloques de §dAE2§r §4EXPLOTAN§r al ser usados.%n%nMuchas probabilidades de reciclaje con la §3Ensambladora Precisa§r estan masivamente reducidas al activar el modo caro, incrementando enormemente el coste efectivo.%n%n§2Modo Desenfrenado§r hace a los glífidos una gran amenaza pues la contaminación ahora los hace mucho más fuertes y agresivos. Nuevos tipos de glífidos más destructivos se vuelven más comunes. Si se alcanza un nivel lo suficientemente más alto de contaminación, glífidos exploradores pueden aparecer pasivamente, lo que hace que se requieran sistemas de defensa pasiva para prevenir que se generen nuevos nidos.%n%n§2Para los modos que cambian recetas, las recetas del modpack tienen que volver a ser insertadas después de que un nuevo folder hbmrecipes ha sido creado y los modos estan activados.§r %n

# Quest: Charging Station
betterquesting.quest.OlMZZGTaSz6VhzaeJdR6QQ.name=Estación de Carga
betterquesting.quest.OlMZZGTaSz6VhzaeJdR6QQ.desc=La §3Estación de Carga§r cargará herramientas eléctricas así como trajes eléctricos al estar parado cerca. Colocar más una al lado de otra incrementará la velocidad a la que los objetos son recargados.

# Quest: Geological Samples
betterquesting.quest.QF_GKcDaRim2-gEJRosFZQ.name=Muestras Geológicas
betterquesting.quest.QF_GKcDaRim2-gEJRosFZQ.desc=Este sistema es altamente WIP (incluyendo esta misión), así que no esperes que sea perfecto.%n%nEste es el método más fácil de hacer prospección, basado en la examinación visual del material circundante. Has click derecho en cualquier bloque de §6Piedra§r o §6Grava§r con un §6Lente de Prospector§r y este te dirá si hay una cantidad considerable de mineral alrededor. Tres niveles de indicación son reportados, "Indicios Tenues", "Indicios" y "Indicios Fuertes" permitiéndote localizar la fuente con precisión.%n%nTomat y analizar muestras geológicas, por otro lado, provee información similar al lente pero con mucho más detalle. Primero necesitaras hacer un §6Pico de Prospección§r. Para tomar una muestra has click derecho en cualquier pieza de Piedra o Grava con el Pico de Prospección. Este soltara una muestra geológica.%n%nPara analizar la muestra necesitaras un §3Kit de Análisis de Muestras Geológicas§r y un suministro de §6Papel Tornasol§r. Para usar el kit, colócalo en algún lugar y has click derecho para abrir su interfaz. Coloca la muestra que quieres analizar en el hueco de muestras y algo de papel tornasol en el hueco de al lado. El análisis empezará automáticamente y debería terminar en cuestión de segundos, tras lo cual aparecerá un reporte abajo.%n%nEl reporte muestra el lugar donde la muestra fue tomada y la cantidad de rastros de minerales interesantes que contiene. Puedes esperar que aparezcan indicios de minerales en un radio de 16 bloques respecto a la ubicación de la muestra, tanto en sentido horizontal como vertical. Los minerales más cercanos a la localización de la muestra estarán presentes más intensamente que aquellos que estén más lejos.%n%n§2Para salvar el análisis para futuras referencias, coloca un libro escribible en el hueco del libro y presiona el botón +.%n%nSi tu pierdes el reporte, puedes volver a analizar la muestra para recuperarlo. Sin embargo un poco de la muestra es utilizado cada vez que la analizas y cualquier muestra solo puede ser analizada 16 veces antes de que ya no quede nada.

# Quest: Packing Tape
betterquesting.quest.RBJS7D2ATpq7GUingAewuQ.name=Cinta de Embalaje
betterquesting.quest.RBJS7D2ATpq7GUingAewuQ.desc=La §6Cinta de Embalaje§r te permite romper y mover cajones sin que todos los objetos se caigan al suelo.

# Quest: Cladding
betterquesting.quest.UKkcpXk3SEWHXLIVC5VTDg.name=Revestimiento
betterquesting.quest.UKkcpXk3SEWHXLIVC5VTDg.desc=El §6Revestimiento§r es una de las modificaciones de armadura más importantes la cual reduce la absorción de radiación. Puede ser insertado en todas las piezas de armadura.

# Quest: Ore Generation System
betterquesting.quest.VMLB88YjRb26RVJcRmvxeA.name=Sistema de Generación de Minerales
betterquesting.quest.VMLB88YjRb26RVJcRmvxeA.desc=En §6NTNH§r, la generación de minerales ha sido §ocompletamente§r renovada y todavía está recibiendo actualizaciones y arreglos. Si no te gusta o te parece muy complicada, tienes dos opciones:%n1)Reportarlo a nosotros los desarrolladores%n2) Apagar el mod de la generación personalizada de minerales y configurar la generación en hbm.cfg como te parezca (pregunta por ayuda sobre esto en el servidor de Discord)%n%n[warn]Importante![/warn]%nLa antigua hoja de cálculo de Google Docs en línea fue REMPLAZADA. usa la que está en el Libro Guia.

# Quest: Dosimeter
betterquesting.quest.X1wMtj-xQR6M4Qzm6Rk2vA.name=Dosímetro
betterquesting.quest.X1wMtj-xQR6M4Qzm6Rk2vA.desc=El §6Dosímetro§r es una herramienta para detectar radiación y evaluar contaminación radioactiva.%n%nSu funcionalidad es similar a un §6Contador Geiger§r, pero recolecta mucha menos información - solo el nivel general de contaminación radioactiva en el ambiente. Solo está disponible una versión de mano del dosímetro.%n%nComo el contador, emite el característico sonido crepitante cuando detecta radiación.%n%n§2El nivel máximo de radiación que puede mostrar es 3.6 RAD/S.%n%nNi tan bueno, ni tan malo.

# Quest: Radial Performance Engine
betterquesting.quest.XNHsXFGWTvW9dhuen9iEFg.name=Motor de Rendimiento Radial
betterquesting.quest.XNHsXFGWTvW9dhuen9iEFg.desc=El §3Motor de Rendimiento Radial§r es un motor de combustión que convierte combustibles líquidos en electricidad. Requiere un mínimo de §e3§r §6Pistones de Motor de Combustión§r para funcionar, con hasta §e9§r instalados en los huecos de pistones. Los pistones adicionales incrementan la generación de energía y el consumo de combustible de forma lineal.%n%nEl motor acepta combustibles de varios grados con diferentes tasas de eficiencia. El §bAceite de Calefacción§r y §bAceite Industrial§r se queman con un §e75%%§r de eficiencia, §bPetroil§r al §e50%%§r, y §bDiesel§r y §bGasolina§r al §e25%%§r. Los combustibles de aviación y combustibles gaseosos no son compatibles. La energía se extrae de la parte inferior y el motor almacena hasta §e250 kHE§r internamente, o §e2.5 MHE§r si está quemando §bNITAN§r.%n%nSin embargo, el motor es más eficiente con las materias primas más pesadas y menos refinadas. Los combustibles más ligeros y refinados producen menos energía por mB aunque sean de un grado más alto.%n%n§2La eficiencia listada es un multiplicador de la energía de combustión base de cada combustible. Puede que los combustibles de alto grado tengan un mayor nivel de energía base, así que checa el indicador de HE/t en la interfaz antes de decidirte por un combustible.

# Quest: Hazards
betterquesting.quest.Zd1HNIsxSRees_4of0ezDw.name=Peligros
betterquesting.quest.Zd1HNIsxSRees_4of0ezDw.desc=Este mod añade varios peligros ambientales que te mataran si los ignoras.%n%nLa §6Radiación§r es medida en RAD. Los efectos empiezan en §e200 RAD§r y empeoran de manera continua - muerte instantánea ocurre a los §c1000 RAD§r. Usa un §6Contador Geiger§r para monitorear tu dosis. La armadura resistente a la radiación y el §6Rad-X§r reducen los RAD que absorbes; el §3Descontaminador de Jugador§r o §6Antirads§r remueven la dosis absorbida.%n%nLa §lMesotelioma§r se desarrolla de la exposición a asbesto. Los objetos que indican §c[Contiene Asbesto]§r y ciertos bloques como el Crisotilo sueltan partículas de asbesto. Progresa hasta la muerte si no se trata.%n%nEl §lPulmón Negro§r se desarrolla de la exposición al polvo de carbón. Minar minerales de carbón y sujetar objetos que indican §c[Polvo de Carbón]§r son las principales fuentes. También es fatal.%n%nUna máscara antigás protege contra la mesotelioma y el pulmón negro al mismo tiempo. Ambas enfermedades son curadas por §6Medicamento contra el cáncer SIOX§r o, al inicio del juego, §6Pasta de Hierbas§r - siendo esta última más débil y teniendo efectos secundarios.

# Quest: Stirling Sawmill
betterquesting.quest._qJt02i4ST2iccmkHudKCg.name=Aserradero Stirling
betterquesting.quest._qJt02i4ST2iccmkHudKCg.desc=El §3Aserradero Stirling§r utiliza calor para cortar artículos relacionados con madera, produciendo §6Serrín§r en el proceso. El serrín puede ser utilizado para obtener §6Papel§r, y con mayor procesamiento se puede convertir en §6Carbón Vegetal§r en un §3Horno Combinado§r.

# Quest: Chainsaw
betterquesting.quest.bKzHBx2ZTBWFD1BGHBfHWg.name=Motosierra
betterquesting.quest.bKzHBx2ZTBWFD1BGHBfHWg.desc=§l§c§lMotosierra del dolor.§r%n%nAunque la §6Motosierra§r tiene una funcionalidad similar al §6hacha§r, su arsenal es mucho más variado. Por defecto la sierra simplemente mina bloques, pero también tiene dos modos adicionales de operación: §eToque de Seda§r y §eMinado de Vena (5)§r.%n%nFunciona con muchos tipos de §bcombustible líquido§r (mira la descripción de la sierra para ver la lista). Minar un bloque consume 1 mB§r de combustible.%n%nAparte de su propósito primario, la Motosierra también puede servir como un arma cuerpo a cuerpo decente, pues hace una cantidad significativa de daño y tiene los modificadores: §eMotosierra del Dolor§r y §eDecapitador§r.

# Quest: Strawberry Ice Cream
betterquesting.quest.bXgPsVSbTy6Az8yENEF99w.name=Helado de Fresa
betterquesting.quest.bXgPsVSbTy6Az8yENEF99w.desc=Imagina utilizar la misma planta química para producir ácido sulfúrico Y helado de fresa...

# Quest: Heating Oven/Firebox
betterquesting.quest.cUWyKdzATTSYaMg1MxZqYw.name=Horno de Calentamiento/Caja de Fuego
betterquesting.quest.cUWyKdzATTSYaMg1MxZqYw.desc=La §3Caja de Fuego§r y el §3Horno de Calentamiento§r son máquinas capaces de producir calor usando combustibles sólidos para cualquier máquina que requiera calor para operar.%n%n El calor se mide en §eTU§r (§eUnidades Térmicas§r).%n%nAmbas máquinas son similares en su operación. Para que puedan transmitir el calor se debe colocar una máquina encima que pueda recibir este, de tal manera que la placa térmica de cobre de la máquina receptora este sobre la placa térmica de cobre de la máquina que genera calor.%n%nUna vez construidas, estas máquinas pueden ser llenadas con combustible sólidos, el cual se consumirá hasta que se acabe o el almacenamiento de calor se llene. No se consumirá el combustible si el calor está lleno - por lo tanto, ambas máquinas son bastante eficientes conservando combustible.%n%nLa diferencia primaria entre estas dos se encuentra en la velocidad: la caja de fuego quema combustible de forma más lenta con eficiencia completa, mientras que el horno de calentamiento produce cinco veces más calor (usando el combustible ocho veces más rápido). A pesar de su ineficiencia, el horno de calentamiento es mayormente preferido por su alta producción de calor. Sin embargo no puede calentar un motor stirling, ya que su producción base (500 TU/t) sobrecargara inmediatamente el motor; el motor stirling pesado no tiene este problema.%n%nAdicionalmente, el horno de calentamiento puede recibir calor de otras máquinas productoras de calor debajo de este: se pueden apilar múltiples para maquinas que requieren mucho calor como el crisol. El calor recibido, sin embargo, es dividido a la mitad al ser transferido a la máquina superior.

# Quest: Recycling
betterquesting.quest.ceT8V2MeRz2u-FR9Uckarw.name=Reciclaje
betterquesting.quest.ceT8V2MeRz2u-FR9Uckarw.desc=Ahora, como tienes un mejor yunque, puedes empezar a §ereciclar§r algunas cosas que puede que encuentres en estructuras.

# Quest: NOT FOR CASUALS
betterquesting.quest.dvDFzAjEQVucAjcynrfkhA.name=NO APTO PARA CASUALES
betterquesting.quest.dvDFzAjEQVucAjcynrfkhA.desc=Este modpack es §cDIFÍCIL§r y constantemente recibe actualizaciones, así que prepárate para que te pateen el trasero.

# Quest: Numbers in the Corner?
betterquesting.quest.eTdu9EpCStqHAh8ubFCmQw.name=¿Números en la Esquina?
betterquesting.quest.eTdu9EpCStqHAh8ubFCmQw.desc=¿Qué pasa con los §6números en la esquina§r? Eso es el mod §dIn-Game Info (IGI)§r. Parte de la información que da es útil desde el inicio, parte de la información será útil más adelante.%n%nSi tú quieres esconderlo escribe “§6/igi disable§r"§r en el chat. Escribe "§6/igi enable§r" si quieres que vuelva a aparecer.%n%nEl comando "§6/igi config§r" abre la pantalla de configuración donde puedes controlar la posición, escala y tamaño.%n%nSi necesitas sugerencias para resolver problemas de TPS/FPS, siéntete libre de preguntar por ayuda en el Discord de NTNH.

# Quest: Dairy Processing Tank
betterquesting.quest.fkSdZg90QZ6gAvDWMSZbbQ.name=Tanque de Procesamiento Lácteo
betterquesting.quest.fkSdZg90QZ6gAvDWMSZbbQ.desc=El §3Tanque de Procesamiento Lácteo§r, aunque se puede construir temprano en el juego, es muy útil en Minmus por la producción infinita de §bLeche§r utilizando §3Bombas§r. Puede ser utilizado para procesar leche en diferentes líquidos, los cuales pueden ser utilizados para producir comida.

# Quest: Better Furnaces
betterquesting.quest.gKQiP_zES4KokMmon9bDQg.name=Mejores Hornos
betterquesting.quest.gKQiP_zES4KokMmon9bDQg.desc=El §3Horno de Ladrillo§r es casi lo mismo que el horno normal, pero puede cocinar materiales de construcción más rápido, como §6Arena§r y §6Roca§r siendo cocinados al doble de velocidad. La §6Arcilla§r y §6Arcilla de Fuego§r pueden ser cocinados al §e§rcuádruple§r de velocidad, lo que significa que puedes hacer un bloque de ladrillo completo en lo que le toma a un horno normal realizar una operación. También puede hacer §6Carbón Vegetal§r al doble de velocidad. También puede recolectar ceniza del combustible quemado.%n%n El §3Horno de Hierro§r tiene una velocidad base del §e20%%§r más rápido que un horno normal, lo que significa que puede realizar una operación en 8 segundos en vez de 10 segundos. Además de ser más rápido, solo consume combustible mientras está funcionando, así que el combustible nunca se malgasta. También tiene bonos de consumo de varios combustibles, desde un §e+25%%§r para el lignito hasta un §e+100%%§r para el combustible sólido.%n%n§dEt Futurum Requiem§r tambien trae a esta versión los hornos modernos, como el §3Ahumador§r, que cocina comida más rápido, y el §3Alto Horno§r, que cocina minerales más rápido.

# Quest: Infinite Water Sources
betterquesting.quest.gWyCk5zlQlWAPGdwFXhTaQ.name=Fuente de Agua Infinita
betterquesting.quest.gWyCk5zlQlWAPGdwFXhTaQ.desc=¿Cansado de utilizar cubetas para darle §bAgua§r a tus máquinas? ¡Intenta utilizar bombas o tanques de agua infinitos!%n%nEl §6Tanque de Agua Infinito§r dará §e50mb/t%n%nEl §6Tanque de Agua Infinito Mejorado§r dará §e500mb/t%n%nLa §6Bomba de Agua Subterránea de Vapor§r dará §e1000mb/t§r pero requiere §bVapor§r para funcionar (lo cual es obvio).

# Quest: Geological Survey
betterquesting.quest.i978VfQyRr6TncUvwFr6iA.name=Análisis Geológico
betterquesting.quest.i978VfQyRr6TncUvwFr6iA.desc=Este sistema es altamente WIP (incluyendo esta misión), así que no esperes que sea perfecto.%n%nEsta es una avanzada técnica de exploración de minerales para mineros profesionales, proporcionando información muy detallada. El §3Topógrafo Geológico§r utiliza explosiones controladas para enviar ondas sísmicas al suelo, y al analizar los ecos que regresan, crea un mapa de la densidad subterránea de minerales.%n%nAdemas del propio Topógrafo Geológico, también necesitaras lo siguiente:%n%n1. Al menos 3 §3Geófonos§r colocados en un acomodo adecuado alrededor del Topógrafo Geológico. Los Geófonos deben estar dentro del rango de 16 bloques del Topógrafo, pero sin acercarse más de 8 bloques al Topógrafo o entre sí.%n2. Suministros de §6Papel§r, §6Tinta§r y §6Pólvora§r en los recuadros apropiados del Topógrafo.%n3. Un §6Botón§r u otro medio para darle una señal de redstone al Topógrafo.%n%nEl Topógrafo puede operar en ya sea modo §emonocromo§r o §ecolor§r, selecciónalos utilizando el botón al lado de los recuadros de las tintas. El modo color provee más información sobre los tipos de minerales, pero es más caro. §2El modo monocromo solo requiere tinta negra, mientras que el modo color requiere los cuatro colores de tinta.§r%n%nCuando se cumplen todas las condiciones necesarias, el Topógrafo mostrara "§6Listo§r" en la interfaz y una sola luz verde se prendera afuera de la máquina. El Topógrafo se activa con una señal de redstone. La forma más fácil de activarlo es poner un botón al lado de la máquina.%n%n§lPreparate porque hará un ruido fuerte.§r No te preocupes; la explosión está bien contenida y no debería causar ningún daño.%n%nAnalizar los resultados e imprimir el mapa le tomará unos segundos, durante este tiempo la máquina mostrará una §aluz verde§r parpadeante. Cuando acabe, dos luces verdes aparecerán. Entonces el mapa podrá ser recolectado del recuadro de salida en la interfaz.%n%nUna §cluz roja§r indica una condición de error; abre la interfaz para encontrar más información.

# Quest: Earth? Fake news
betterquesting.quest.k52bjd5MTbefEXwVh0HLiw.name=¿Tierra? Noticias Falsas
betterquesting.quest.k52bjd5MTbefEXwVh0HLiw.desc=¡Este modpack hace posible que se pueda completar el juego entero en §6modo Marciano§r! Si descubres algún hoyo en la progresión o lógica, por favor ponlo en el canal #help en el servidor de DIscord de NTNH.

# Quest: Oily Sand
betterquesting.quest.kdNKd7NDSPiURFtLonc50g.name=Arena Aceitosa
betterquesting.quest.kdNKd7NDSPiURFtLonc50g.desc=La §6Arena Aceitosa§r es un bloque superficial que se genera junto con la arena normal, típicamente en desiertos. Actúa como un marcador para depósitos de §bPetróleo en Bedrock§r directamente debajo de esta - si la encuentras, hay petróleo debajo.%n%nPuede ser molida en una §3Moledora§r en §6Residuo de Petróleo§r, el cual puede ser procesado para obtener §6Arsénico§r - un material muy importante a la mitad del juego.

# Quest: Highway To Hell
betterquesting.quest.ljMurUJIT7OuwaBx_fb3EA.name=Highway To Hell
betterquesting.quest.ljMurUJIT7OuwaBx_fb3EA.desc=§6El infierno§r esta §c§lVERDADERAMENTE CALIENTE§r causando que tu piel arda.%n%nEl §6Traje de Protección contra Fuego§r es esencial para tu primer viaje al infierno, pues te protege del fuego abrasador.

# Quest: Blood Moon
betterquesting.quest.npgCRfZdSFeBom6eL3qIMg.name=Luna de Sangre
betterquesting.quest.npgCRfZdSFeBom6eL3qIMg.desc=§dRandomThings§r añade §cLunas de Sangre§r, eventos poco frecuentes donde la generación de monstruos incrementa y el jugador no puede dormir. Las Lunas de Sangre pueden ser muy útiles, si estás preparado, pues los monstruos raros pueden soltar §6Códigos de Lanzamiento§r y los §6Contadores Geiger§r pueden ser obtenidos de forma temprana.

# Quest: The Actual Beginning
betterquesting.quest.npi9qvVzRleG6SsA5DQozg.name=El Comienzo Real
betterquesting.quest.npi9qvVzRleG6SsA5DQozg.desc=¡Ahora estás listo para comenzar el viaje de verdad por este modpack! ¡Feliz juego!

# Quest: Pneumatic Pipes
betterquesting.quest.pTXtLJnPRu6lyiOqGVP7lw.name=Tuberías Neumáticas
betterquesting.quest.pTXtLJnPRu6lyiOqGVP7lw.desc=Las §3Tuberías Neumáticas§r son una forma instantánea de transportar objetos que puede cubrir largas distancias. Las tuberías deben contener un gas comprimido para funcionar.%n%nSe requiere un §6Destornillador§r para crear conexiones, y hacer click derecho en una conexión con un identificador de fluido para seleccionar el gas que usara.

# Quest: Graphite
betterquesting.quest.pbwyXfgDRaCxA1R8YmlTIQ.name=Grafito
betterquesting.quest.pbwyXfgDRaCxA1R8YmlTIQ.desc=El §6Grafito§r es un alótropo cristalino del carbono, que consiste de capas de grafeno unas encima de otras. El grafito es la forma más estable del carbono y es muy útil en muchos entornos. Su habilidad para moderar neutrones lo hace indispensable para los §3reactores nucleares§r que dependen de neutrones térmicos para mantener criticalidad. Su habilidad para soportar altas temperaturas y su conductividad eléctrica lo hacen útil en electrodos en el §3Horno de Arco§r y el §3Soldador de Arco§r.

# Quest: From Flint to Oil - USA Simulator
betterquesting.quest.rKlGBLXDR2CgX_rUy5rBVw.name=Del Pedernal al Petróleo - Simulador de Estados Unidos
betterquesting.quest.rKlGBLXDR2CgX_rUy5rBVw.desc=El §6Detector de Yacimientos de Petróleo§r te ayudará en tu búsqueda por un §eYacimiento de Petróleo§r señalándolo en el chat.

# Quest: Long Distance Energy Transportation
betterquesting.quest.s8lSFTDKSpqK44PLhdfusw.name=Transportación de Energía a Larga Distancia
betterquesting.quest.s8lSFTDKSpqK44PLhdfusw.desc=Para grandes distancias, y una mejor estética, un nuevo nodo de distribución está disponible, la §3Torre de Alta Tensión§r.%n%nLas §3Subestaciones§r son necesarias para elevar/reducir el voltaje que las líneas transmiten.%n%nEstas torres pueden ser útiles pues puede el §eMineral de Bedrock§r favorable o los §eYacimientos de Petróleos§r estén lejos de tu base principal.%n

# Quest: Primitive Crucible
betterquesting.quest.wSdG_vGlTD-9Q8OW6Bzeiw.name=Crisol Primitivo
betterquesting.quest.wSdG_vGlTD-9Q8OW6Bzeiw.desc=El §3Crisol§r es un bloque de §dEx Nihilo§r usado para derretir bloques sólidos y volverlos líquidos. Es construido primero como un §6Crisol sin Cocer§r hecho de §6Arcilla de Porcelana§r, entonces es cocinado en un horno para hacer un §3Crisol§r utilizable.%n%nPara operarlo, coloca el §3Crisol§r encima de una fuente de calor y has click con un bloque elegible para cargarlo. El bloque lentamente se fundirá a un fluido con el tiempo. La velocidad de derretimiento depende completamente de la fuente de calor debajo - las fuentes de calor más fuertes derriten más rápido. La §6Netherrack§r en llamas es una de las fuentes normales más eficientes.%n%nEl producto primario es §blava§r, producida al fundir piedra, roca y bloques similares. El §3Crisol§r puede contener fluidos de manera indefinida, haciéndolo un contenedor de fluidos barato en un apuro. Vacíalo utilizando tuberías conectadas a los lados o la parte de abajo.%n%n§2Una pila de Crisoles sobre Netherrack en llamas es una granja de lava infinita confiable para el inicio.

# Quest: Air Intake
betterquesting.quest.yFAvMtetRDaFwz6i_ry-RQ.name=Toma de Aire
betterquesting.quest.yFAvMtetRDaFwz6i_ry-RQ.desc=La §3Toma de Aire§r, cuando energizada, produce §bAire Comprimido§r necesitado para las §3Tuberías Neumáticas§r y el §bChorro de Aire Caliente§r.

# Quest: Silkworm
betterquesting.quest.yfQ7hs9tTwSE5FpNCoeGAA.name=Gusano de Seda
betterquesting.quest.yfQ7hs9tTwSE5FpNCoeGAA.desc=Los §6Gusanos de Seda§r son objetos de §dEx Nihilo§r y la forma primaria de producir §6Hilo§r en mapas donde los recursos son limitados. No pueden ser construidos - la única manera de conseguir uno es como un drop raro al romper hojas con un §6Cayado§r.%n%nPara usar un §6Gusano de Seda§r, has click derecho con él en cualquier bloque de hojas. Las hojas lentamente se volverán infestadas, volviéndose blancas con el tiempo, y la infestación se esparcirá por si sola a las hojas adyacentes. Las hojas completamente blancas producen más §6Hilo§r que las parcialmente infestadas, así que vale la pena esperar.%n%nUna vez que las hojas estan completamente infestadas, rómpelas con un §6Cayado§r o tu puño para recolectar §6Hilo§r y §6Gusanos de Seda§r adicionales, manteniendo el proceso renovable. Toma en cuenta que las hojas infestadas no sueltan brotes o manzanas, así que conserva algunos brotes de repuesto antes de%ninfestar un arbol.%n%n§2Los gusanos de seda también pueden ser compostados en un Barril si tienes de sobra.

# Quest: Industrial Hemp & Mustard Willow
betterquesting.quest.ztJLZeOsSq6hpRyKY55CDg.name=Cáñamo Industrial y Sauce Mostaza
betterquesting.quest.ztJLZeOsSq6hpRyKY55CDg.desc=Caminando por el mundo, puede que encuentres un §6Sauce Mostaza§r en un bloque de tierra muerta o §6Aceitosa§r. El sauce en sí no será necesitado en el futuro cercano, pero es mejor recolectarlo y la tierra debajo de él.%n%nEl §6Cáñamo Industrial§r es utilizado para hacer cuerdas, hilo y biomasa.


## Quest Line: LV2 - Oil Age
betterquesting.questline.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAQ.name=NV2 - Edad del Petróleo
betterquesting.questline.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAQ.desc=Procesa petróleo y comienza la extracción de mineral de Bedrock. Este capítulo gira en torno al refinamiento de petróleo, así como la creación de plásticos, circuitos más avanzados y otros materiales fuertes.

# Quest: Balefire
betterquesting.quest.8OusetROQiyH-66QbewmNQ.name=Balefire
betterquesting.quest.8OusetROQiyH-66QbewmNQ.desc=El §6Balefire§r es una sustancia extremadamente radioactiva que puede ser usada para crear poderosos combustibles para el 3RBMK§r, así como §bCombustible BF de Cohetes§r para producir energía. Equipamiento de alta resistencia a la radiación es necesario para sujetar el objeto. §6Cenizas Termonucleares§r pueden ser producidas de manera sostenible como un subproducto de §bAntimateria - Combustible BF de Cohetes§r.%n%nEl Dispositivo de Alta Tecnología para Desactivar Bombas puede extraer fragmentos de Balefire de los duds.

# Quest: Delinquent 2: Delinquent Harder
betterquesting.quest.8R4pAa2BSWGGBdYOaobEMA.name=Delincuente 2: Delinque Más
betterquesting.quest.8R4pAa2BSWGGBdYOaobEMA.desc=Sé más malo.

# Quest: Aluminium Processing
betterquesting.quest.8Z2F5EPIRPGvasjKDWd4tA.name=Procesamiento de Aluminio
betterquesting.quest.8Z2F5EPIRPGvasjKDWd4tA.desc=La §6Bauxita§r y §6Criolita§r pueden ser aún más procesadas para obtener §6Aluminio§r, con subproductos adicionales de §6Hierro§r, §6Titanio§r y §bMercurio§r.

# Quest: Cyclotron
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA1g.name=Ciclotrón
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA1g.desc=El §3Ciclotrón§r es una máquina que bombardea polvos de elementos con cajas de elementos para obtener elementos más pesados. Operar esta máquina consumirá§e 20MHE/s§r.%n%nTambien puede crear §bAntimateria§r como un subproducto de ciertas operaciones, lo que lo hace una confiable pero cara forma de producir materiales avanzados a gran escala.%n%n§2Considera instalar la mayor mejora de ahorro de energía y velocidad para reducir el tiempo de las recetas y consumo de energía.§r

# Quest: Desh Servo Set
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACw.name=Servomotores de Desh
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACw.desc=Los §6Servomotores de Desh§r son modificadores de armadura los cuales dan mejoras increíblemente poderosas al usarse, como aumentar la fuerza, velocidad de minado y el salto.

# Quest: M1TTY Environment Suit
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADg.name=Traje de Entorno M1TTY
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADg.desc=El §6Traje de Entorno M1TTY§r es una barata armadura eléctrica que viene con muchas habilidades. Es una armadura excelente para explorar pues viene con mejoras de velocidad muy elevadas así como velocidad de nadado.

# Quest: Antimatter
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGw.name=Antimateria
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGw.desc=La §bAntimateria§r es una peligrosa sustancia que puede ser obtenida de un §3Ciclotrón§r o un §3Acelerador de Partículas§r. Si se tira al suelo ocurrirá una explosión violenta. La antimateria no puede ser almacenada en tanques normales, por lo tanto, un§3Contenedor Magnético de Antimateria§r es requerido.

# Quest: Electric Arc Furnace
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHg.name=Horno de Arco Eléctrico
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHg.desc=El §3Horno de Arco Eléctrico§r es un gran horno automático multibloque que puede cumplir el rol de un §3Crisol§r y horno automático, y se requiere para la progresión pues es la única máquina que puede producir §6Silicio§r de varias fuentes, como §6Arena§r, §6Pedernal§r, §6Fibra de Vidrio§r y §6Asbesto§r.%n%nPara operar la máquina, requerirá energía eléctrica y fabricar §7§6Electrodos§r. En términos de electricidad, la máquina tiene una capacidad de almacenamiento máxima de §e2.5MHE§r y consume §e20kHE/s§r en funcionamiento, haciéndola razonablemente hambrienta de energía. En términos de electrodos requeridos para el funcionamiento, hay cuatro tipos disponibles y la máquina debe tener tres instalados antes de que pueda funcionar.%n%nLa máquina puede operar en dos modos diferentes: Modo Solido, el cual es el más fácil de manejar y automatizar, bueno para fabricación inicial, y el Modo Liquido, el cual produce minerales fundidos que pueden ser moldeados como en el Crisol, con un pequeño bonus de producto, incrementando la eficiencia de extracción de varios minerales.

# Quest: Integrated Circuit Board
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIA.name=Placa de Circuito Integrado
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIA.desc=La §6Placa de Circuito Integrado§r es la primera placa de circuito que utiliza §6Silicio§r, siendo utilizada de forma extensiva a través de la mitad del juego en máquinas, dispositivos de automatización, misiles y varias pequeñas herramientas como el §6Contador Geiger§r.

# Quest: Military Grade Circuit Board
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIw.name=Placa Base de Grado Militar
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIw.desc=La §6Placa Base de Grado Militar§r es una Placa Base avanzada utilizada en máquinas más complejas como la §3Centrifugadora de Gas§r.

# Quest: Impact Drill
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKQ.name=Taladro de Impacto
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKQ.desc=El §6Taladro de Impacto§r es un pico eléctrico que viene con encantamientos ya integrados y habilidades. Es una herramienta muy útil que hace la minería más eficiente.%n%nHerramientas eléctricas similares existen para el hacha y la pala.

# Quest: Derrick
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKw.name=Torre de Perforación
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKw.desc=La §3Torre de Perforación§r extrae §bPetróleo Crudo§r y §6§bGas Natural§r de §eYacimientos de Petróleo§r que están directamente debajo de esta. Cuando se le suministra energía, empezara a taladrar hacia abajo hasta que no puede perforar más o alcanza un yacimiento de petróleo. Al alcanzar un yacimiento, extraerá petróleo y gas continuamente hasta que el yacimiento este completamente agotado.

# Quest: Bedrock Ore Processing
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALA.name=Procesamiento de Mineral de Bedrock
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALA.desc=Los §eYacimientos minerales de Bedrock§r son una fuente infinita de recursos que puede ser obtenida utilizando una §3Gran Perforadora Minera§r y un §3Procesador de Mineral de Bedrock§r.%n%nOperar la perforadora consumirá§e 200kHE/s§r.%n%nAntes de que la excavación pueda ocurrir, la §eRoca Profunda§r cubriendo el yacimiento mineral de bedrock debe ser removida. Una forma fácil de hacerlo es explotar la roca con §6Cargas Explosivas para Minería§r.%n%nLa gran perforadora minera es utilizada para excavar §6Mineral de Bedrock en Bruto§r del yacimiento. El taladro requiere una §6Broca§r para funcionar§r, la cual puede ser mejorada para aumentar la velocidad a la que opera. §eFortuna§r en la broca afecta la calidad del mineral de bedrock en bruto, cada nivel de fortuna añade §e10%%§r del valor del objeto.%n%nEl procesador de mineral de bedrock toma §6mineral de bedrock en bruto§r obtenido del taladro y lo rompe en piezas más pequeñas, cada una con diferentes productos que pueden ser obtenidos de ellas. %n§a§bLodo Mineral§r, el cual es creado cuando la máquina está en funcionamiento, puede ser procesado en muchos productos útiles, especialmente cuando es pasado a través de una §3Máquina de Electrólisis§r.%n%nEl §6Escáner de Densidad de Mineral de Bedrock§r muestra información de la composición de los yacimientos de Mineral de Bedrock.%n%nEl procesamiento de mineral de bedrock puede ser una operación costosa tanto en energía como en recursos así que se recomienda que sea explorada después de conseguir una buena infraestructura.%n%n§2Considere añadir una mejora de ahorro de energía a la perforadora pues esta solo reduce la energía sin afectar la velocidad de minado. Adicionalmente. instalar una mejora de efectividad en el procesador de minerales hará que genere más recursos.§r§r

# Quest: Basic Oil Processing
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALw.name=Procesamiento Básico de Petróleo
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALw.desc=Antes de que el §bPetróleo Crudo§r pueda ser procesado, este debe ser calentado en una §3Caldera§r.%n%nLa §3Refinería de Petróleo§r separa Petróleo Crudo Caliente(o después el §bCraqueado§r) en cuatro productos líquidos diferentes y un subproducto sólido.%n%nDespués de eso, esos fluidos pueden ser pasados por una §3Torre de Fraccionamiento§r para obtener diferentes tipos de combustibles, como §bQueroseno§r y §bDiesel§r. Un §3Separador de Torre de Fraccionamiento§r puede ser colocado para apilar torres de fraccionamiento unas encima de otras.%n

# Quest: Polymer
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOg.name=Polímero
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOg.desc=El §6Polímero§r es un material plástico básico necesitado para muchas recetas. Algunos usos importantes son la §3Centrifugadora§r, la §3Torre de Craqueo Catalítico§r y el §3Horno de Arco Eléctrico§r.

# Quest: Catalytic Cracking Tower
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOw.name=Torre de Craqueo Catalítico
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOw.desc=La §3Torre de Craqueo Catalítico§r es una gran máquina multibloque de procesamiento de petróleo que produce muchos fluidos, como los §bHidrocarburos Aromáticos§r usados para hacer §6Baquelita§r.

# Quest: Desh Anvil
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPA.name=Yunque de Desh
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPA.desc=Una versión mejorada del §3Yunque§r, [Nv3], el cual desbloquea recetas adicionales.%n%nAlternativamente, el §3Yunque de Desh§r puede ser omitido al hacer un §3Yunque de Ferrouranio§r, [Nv4], con §e§r§6Uranio-238§r encontrado en estructuras.

# Quest: Industrial Boiler
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPw.name=Caldera Industrial
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPw.desc=La §3Caldera Industrial§r es una versión mejorada de la Caldera la cual puede almacenar una cantidad mayor de líquido. Adicionalmente, esta no explota.

# Quest: Rubber
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAQA.name=Caucho
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAQA.desc=El §6Caucho§r es un material esencial utilizado en varias recetas de crafteo. Es creado en una §3Planta Química§r con §bHidrocarburos Insaturados§r obtenidos de una §3Torre de Craqueo Catalítico§r.%n%nEl §6Látex§r es una alternativa al caucho que puede ser utilizada en varias recetas en lugar del caucho normal. Puede ser creado de forma temprana utilizando una §3Prensa de Quemador§r para procesar dientes de león o madera de jungla.%n%n§2En NTM: Space se requiere petróleo craqueado para obtener tu primer pieza de caucho.

# Quest: Bakelite
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAQQ.name=Baquelita
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAQQ.desc=La §6Baquelita§r es una alternativa al polímero que puede ser utilizada en las mismas recetas. Ya que no requiere §6Polvo de Carbón§r o §6Fluorita§r para hacerse. Es más fácil y conveniente de automatizar que el §6Polímero§r.

# Quest: Desh
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAQg.name=Desh
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAQg.desc=El §6Desh§r es una aleación hecha de 9 metales de tierras raras para hacer su forma de mezcla, la cual se solidifica y refina utilizando §bMercurio§r y §bPetróleo ligero§r en la §3Planta Química§r. El Desh es un material casi indestructible y por eso sus herramientas tienen durabilidad infinita. %n%nEl §a§2Desh también se puede hacer utilizando DeshReady™ en un Horno Rotatorio, o más adelante, en un Acidificador de Mineral.§r%n%nEl mercurio en esta etapa del juego puede ser obtenido centrifugando §eMena de Redstone§r o poniendo §eCinabrio§r en un §3Horno Combinado§r. Grandes vetas de cinabrio pueden ser encontradas como mineral profundo.%n%nMas adelante, el mercurio puede ser obtenido del procesamiento de §bLodo Mineral§r o §bVitriolo§r en un §3Electrolizador§r.

# Quest: Industrial Steam Turbine
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAARA.name=Turbina de Vapor Industrial
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAARA.desc=La §3Turbina de Vapor Industrial§r es una máquina multibloque la cual es una versión mucho más grande y poderosa de la §3Turbina de Vapor§r regular. Tiene una eficiencia del §e100%%§r y la generación de energía aumenta lentamente mientras se le suministra §bVapor§r y disminuye lentamente cuando se deja de suministrar.

# Quest: Coker Unit
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAARQ.name=Unidad de Coquización
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAARQ.desc=La §3Unidad de Coquización§r es una máquina que convierte los productos petrolíferos en §6Coque de Petróleo§r, es cual es igual a los otros tipos de coque, también produce subproductos líquidos adicionales. La unidad de coquización requerirá una fuente de calor externa para funcionar, similar al §3Crisol§r.%n%n§2§r§2Junto al §2§r§2§r§2Horno de Arco Eléctrico, la unidad de coquización es una de las máquinas que más contamina en todo el mod. Esta esparce 20 hollín por segundo, haciéndola una máquina peligrosa de usar al lado de un nido de glífidos.

# Quest: Auxilary Cooling Tower
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAASA.name=Torre Auxiliar de Enfriamiento
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAASA.desc=La §3Torre Auxiliar de Enfriamiento§r es la versión grande del Condensador de Vapor capaz de procesar hasta 50 mb/t de §bVapor de Baja Presión§r.

# Quest: Refinery Power
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAASw.name=Poder de Refinería
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAASw.desc=Los derivados del petróleo pueden ser quemados para producir cantidades masivas de energía.%n%nEl §3Motor de Combustión Industrial§r quema combustibles, como el §bAceite de Calefacción§r o §bDiesel§r para producir energía. Existen varios juegos de pistones, los cuales son necesarios para que el motor funcione, cada uno dando diferentes mejoras de eficiencia a los grados de combustible.%n%nEl §4§3Turboventilador§r es el mejor para utilizar combustibles de tipo aeronáutico, como el §bQueroseno§r, pues provee §e100%%§r de eficiencia energética. ¡Ten cuidado de no pararte en frente de este mientras está en funcionamiento!%n%nLa §3Turbina de Gas de Ciclo Combinado§r es el único generador que puede quemar combustibles gaseosos con §e100%%§r de eficiencia. La TGCC usa §3§bLubricante de Motor§r, y produce §bVapor Denso§r.%n%nLa §3Chimenea de Antorcha§r es usada para quemar gases como los §bHidrocarburos Insaturados§r para producir energía, así como lidiar con el exceso de fluidos.%n%nEl §3Quemador de Fluidos§r es una manera mucho más eficiente de producir energía con gases. Coloca una §3Caldera§r encima y pasa el §bVapor§r a través de una turbina para producir energía.%n%nCosidera instalar un §6Silenciador§r en algunas de estas máquinas pues son muy ruidosas. Has shift-click en una máquina mientras sujetas un silenciador para colocarlo.

# Quest: Pumpjack
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAATg.name=Unidad de Bombeo
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAATg.desc=La §3Unidad de Bombeo§r es como la §3Torre de Perforación Petrolífera§r pero más eficiente pues extrae 750mb de §bPetróleo Crudo§r y una cantidad aleatoria de §bGas Natural§r entre 50 y 250mb en un ciclo de 1.25 segundos. Este agota un solo bloque de un depósito de petróleo después de extraer un numero aleatorio de ciclos de petróleo que es el doble de largo en promedio comparado con la Torre de Perforación.%n%nEn total, esto significa que la unidad de bombeo es en promedio x3 más eficiente extrayendo petróleo y x3 más rápida al extraer mientras produce la misma cantidad de gas natural que la torre de perforación.

# Quest: Ore Acidizer
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAATw.name=Acidificador de Minerales
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAATw.desc=El §3Acidificador de Minerales§r es una máquina muy útil, utilizado para procesar varios objetos de utilidad, multiplicar minerales y más. Funciona con electricidad y requieres varios solventes dependiendo del objeto. El acidificador es una máquina hambrienta de energía, consume §e20kHE/s§r. %n%n

# Quest: Hydraulic Fracking Tower
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAUQ.name=Torre de Fracturación Hidráulica
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAUQ.desc=La §3Torre de Fracturación Hidráulica§r se utiliza para extraer petróleo infinito de §eYacimientos Petrolíferos de Bedrock§r. Para operar, la máquina necesita §bSolución para Fracking§r. Durante su funcionamiento, entorno circundante sufrirá daños considerables. §6Tierra Aceitosa§r y §6Arena Aceitosa§r pueden ser utilizadas para crear §6Arsénico§r, un sustituto del §6Bismuto§r.%n%nOperar la torre de fracturación hidráulica consumirá §e100kHE/s§r.

# Quest: Centrifuge
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAUg.name=Centrifugadora
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAUg.desc=La §6§3Centrifugadora§r permite la separación de minerales, extrayendo más recursos que los métodos usuales de minería. También separa los objetos en sus respectivos componentes. Adicionalmente, se utilizan en el procesamiento de §e§6Mineral de Bedrock§r.%n%nOperar la centrifugadora consumirá §e4kHE/s§r.

# Quest: Electric Groundwater Pump
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAUw.name=Bomba Eléctrica de Agua Subterránea
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAUw.desc=La §3Bomba Eléctrica de Agua§r puede ser utilizada para generar §bAgua§r rápidamente, haciéndola muy útil para llenar grandes §3Tanques§r y reactores. La bomba requiere un cubo de 3x3 de tierra directamente debajo de esta y debe estar debajo de Y:70, de otro modo no funcionará.

# Quest: Industrial Solidification Machine
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAVw.name=Máquina de Solidificación Industrial
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAVw.desc=La §3Máquina de Solidificación Industrial§r es una máquina de uso general para la solidificación de varios fluidos. Un producto importante de esta máquina es el §6Alquitrán§r, el cual es usado para crear §3Tanques§r.

# Quest: Industrial Liquification Machine
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAWA.name=Máquina de Licuefacción Industrial
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAWA.desc=La §3Máquina de Licuefacción Industrial§r es una máquina de uso general para la licuefacción de varios objetos. Se vuelve muy útil en la generación de roca, y por lo tanto la automatización del §6Silicio§r.

# Quest: Tank
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAXg.name=Tanque
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAXg.desc=Los §3Tanques§r y §3Barriles§r son útiles dispositivos de almacenamiento que pueden contener diferentes fluidos en varias cantidades. Cada tanque y barril soporta contener diferentes tipos de fluidos corrosivos, calientes o exóticos, y saber cuál puede contener el fluido que tú quieres puede ser vital para tu planta de procesamiento de fluidos o almacén.%n%nLos tanques pueden contener hasta 256,000mb de fluido, mientras que un barril de acero puede contener hasta 16,000.%n%n§4§2Los tanques no pueden contener fluidos altamente corrosivos o antimateria y por lo tanto se requerirá respectivamente un Tanque Enorme o un Tanque Magnético.

# Quest: Geiger Counter
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAXw.name=Contador Geiger
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAXw.desc=El §6Contador Geiger§r es un dispositivo utilizado para medir §eRAD/s§r, con el fin de informar al jugador de cualquier radiación eventual. Es una mejora del §6Dosímetro§r. Puede medir tres tipos diferentes de radiación, esos tipos siendo radiación de chunk, radiación ambiental y contaminación del jugador.%n%nPuede ser utilizado en una de dos formas, ya sea como un objeto que se puede llevar en la mano o en su forma de bloque.%n%nTeniendolo en el inventario mostrara un medidor en la parte inferior izquierda de la pantalla y hacer click derecho mientras se sujeta mandara un mensaje al chat mostrando las diferentes dosis de radiación.%n%nTambien hará click cuando detecte cualquier tipo de radiación, una función característica de cualquier dosímetro.

# Quest: Survey Scanner
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAYA.name=Escáner de Reconocimiento
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAYA.desc=El §6Escáner de Reconocimiento§r es un dispositivo portable que señalara depósitos de recursos subterráneos, como §eRoca Profunda§r y §eMineral de Bedrock§r.

# Quest: Launch Pad
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAaw.name=Plataforma de Lanzamiento
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAaw.desc=La §3Plataforma de Lanzamiento§r es la principal zona de despegue para la mayoría de los misiles. Aunque es la más accesible al inicio, los misiles deben ser erguidos antes del lanzamiento, resultando en un pequeño retraso.%n%nLa §3Plataforma de Lanzamiento de Silo§r es una versión miniaturizada de la plataforma de lanzamiento. Puede lanzar cualquier misil genérico con un retraso de solo 5 segundos. Una versión oxidada puede ser encontrada en la estructura de silo que se genera de forma natural, sosteniendo el misil Doomsday dañado.

# Quest: Transport Drones
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAdg.name=Drones de Transporte
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAdg.desc=Los §3Drones de Transporte§r son máquinas voladoras las cuales transportan líquidos y objetos entre dos contenedores diferentes. El dron no requiere energía y puede transportar hacia abajo y hacia arriba. §3Puntos de Ruta§r pueden ser usados para crear un mejor camino para que el dron de transporte se mueva.

# Quest: Electrolysis Machine
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAzA.name=Máquina de Electrólisis
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAzA.desc=La §3Máquina de Electrólisis§r permite la separación de elementos de los fluidos y el procesamiento avanzado de minerales, haciéndola una máquina importante en el procesamiento de minerales. Operar la máquina consume §e200kHE/s§r.%n%nLa máquina de electrólisis tiene 2 funciones: una para la separación de fluidos y una para el procesamiento de minerales.%n%nEn el primer modo, la máquina tomara un fluido compatible y lo separara en otros 2 fluidos.%n%nEn el segundo modo, requerirá §bÁcido Nítrico§r y procesara cualquier cristal de derivado mineral, permitiendo obtener la mayor ganancia del mineral. Hay dos productos, para el producto fundido principal la boquilla marcada de verde y para el producto secundario la roja, a parte de un subproducto que se mantiene en forma de objeto. Las boquillas siguen las mismas mecánicas del §3Crisol§r.%n%n§2Considera instalar una mejora de ahorro de energía por encima del nivel 2 en la máquina de electrólisis pues reduce significativamente el consumo de energía con solo una penalización mínima de reducción de velocidad.

# Quest: Semtex
betterquesting.quest.D6A-to-oSe29nf5qIu4h_w.name=Semtex
betterquesting.quest.D6A-to-oSe29nf5qIu4h_w.desc=§6Semtex§r is an explosive that is used in conjunction with C-4 in many crafts.%n%nSemtex is used in many crafts of various ammunition and mines, such as the §6Stinger missile§r, §6anti-personnel mines§r, and so on. In all crafts that use Semtex (except, of course, the Semtex block and Semtex bar, as well as the explosive reactive armor plate), it can be replaced with a C-4 bar.%n%nIt is used to create the bomb of the same name.%n%n§2Semtex can be eaten, making you feel like a real American soldier.§r

# Quest: Microchip
betterquesting.quest.Lc9HRIDwRZa0u-M3Ze6ZiQ.name=Microchip
betterquesting.quest.Lc9HRIDwRZa0u-M3Ze6ZiQ.desc=§6Microchips§r are one of the most important components of future circuits and will be used in bulk throughout progression.

# Quest: Fiberglass
betterquesting.quest.Q3y_TPhGTWe6JvLSRDrfBw.name=Fiberglass
betterquesting.quest.Q3y_TPhGTWe6JvLSRDrfBw.desc=Sand in an §3Ore Acidizer§r can be turned into §6Fiberglass§r, which provides more than §e4x§r the amount of §6Silicon§r in an §3Arc Furnace§r. Additionally, it provides a great recipe for insulators.

# Quest: Powered Drill
betterquesting.quest.UWNifpoeQfypMwfGniM40w.name=Powered Drill
betterquesting.quest.UWNifpoeQfypMwfGniM40w.desc=The §6Powered Drill§r is a modular mining device which can make resourse gathering and excavation much faster than normal pickaxes. %n%nVarious modifications can be attached in the §3Weapon Modification Table§r, such as new drillbits for a larger mining radious or even new engines, which let it run on electricity.

# Quest: Redstone Fluid Overflow
betterquesting.quest.ZTrtIRiyRO2J5jHQ4sroaQ.name=Redstone Fluid Overflow
betterquesting.quest.ZTrtIRiyRO2J5jHQ4sroaQ.desc=§6§6§3Redstone-Over Radio§r in combination with a §3Redstone Fluid Valve§r can be used to detect when a tank is starting to fill up, and release the insides. This is useful for having buffers without having all the fluids being wasted.%n%n§2Here is an exmaple of a tank that will only output fluid once its full:§r%n%nFirstly, place a §6ROR Transmitter§r on one port of the tank, provide an ID and enable Polling.%n%n[img height=1000]betterquesting:textures/QB_Fluid1.png[/img]%n%nAfter that, place a §6ROR Logic Receiver§r next to the fluid valve and input the desired settings. Make sure that your signal is >= of your desired buffer. One redstone level equals to 16k mb.%n%n[img height=1000]betterquesting:textures/QB_Fluid2.png[/img]%n%nA §3Fluid Control Pump§r can also be used to limit throughput of fluids and to also add priorities.

# Quest: Jetpack
betterquesting.quest.l6zSmdfhSw6aTqiJsNDiHg.name=Jetpack
betterquesting.quest.l6zSmdfhSw6aTqiJsNDiHg.desc=The §6Jetpack§r can be used to travel upwards. It can be upgraded to unlock additional abilities, and can be equiped as an armor modification.

# Quest: Solid Fuel
betterquesting.quest.l7cvDxEiTg6v1RvTk-ynTw.name=Solid Fuel
betterquesting.quest.l7cvDxEiTg6v1RvTk-ynTw.desc=§6Solid Fuel§r is a compact solidified petroleum product with superior burn time and heat output compared to coal. Essential for advanced furnace operations and rocket propulsion systems.

# Quest: Delinquent
betterquesting.quest.nwCUMdHpQjykUlIVNW7Bcw.name=Delinquent
betterquesting.quest.nwCUMdHpQjykUlIVNW7Bcw.desc=Be mean.

# Quest: Teleporter
betterquesting.quest.refh8r3gQyavrC4KgSeWkw.name=Teleporter
betterquesting.quest.refh8r3gQyavrC4KgSeWkw.desc=The §3Teleporter§r can be used to teleport players, and entities in general, to a specific location.%n%nRight-click a block with the §6Telelinker§r to set the desired exit position, then shift-click the teleporter with the telelinker to configure the teleporter.%n%n§2The teleporter is a one way trip so it is advised that multiple are made.%n%nInterdimensional teleportation using teleporters requires a very expensive type of fuel, so it is recommended that other teleportations methods are used, such as AE2 Spatial.

# Quest: Pinwheels
betterquesting.quest.t6tkjZliTEKxH0W6y39auQ.name=Pinwheels
betterquesting.quest.t6tkjZliTEKxH0W6y39auQ.desc=The §6Chlorine Pinwheel§r is a yellow propeller capable of producing chlorine indefinitely.%nAcquisition%n%nIt cannot be crafted, but can be found in structures (e.g., in a starship).%n%nThe chlorine spinner is an endless source of §bChlorine§r; to use it, simply place it in a container slot (e.g., in a barrel). The item will produce chlorine indefinitely, although the production rate is low (1 mb/t or 20 mb/s).%n%nThe §6Oxygen Pinwheel§r is analogous to the Chlorine Pinwheel, producing §bOxygen§r instead of §bChlorine§r.

# Quest: Precision Assembly Machine
betterquesting.quest.tKyjXZ3KQa6y3FLlxcC2_A.name=Precision Assembly Machine
betterquesting.quest.tKyjXZ3KQa6y3FLlxcC2_A.desc=The §3Precision Assembly Machine§r is a machine which can produce §6Blueprints§r. Due to the recipes having a low success rate, automation of the ingredient is recommended.%n%nPufferfish can be obtained from throwing §6Fishing Dynamite§r in water.

# Quest: Weapon Steel
betterquesting.quest.xADm9gLETmCgiS3amOTUcQ.name=Weapon Steel
betterquesting.quest.xADm9gLETmCgiS3amOTUcQ.desc=§6Weapon steel§r is a steel alloy made by further refining steel in a §3Rotary Furnace§r. As its name implies, it is used in the crafting of weapons and ammunition. It is the next tier of weapons grade alloy after §6Gunmetal§r.

# Quest: Mining Laser
betterquesting.quest.zYS6AlyFSuuMUErAJqPcTg.name=Mining Laser
betterquesting.quest.zYS6AlyFSuuMUErAJqPcTg.desc=The §3Mining Laser§r is a laser drill which can be used to quickly dig large areas. It has a §e100 MHE§r internal power buffer and a 64,000mB internal §bCrude Oil§r buffer. Its default radius is 3, which can be increased by the use of an effectiveness upgrade. It can also be equiped with various upgrades to unlock new functions such as shredding or voiding.


## Quest Line: LV3 - Reactors Age
betterquesting.questline.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAg.name=LV3 - Reactors Age
betterquesting.questline.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAg.desc=As energy needs increase, more powerful energy sources will be needed. This chapter covers Nuclear Reactors aswell as other advanced machines needed to produce ever stronger materials.

# Quest: Tungsten Carbide
betterquesting.quest.-KF6RRqRSdG58hgsbtwsgg.name=Tungsten Carbide
betterquesting.quest.-KF6RRqRSdG58hgsbtwsgg.desc=§6Tungsten Carbide§r is an alloy made from §6Tungsten§r and §bSyngas§r in a §3Pyrolysis Oven§r. It is mainly used in crafting neutron reflectors for reactors and nukes.

# Quest: Plasma Forge
betterquesting.quest.29WtP39ZRSClYLinoAxQpQ.name=Plasma Forge
betterquesting.quest.29WtP39ZRSClYLinoAxQpQ.desc=The §3Plasma Forge§r is a large and advanced assembler that requires a running fusion reactor to work. It can weld plates at twice the speed of a normal welder. It does not accept upgrades, however, it can use up otherwise useless fission fragments and unstable isotopes to gain a temporary §ex4§r speed bonus with no penalty.

# Quest: Gas Centrifuge
betterquesting.quest.2JMb-t2STTKM5sxV5Z7WOQ.name=Gas Centrifuge
betterquesting.quest.2JMb-t2STTKM5sxV5Z7WOQ.desc=The §3Gas Centrifuge§r is used to centrifuge §bUranium/Plutonium Hexafluoride§r to obtain enriched fuel for bombs and reactor fuel.%n%nTwo gas centrifuges in a row will yield §6Uranium-238§r and §6Uranium Fuel§r used in reactors. The uranium hexafluoride processing line does not consume the §6Sulfur§r and §6Fluorite§r, so loops are recommended.%n%nThe §6Gas Centrifuge Overclocking Upgrade§r is needed to obtain §6Uranium-235§r. Four gas centrifuges will have to be placed in a row and the upgrade on the last of them to obtain uranium-235 nuggets.%n%n[F1] For more information.%n

# Quest: Nuclear Fuel Processing
betterquesting.quest.7rFMNl3iSCOD-dpsKLAANQ.name=Nuclear Fuel Processing
betterquesting.quest.7rFMNl3iSCOD-dpsKLAANQ.desc=With the §3Spent Fuel Pool Drum§r to cool down §3ZIRNOX§r or §3PWR§r depleted nuclear fuel and the §3PUREX§r to further process them, many new materials are now available.

# Quest: Wideband Radio Emission Detector Satellite
betterquesting.quest.7xvtGouAQxKJ5rWXHykczg.name=Wideband Radio Emission Detector Satellite
betterquesting.quest.7xvtGouAQxKJ5rWXHykczg.desc=The §3Wideband Radio Emission Detector Satellite§r monitors the entire map for high-energy events with no range limit, returning only an approximate location. Use it as a first-pass detection layer - once a hit is found, follow up with the §3Narrowband Emission Scanning Satellite§r or §3Radar Satellite§r to pinpoint the source.%n%nEvents are grouped by intensity. LOW covers mini-nuke detonations, accurate to within 10,000 m. MEDIUM covers active radars and particle accelerators, accurate to within 2,500 m. HIGH covers nuclear explosions, accurate to within 500 m. MEDIUM events persist for only half a second while others last up to a minute, so rapid repeated scans are recommended.%n%nRoR commands: "esurvey" collects all active results; "ecount" writes the total to RX; "egettype" writes LOW, MEDIUM, or HIGH for a given index; "egetposition" writes approximate X/Z coordinates for a given index.%n%n§2Route this satellite's output through an §3AUTOCAL§r§2 to automatically cue more precise instruments when a hit is detected.

# Quest: Fusion Reactor
betterquesting.quest.8DXv-b9sRxalmY8yovSQuw.name=Fusion Reactor
betterquesting.quest.8DXv-b9sRxalmY8yovSQuw.desc=The §3Fusion Reactor§r is a large, expensive, and advanced reactor type that runs by fusing various plasma types to generate heat.%n%nThe main part of the fusion reactor, the §3"Torus"§r, features four connecting ports for external components. It requires electricity and §bPerfluoromethyl§r cooling to operate.%n%nThe §3Klystron§r is the main power source of the fusion reactor, which uses electricity and compressed air, to generate input energy, §eKyU§r, for the connected torus. It will throttle if the buffered electricity or compressed air falls below §e50%%§r, and if it falls below the torus' required input level, the plasma will extinguish.%n%nThe different plasma types also generate different useful byproducts and differing levels of neutron flux for breeding bulk quantities of materials, such as §6Lithium§r into §6Tritium§r.%n%nWelding the coils will require a §6Blowtorch§r or an §6Acetylene Welding Torch§r.%n%n§2For the additional components and power generation methods, please check out the two quests below.§r

# Quest: Large Factory Multiblocks
betterquesting.quest.8XHLo-wQRN28gu4AwCtHVQ.name=Large Factory Multiblocks
betterquesting.quest.8XHLo-wQRN28gu4AwCtHVQ.desc=The §3Chemical Factory§r is a large version of the §3Chemical Plant§r, capable of performing 4 recipes in parallel. It has double the speed of the chemical plant but consumes twice as much power. Additionally, it consumes §bWater§r as a coolant, and produces §bLow-Pressure Steam§r, so a closed water cycle is recommended.%n%nThe §3Assembly Factory§r is a large version of the §3Assembly Machine§r, capable of performing 4 recipes in parallel. It functions the same as the chemical factory.

# Quest: Starmetal Pickaxe
betterquesting.quest.8sIzBzykSPqskvhCp-Tsmw.name=Starmetal Pickaxe
betterquesting.quest.8sIzBzykSPqskvhCp-Tsmw.desc=The §6Starmetal Pickaxe§r is used as a crafting component for the §6Molten§r and §6Bismuth Pickaxes§r, both being unbreakable and having a lot of abilities. Additionally, both can be used to mine §eDepth Rock§r.%n

# Quest: Cadmium
betterquesting.quest.9BjXTD5CSTOQ-_OroVdJmg.name=Cadmium
betterquesting.quest.9BjXTD5CSTOQ-_OroVdJmg.desc=§6Cadmium§r is a material needed to make §6Cadmium Stee§rl, which is a substitute of §6Technetium Steel§r.%n%nCadmium can be obtained by smelting cadmium powder, which can be obtained acidizing 10 §6Mustard Willow leaves§r with 250mB of §bHigh-Perfomance Solvent§r in the §3Ore Acidizer§r.%n%nThe mustard willow is a plant that can be found near §eBedrock Oil Deposits§r. When it's fully matured, the main item can be obtained, that being the mustard willow leaf.

# Quest: Depth-Resource Scanning Satellite
betterquesting.quest.9Y9PU0asTPmHumQiDRc2Ew.name=Depth-Resource Scanning Satellite
betterquesting.quest.9Y9PU0asTPmHumQiDRc2Ew.desc=The §3Depth-Resource Scanning Satellite§r maps underground ore deposits across loaded chunks. It is operated via §dRedstone-over-Radio§r through a §3Satellite Ground Station§r.%n%nThe map lacks labels and detail on its own. Pairing the satellite with §6Neutrino Lenses§r - an armor module linked to the same frequency via the §3Satellite ID Manager§r - overlays ores as glowing labeled outlines, making the data far more usable.

# Quest: High-Power Steam Condenser
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA0Q.name=High-Power Steam Condenser
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA0Q.desc=The §3High-Power Steam Condenser§r is the a steam condenser which runs on electricity. It processes up to 60 mB/t of §bLow-Pressure Steam§r.

# Quest: Leviathan Steam Turbine
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA1Q.name=Leviathan Steam Turbine
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA1Q.desc=The §3Leviathan Steam Turbine§r is a massive turbine capable of processing gargantuan amounts of §bSteam§r at once, only hindered by the fluid system's transfer rate. It is significantly more powerful than even the §3Industrial Steam Turbine§r in terms of raw steam processing power. This turbine runs on §e85%%§r Efficiency, so it is recommended that only 1-2 are used for very large reactors.

# Quest: RBMK
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA.name=RBMK
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA.desc=The §3RBMK§r is a modular boiling-water type nuclear fission reactor which consists entirely of concrete columns. Each of these columns is either blank or has a specific function that it performs such as holding fuel rods, moderating neutrons, or storing §bWater§r to be boiled into §bSteam§r. Each column will also exchange heat with the column next to it such that temperature differences between columns will gradually equalize within the reactor. If any column reaches §e1500°C§r, the reactor will explode incredibly violently, spraying scrap and immensely radioactive material in every direction.%n%nDue to the complex and expansive nature of the RBMK, it is highly recommend that the wiki is checked out as it provides more information.%n%n[url]https://nucleartech.wiki/wiki/RBMK[/url]%n%n§2This quest provides an optional retrieval task for a cheap and safe RBMK design which can produce High-Performance Solvent§r §2without cooling. Simply Place the RBMK Irradiation Channel next to the RBMK Fuel Rod, apply the covers on the collumns and surround them with a solid block.

# Quest: Technetium/Cadmium Steel
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABg.name=Technetium/Cadmium Steel
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABg.desc=§6Technetium/Cadmium Steel§r is a steel based alloy mixed with technetium-99/Cadmium which has extreme corrosion resistance. It is frequently used in the late-game and acts as one of the main material gates of the §3Fusion§r and §3Watz§r powerplant.

# Quest: PWR
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACg.name=PWR
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACg.desc=The §2§3PWR§r is a modular fission reactor. It is more limited than the §3RBMK§r in terms of capability and fuel types but it is much safer and easier to use due to it melting down more gently and being far more stable in its operation.%n%nDue to the complex and expansive nature of the PWR, it is highly recommend that the wiki is checked out as it provides more information.%n%n[url]https://nucleartech.wiki/wiki/PWR[/url]%n%n§2This quest demands the most essential parts of a PWR, and does not represent the amount needed for a functioning reactor. There are also many other types of PWR Components that can be used.

# Quest: Reformate
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADQ.name=Reformate
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADQ.desc=§bReformate§r is a product of §bCrude Oil§r obtained via a §3Vacuum Refinery§r or from processing §bNaptha§r in a §3Hydrotreater§r.%n%n§2This step can be skipped if making Jet Fuel and BTX using a Hydrotreater.%n

# Quest: Starmetal
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJw.name=Starmetal
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJw.desc=§6Starmetal§r is a unique alloy made from combining §6Saturnite§r with §6Meteorite Powder§r in a §3Blast Furnace§r.

# Quest: Versatile Integrated Circuit
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKA.name=Versatile Integrated Circuit
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKA.desc=The §6Versatile Integrated Circuit§r is the first circuit to use §6Bismuth/Arsenic§r. It is used in more advanced machines such as the §3Vacuum Refinery§r and is one of the main components of §6Versatile Circuit Boards§r.

# Quest: Liquidator Medal
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALQ.name=Liquidator Medal
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALQ.desc=Incase of an §3RBMK§r meltdown, §6Fuel Chunks§r will be thrown near the reactor. The §6Liquidator Medal§r is an armor modification which passively reduces radiation, making it very useful when handling radioactive items or venturing into irradiated areas.

# Quest: Versatile Circuit Board
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMA.name=Versatile Circuit Board
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMA.desc=The §6Versatile Circuit Board§r is the final tier of circuit board, requiring §6Bismuth/Arsenic§r and §6Hard Plastic/PVC Bars§r.  As well as this, it is by far the most expensive circuit board, requiring nearly 55 insulators to craft a single one. Used rarely but in small amounts in advanced machines like the §3Fusion Reactor§r and in large amounts in components for the §3ICF Reactor§r.

# Quest: Hard Plastic/PVC Bars
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANA.name=Hard Plastic/PVC Bars
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANA.desc=§6Hard Plastic/PVC Bars§r are very durable plastics needed for many late game recipes. %n%n§2Both can be used in the same recipes.

# Quest: Pyrolysis Oven
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANg.name=Pyrolysis Oven
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANg.desc=The §3Pyrolysis Oven§r is a mid-to-late game oil processing machine that allows easier production pf §6Crystalline Fullerite§r, which is needed in bulk for late-game machines onwards. %n%nIt can process an item with an optional fluid to produce another item and/or fluid. Functionally, it works similar to the §3Combination Oven§r, mostly in bedrock ore processing.%nIts main use however is in production of §6Fullerene§r, as it can turn §6Tar§r into §6Fine Soot§r, eliminating the RNG of a §3Smokestack§r.%n%nOperating the pyrolysis oven will consume §e200kHE/s§r.

# Quest: Reformate Gas
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPg.name=Reformate Gas
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPg.desc=§bReformate Gas§r is used in welding very durable materials, as well as used in making §6Saturnite§r.

# Quest: FEL and SILEX
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAQw.name=FEL and SILEX
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAQw.desc=The §3FEL§r or Free Electron Laser is a large multiblock utilized with the SILEX to produce various laser wavelengths needed for all SILEX recipes.%n%nA single FEL can power up to 5 SILEX'es. In order to stop the laser any concrete block can be in the its path.%n%nThe lower the wavelength of the crystal, the faster recipes will be completed.%n%nThe §6§3SILEX§r is a machine that separates isotopes and elements from compounds or other materials via the SILEX (Separation of Isotopes by Laser Exitation) process. It allows for easier enrichment of §6Uranium§r, §6Plutonium§r, and §6Australium§r.%n%nThe SILEX can also process §6Lapis Lazuli§r into §6Sulfur§r, §6Aluminium§r, and most importantly §6Cobalt§r. It can use §bHydrogen Peroxide§r to liquify any material to be processed, the material may even be in a powder state. The processed items come out into the right side collection of slots.%n%nThe SILEX must be placed at least 2 blocks away from activated FEL laser, or else its going to melt.

# Quest: Saturnite
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAASQ.name=Saturnite
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAASQ.desc=§6Saturnite§r is a very durable, heat-resistant and corrosion-resistant alloy that is commonly used for making stronger gun parts. It is also used to make §6Starmetal§r and is an important component of the §3Watz§r reactor.

# Quest: Gravity Gun
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAASg.name=Gravity Gun
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAASg.desc=The §6Gravity Gun§r is an advanced tool which can lift and throw blocks. It is particularly useful for moving highly hazardous blocks, such as corium from a reactor meltdown, or throwing explosives.%n%n§2The gravity gun can be supercharged in a Cyclotron using Ionized Particles, further increasing its range and power.

# Quest: Schrabidium
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAVg.name=Schrabidium
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAVg.desc=§6Schrabidium§r is a dangerous material, but one which is needed for the creation of other items, such as §6Magnetized Tungsten§r and §6Ferric Schrabidate§r. It also makes for great reactor fuel. It can be created from exposing uranium ore to radiation using either a nuclear weapon or, more easily, by exploding radioactive barrels found in the abandoned nuclear powerplants in deserts.%n%n§2When holding Schrabidium, the player will receive the blindness effect, so it is recommended that a Suit which provides protection from both Bright Lights and Radiation is used.

# Quest: Advanced Oil Processing
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAWw.name=Advanced Oil Processing
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAWw.desc=The §3Catalytic Reformer§r is an optional late-game oil processing machine. It converts certain oil products into more valuable ones.%n%nThe §3Hydrotreater§r is another optional late-game oil processing machine that allows for easier production of §bSour Gas§r, which can also turn §bCrude Oil§r into §bDesulfurized crude Oil§r. %n%n§2The Hydrotreater requires pressurized Liquid Hydrogen in all its recipes, requiring the use of a Compressor.

# Quest: Soyuz-FG
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAZw.name=Soyuz-FG
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAZw.desc=The §3Soyuz-FG Rocket§r is an immensely powerful Soviet rocket that is the primary launch vehicle for all satellites. The rocket must be launched from a suitably large mount - in this case, the §3Soyuz Launch Platform§r.%n%nIt requires 128,000mB of §bKerosene§r and §bLiquid Oxygen§r to be launched as well as §e750kHE§r of power. Pressing the launch button starts a 30 second countdown. After the countdown has completed, the Soyuz will launch.%n%nThe Soyuz can, alongside its primary ability to deliver any satellite to orbit, also be set to a cargo mode, in which it can deliver any provided cargo to a distant spot across the world. Obviously, this is an incredibly expensive way to transport goods, and currently doesn't provide much utility.%n%n§2Blueprints for the Soyuz can be found in structures or purchased through Bobmazon.%n

# Quest: Ferrouranium Anvil
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAbw.name=Ferrouranium Anvil
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAbw.desc=An upgraded version of the §3Anvil§r, [T4], which unlocks additional recipes.

# Quest: Neutrino Lens
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAcA.name=Neutrino Lens
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAcA.desc=The §6Neutrino Lens§r is an armor modification which can detect and highlight special blocks, such as §eBedrock Ore deposits§r, the §6Pink Log§r and §6Alexandrite§r. %n%nFor the lens to work, it must first be linked to a §6Depth-Resource Scanning Module Satellite§r and then inserted into an armor piece using the §3Armor Modification Table§r.%n%n§2The HUD key has to be activated for it to work.

# Quest: ZIRNOX
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAcg.name=ZIRNOX
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAcg.desc=The §3ZIRNOX§r is the first and cheapest nuclear reactor one can make. Unlike the §3PWR§r and §3RBMK§r, it is a fully assembled reactor which requires §bWater§r and §bCarbon Dioxide§r to operate.%n%nDue to its modest steam output, the ZIRNOX can be paired with several §3Steam Engines§r, though an §3Industrial Turbine§r is recommended for its §e100%%§r efficiency. A single §3Steam Condenser§r handles the exhaust on lower power fuels. 24 §6Natural Uranium Fuel Rods§r using 14kmB of carbon dioxide will yield a power output of around §e240kHE/s§r.

# Quest: Cooling Tower
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAdQ.name=Cooling Tower
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAdQ.desc=The §3Cooling Tower§r is a larger version of the §3Auxiliary Cooling Tower§r§r, able to process up to 500 mB/t of §bLow-Pressure Steam§r.

# Quest: Ionized Particles
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAeA.name=Ionized Particles
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAeA.desc=§6Ionized Particles§r are the main product of the §3Fusion Reactor§r and are used in making §6Ferric Scrabidate§r, as well as some particle capsules needed in the §3Particle Accelerator§r.%n%n§2Ionized Particles can be infinitely produced by utilizing Ionic Gel.

# Quest: HEV Mark IV
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAhA.name=HEV Mark IV
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAhA.desc=The §6HEV Mark IV§r is a strong electric armor set, with the intent of keeping the user safe primarely from dangerous hazards, such as high levels of radiation, fire, certain air particles and more. The suit comes equiped with an §6Geiger Counter§r and custom hud.

# Quest: Bismuth
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAhw.name=Bismuth
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAhw.desc=§6Bismuth§r is an important material needed in many advanced crafting recipes. Bismuth can be obtained from either §3RBMK§r fuel depletion and processing though a §3FEL§r and §3SILEX§r, or from bedrock ore processing using §bHigh-Performance Solvent§r. %n%n§6Arsenic§r will require an additional §bOre Acidizer§r aswell as access to high-performance solvent.%n%n§2Due to the lack of bismuth bedrock ore available on earth and the amount of time it takes to process RBMK fuels, it is recommended that some arsenic is used instead of bismuth.

# Quest: Welded Technetium/Cadmium Steel Plate
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAjg.name=Welded Technetium/Cadmium Steel Plate
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAjg.desc=The §6Welded Technetium/Cadmium Steel Plate§r is the welded varient of the cast technetium/cadmium steel plate and is used in some recipes that require strong materials. %n%n§2Make sure to have good energy generation and storage infrastructure as each plate costs 1.2 Billion HE.

# Quest: Big-Ass Tank
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAjw.name=Big-Ass Tank
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAjw.desc=The §3Big-Ass Tank§r is the largest fluid storage container, capable of storing 2048000mB of fluids, aswell as being able to hold strongly corrosive fluids. It has to be placed on the solid surface, otherwise it is going to break.

# Quest: Heavy Magnetic Storage Tank
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAkA.name=Heavy Magnetic Storage Tank
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAkA.desc=The §3Heavy Magnetic Storage Tank§r is a large version of the §3Magnetic Antimatter Container§r. It will be particularly useful when making §6Gerald§r, as he will need very large quantities of §bStellar Flux§r.

# Quest: Vacuum Refinery
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAkw.name=Vacuum Refinery
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAkw.desc=The §3Vacuum Refinery§r is an oil refinery which processes §bPressurized/Desulfurized Crude Oil§r into 4 liquid products. It is a good way to make §bHigh-Performance Solvent§r by using §bReformate Gas§r and §bChlorine Gas§r in an §3Industrial Mixer§r.%n%n§2Compressors are needed for the oil to be inserted inside the Vacuum Refinery.

# Quest: BTX
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAng.name=BTX
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAng.desc=§bBTX§r is a high-grade powerful fuel which generates a lot of power when burnt. An important use of BTX is in the creation of §6Crystalline Fullerite§r and §6Hard Plastic Bars§r. BTX can be obtained from a §3Hydrotreater§r, but it is more efficient to use §bReformate§r from a §3Vacuum Refinery§r.

# Quest: Watz Powerplant
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAApg.name=Watz Powerplant
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAApg.desc=The §3Watz§r powerplant is a fission reactor which can produce §bPoisonous Mud§r, an important component of §6CMB Steel§r. Although the reactor is not really powerful in terms of energy output, it can be stacked ontop of eachother for increased mud and power production.%n%nIf the poisonous mud buffer reaches its maximum, the reactor will melt down and explode, irradiating a wide area around it and causing fallout to fall in a small area around it. As well as this, it will spew poisonous mud in a very wide area which will then corrode any blocks that it comes in contact with, similar to corium.

# Quest: Magnetized Tungsten
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAArQ.name=Magnetized Tungsten
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAArQ.desc=§6Magnetized Tungsten§r is the product of combining §6Schrabidium§r and §6Tungsten§r in a §3Blast Furnace§r. It can also be rarely dropped by cybercrabs in §eMeteorite Dungeons§r.

# Quest: Ferric Schrabidate
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAuA.name=Ferric Schrabidate
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAuA.desc=§6Ferric Schrabidate§r is an alloy made from §6Iron§r, §6Ionized Particles§r and §6Schrabidium§r. It can also be used to create schrabidate capacitors, which are a great way of storing energy.

# Quest: Solid Mud Brick
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAuQ.name=Solid Mud Brick
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAuQ.desc=§6Poisonous Mud§r is the byproduct of the §3Watz§r operating. This is the solidified version of it which can be used in a §3Crucible§r to create §6CMB Steel§r.

# Quest: CMB Steel
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAug.name=CMB Steel
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAug.desc=§6CMB Steel§r is an alloy made from §6Poisonous Mud§r and §6Magnetized Tunsten§r in a §3Crucible§r. This alloy is used in endgame machinery, such as the §3ICF§r and §3DFC§r.

# Quest: Crystalline Fullerite
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAww.name=Crystalline Fullerite
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAww.desc=§6Crystalline Fullerite§r is an material which is primarely used in endgame machines, such as the §3ICF§r and the §3FEnSU§r.%n%n§2It is recommended that an Effectiveness 3 upgrade is installed on the Acidizer to increase the chance of not consuming the Fullerene, as fullerite can be expensive to produce large quantities.

# Quest: High-Performance Solvent
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABPQ.name=High-Performance Solvent
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABPQ.desc=§bHigh-Performance Solvent§r is a solvent which is used in an §3Ore Acidizer§r to further increase the products of bedrock ores, as well as other recipes. It can be created from §bReformate Gas§r, from a §3Vacuum Refinery§r, and §bChlorine§r in an §3Industrial Mixer§r or be obtained from an §3RBMK§r Irradiation Channel.%n%nTo transport High-Performance Solvent by hand, a §6Hazardous Material Tank§r is needed.%n%n§2High-Performance Solvent made from an RBMK irradiation channel requires an ore acidizer.%n

# Quest: Radiation-Powered Engine
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABeA.name=Radiation-Powered Engine
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABeA.desc=The §3Radiation-Powered Engine§r turns nuclear waste into decayed waste while also making energy in the process and giving guaranteed consistent decay times.%n%n§2Blueprints can be found in structures or purchased from Bobmazon.

# Quest: PWR powered Steel Furnace
betterquesting.quest.CYbDJkRORT-LPEInaoL3BQ.name=PWR powered Steel Furnace
betterquesting.quest.CYbDJkRORT-LPEInaoL3BQ.desc=Instead of using the §bHot Coolant§r for power, one can use it to make the §3Steel Furnace§r go at ludicrous speeds.

# Quest: Uranium-238
betterquesting.quest.CYtQLn_VSx2QTnLEwpMGOw.name=Uranium-238
betterquesting.quest.CYtQLn_VSx2QTnLEwpMGOw.desc=§6Uranium-238§r is the most common uranium isotope in the game. %n%nThis material has many uses, some of which are: §6Ferrouranium§r, MOX fuel, depleted uranium ammunition, absorber Pellets for the §3Watz§r powerplant and can also be turned into §6Schrabidium§r later on in the §3Exposure Chamber§r.

# Quest: Narrowband Emission Scanning Satellite
betterquesting.quest.DMCygjIOSOav8ZBlUlqEvQ.name=Narrowband Emission Scanning Satellite
betterquesting.quest.DMCygjIOSOav8ZBlUlqEvQ.desc=The §3Narrowband Emission Scanning Satellite§r precisely locates specific high-energy events within a 250-meter radius of a target point. It is the high-precision counterpart to the §3Wideband Radio Emission Detector Satellite§r, sensitive to: neutron radiation from nuclear reactors, high-energy particles from fusion reactors and particle accelerators, radar waves from ground radars, and radio waves from §3Satellite Ground Stations§r with an active TX signal.%n%nAll results are stored internally and accessed via §dRedstone-over-Radio§r. "esurvey" performs the scan. "ecount" writes the result count to RX. "egetinfo" followed by an index writes the emission type to RX. "egetposition" followed by an index writes the X/Z coordinates - separated by a semicolon - to RX.%n%n§2Events are time-limited. Run repeated scans at short intervals to avoid missing short-lived emissions.

# Quest: Orbital Precision Laser
betterquesting.quest.EQ8nf9eDQ-K9yPIxEaFQkw.name=Orbital Precision Laser
betterquesting.quest.EQ8nf9eDQ-K9yPIxEaFQkw.desc=The §3Orbital Precision Laser§r is a solar-powered orbital weapon, a lighter alternative to the §3Orbital Death Ray§r. It fires an instantaneous beam dealing massive damage to entities within a 5-block radius, though its explosive yield is only roughly equivalent to a single block of TNT. Recharge time between shots is §e5 seconds§r.%n%nIt can be aimed with a §6Satellite (Laser) Designator§r or controlled via §dRedstone-over-Radio§r through a §3Satellite Ground Station§r. The "fire" command fires at the current target coordinates, or at a tracked entity if one has been set - entity target data is consumed after a single shot. The "canfire" command writes TRUE or FALSE to RX depending on whether the laser has finished recharging. The "setentitytarget" command accepts an entity ID from a §3Radar Satellite§r for precision tracking.%n%n§2Entity target data is consumed after one shot, reverting back to coordinate targeting.

# Quest: Additional Fusion Attachments
betterquesting.quest.JpsvBP1yQsu-XtkeZegA6A.name=Additional Fusion Attachments
betterquesting.quest.JpsvBP1yQsu-XtkeZegA6A.desc=The §3Fusion Reactor Coupler§r turns outgoing plasma energy from a torus into usable §eKyE§r which can then be used to power another torus. Some fuel combinations require this, as the minimum §eKyE§r energy needed to ignite the plasma exceeds what four §3Klystrons§r could deliver.%n%nThe §3Fusion Reactor Breeding Chamber§r uses neutron flux from a torus to in order to process materials. It can perform any recipe from an §3RBMK irradiation channel§r, with some additional recipes aswell. The neutron flux is not affected by port sharing rules, and the output level is the same on any side.%n%nThe §3Fusion Reactor Collection Chamber§r increases the byproduct production rate by §e50%%§r.

# Quest: Orbital Death Ray
betterquesting.quest.Ksafc-uMT02Uk0dvCx1JOQ.name=Orbital Death Ray
betterquesting.quest.Ksafc-uMT02Uk0dvCx1JOQ.desc=The §3Orbital Death Ray§r is a high-destruction orbital weapon. Before launch, link it to a §6Satellite (Laser) Designator§r using the §3Satellite ID Manager§r. With a standard designator, enter target coordinates manually; with a laser designator, aim and hold right-click on the target block.%n%nUnlike the §3Orbital Precision Laser§r, it has no entity-tracking capability and cannot intercept rockets or hit fast-moving targets. The beam strikes the first surface in its path, so targets in deep cover are safe. Recharge time is §e5 minutes§r. RoR commands: "fire" fires at the current target position if the weapon is ready; "canfire" writes TRUE or FALSE to RX depending on whether it has finished recharging.

# Quest: Desh Stamps
betterquesting.quest.MFweFzQDQg2L-9X4_I8o-Q.name=Desh Stamps
betterquesting.quest.MFweFzQDQg2L-9X4_I8o-Q.desc=§6Desh Stamps§r have infinite durability, perfect for automation.

# Quest: Chlorophyte
betterquesting.quest.PszZViltQjCHNmKB7QJcfA.name=Chlorophyte
betterquesting.quest.PszZViltQjCHNmKB7QJcfA.desc=§6Chlorophyte§r is a product of fusion and is used in the §3DFC§r and §6Digamma Particle§r.

# Quest: High-Performance Solvent Bedrock Ore Processing
betterquesting.quest.QusK-8T-TGmBWETwmxosJQ.name=High-Performance Solvent Bedrock Ore Processing
betterquesting.quest.QusK-8T-TGmBWETwmxosJQ.desc=§bHigh-Performance Solvent§r is the best tier of solvent which can be used in bedrock ore processing, yielding many rare materials such as§6 Bismuth§r and §6Technetium-99§r.%n%n§2These materials are not available from earth bedrock ores.

# Quest: Fusion Power
betterquesting.quest.WS2zNdGdTnmclQfj2ARCog.name=Fusion Power
betterquesting.quest.WS2zNdGdTnmclQfj2ARCog.desc=The §3Fusion Reactor Boiler§r is simplest method of extracting power from a fusion reactor, outputting §bSuper Dense Steam§r to be run through normal turbines.%n%nDue to using plasma energy, both the MHDT and the boiler are affected by port sharing rules, meaning that having multiple connected MHTDs, or boilers, decreases the amount of energy each turbine gets, but overall increases the total amount of extracted from the torus.%n

# Quest: Fissile Materials
betterquesting.quest.X6nUcp16QUqawLXQTqFTBw.name=Fissile Materials
betterquesting.quest.X6nUcp16QUqawLXQTqFTBw.desc=With fissile materials obtained from either §3Gas Centrifuges§r or nuclear fuel processing, nuclear bombs are made available.

# Quest: RBMK Fuel Processing
betterquesting.quest.a0YRGBjSTGiD09r4LqD8EA.name=RBMK Fuel Processing
betterquesting.quest.a0YRGBjSTGiD09r4LqD8EA.desc=With the §3Nuclear Waste Disposal Drum§r to decay waste and a §3SILEX§r, §3RBMK§r nuclear fuels can be processed into many new materials.

# Quest: Nuclear Waste Disposal Drum
betterquesting.quest.eadYFbwuQTS39P9cW-D-Fw.name=Nuclear Waste Disposal Drum
betterquesting.quest.eadYFbwuQTS39P9cW-D-Fw.desc=The §3Nuclear Waste Disposal Drum§r is used to decay §3RBMK§r nuclear waste. The decayed nuclear waste can then be used with a §3FEL§r and §3SILEX§r to obtain some rare elements, such as §6Bismuth§r.%n%n§2The drum also emmits radiation when theres fuel inside it.

# Quest: PUREX
betterquesting.quest.g3S9-75wTGyQKmZaQTZl5Q.name=PUREX
betterquesting.quest.g3S9-75wTGyQKmZaQTZl5Q.desc=The §3PUREX§r is a machine that can reprocess depleted nuclear fuel into various materials. Most recipes require both §bNitric Acid§r and §bKerosene§r to function.%n%n§6Schrabidium§r can also be extracted from certain recipes, which require §bSchrabidic Acid§r. The schrabidium extracted yields double the schrabidium used to make the acid.

# Quest: Chicago Pile
betterquesting.quest.g8IVppPpTceY55PbNbceJQ.name=Chicago Pile
betterquesting.quest.g8IVppPpTceY55PbNbceJQ.desc=The §3Chicago Pile§r is a modular breeding reactor with no GUI, built to transmute §6Natural Uranium§r into plutonium isotopes through neutron bombardment. It must be operated manually or via §dRedstone-over-Radio§r.%n%nBuild a rectangular prism of §6Chicago Pile Graphite Bricks§r, at minimum 5*5*5 and at most 15*15*15. Once assembled, drill a non-edge block on one of its lateral faces with the §6Hand Drill§r to establish the core and fix the reactor's channel orientation. Channels are straight lines drilled through the pile and may not intersect. Fuel channels share the core's face orientation and accept rods via a §3Chicago Pile Fuel Loader§r on the input port; spent rods are ejected from the opposite side. Ventilation channels run perpendicular to the core and require a §3Chicago Pile Vent§r supplied with §bcompressed air§r at §e1 PU§r - each vent cools only the fuel channels within one block above or below it. Vertical control rod channels are optional and reduce reactivity between channels. %n%nEvery reaction requires a neutron source. The §6Ra226Be Neutron Source§r is the starter option; the more powerful §6Po210Be Neutron Source§r can replace it later. §6Natural Uranium Rods§r breed into §6Plutonium-239 Rods§r, which can be bred further into §6Reactor-Grade Plutonium Rods§r. Leaving fuel beyond that point produces §6Nuclear Waste Rods§r, which generate extreme heat and risk meltdown. To safely push out spent rods without fresh fuel, use §6Zirconium Rods§r - they are inert and transparent to neutrons.%n%n§2Verify cooling is working before loading any fuel. The pile melts down at 800°C, causing an explosion and widespread fire.%n%nThe quest asks for a §3Chicago Pile§r of at least 5*5*5 with a core established, a §3Chicago Pile Fuel Loader§r and §3Chicago Pile Vent§r attached, and a §6Ra226Be Neutron Source§r loaded alongside at least one §6Natural Uranium Rod§r.

# Quest: Spent Fuel Pool Drum
betterquesting.quest.har7pEFcSRKNgIf4NgmcLA.name=Spent Fuel Pool Drum
betterquesting.quest.har7pEFcSRKNgIf4NgmcLA.desc=The §3Spent Fuel Pool Drum§r is used to cool down hot nuclear fuel rods for the §3RBMK§r, §3ZIRNOX§r and §3PWR§r. It has 12 slots.%n%nThe drum needs to have atleast one of its sides touching §bWater§r to work. The more sides that have water the faster the fuels inside will cool down.

# Quest: Technetium-99
betterquesting.quest.iJiX7wxoSBmljc9tITqIqQ.name=Technetium-99
betterquesting.quest.iJiX7wxoSBmljc9tITqIqQ.desc=§6Technetium-99§r is a common waste product from the fission of §6Uranium§r and §6Plutonium§r. It is mainly used in making §6Technetium Steel§r and §dAE2 Storage Components§r.

# Quest: Helium-4
betterquesting.quest.mPHQk4_mRqi6o2onNs9qgg.name=Helium-4
betterquesting.quest.mPHQk4_mRqi6o2onNs9qgg.desc=§bHelium-4§r is a product of fusion and is mainly used in crafting §6Quantum Processing Units§r.

# Quest: Houston, We Have a Signal
betterquesting.quest.ocylWycmSd6r-mvYENYGEw.name=Houston, We Have a Signal
betterquesting.quest.ocylWycmSd6r-mvYENYGEw.desc=Satellites require dedicated infrastructure to launch, identify, and communicate with.%n%nBefore anything leaves the ground, every satellite must be assigned a unique frequency using the §3Satellite ID Manager§r. Place the satellite in its right slot to generate a random frequency, then use the left and center slots to copy that frequency onto §6Satellite ID Chips§r or other linked devices such as designators. ID Chips are soldered, so prepare them in advance. The assigned frequency appears in the item's tooltip.%n%nSatellites can be launching using a custom rocket or Soyuz-FG.%n%nOnce a satellite is in orbit, a §3Satellite Ground Station§r handles communication. It does not process §dRedstone-over-Radio§r signals directly - it requires an external RoR receiver or transmitter. It connects to one satellite at a time, switched via the appropriate §6Satellite ID Chip§r or an RoR command. RX reads data transmitted down from the satellite; TX sends commands up to it.%n%n§2The Ground Station's capabilities expand significantly when paired with an §3AUTOCAL§r§2, enabling automated satellite tracking, data processing, and chained multi-satellite logic.

# Quest: Xenium Resonator Satellite
betterquesting.quest.qrbz8mP0Ry-RtTBVRTkruA.name=Xenium Resonator Satellite
betterquesting.quest.qrbz8mP0Ry-RtTBVRTkruA.desc=The §3Xenium Resonator Satellite§r provides unlimited on-demand teleportation with no cooldown. Before launch, its frequency must be linked to a §6Satellite Designator§r using the §3Satellite ID Manager§r.%n%nA standard §6Satellite Designator§r requires coordinates to be entered manually. A §6Satellite (Laser) Designator§r is simpler - aim the crosshair at a block and right-click.%n%n§2Interdimensional teleportation is not supported.

# Quest: Ferrouranium
betterquesting.quest.rHdJmpZPSNWIvMLqALvC_w.name=Ferrouranium
betterquesting.quest.rHdJmpZPSNWIvMLqALvC_w.desc=§6Ferrouranium§r is an alloy of §6Uranium-238§r and §6Steel§r.

# Quest: Heat Exchanging Heater
betterquesting.quest.rRJfZe74TXqpP-q2faX7bA.name=Heat Exchanging Heater
betterquesting.quest.rRJfZe74TXqpP-q2faX7bA.desc=The §4§3Heat Exchanging Heater§r is used to cool down coolants used in reactors while also genearting §eTU§r. A §3Boiler§r can be placed ontop of it to heat up other fluids, such as §bSteam§r, to be used in §3Steam Turbines§r.

# Quest: Nuclear Bombs
betterquesting.quest.sCe8OyBsQEeMrUpYXUn9Yw.name=Nuclear Bombs
betterquesting.quest.sCe8OyBsQEeMrUpYXUn9Yw.desc=With access to §6Tantalium§r for §6Control Units§r and fissile matterials, it is possible to assemble a nuclear bomb. To detonate the bomb one can use a detonator or a redstone signal.%n%nA nuclear explosion will transform ores into more valuable ones, such as §6Coal§r to §6Diamonds§r or §6Uranium§r to §6Schrabidium§r. Be prepared with radiation resistant armor before venturing into the crater.%n%nMake sure to stand behind some strong cover if you wish to see the explosion from close by.%n%n§2This quest serves as a list of components needed for various bombs. Some of these components can be mounted onto rockets that will carry the payload over large distances.

# Quest: Arsenic
betterquesting.quest.tgpCNtEfScSyk-mdGhGxmQ.name=Arsenic
betterquesting.quest.tgpCNtEfScSyk-mdGhGxmQ.desc=§6Arsenic§r is a substitute of §6Bismuth§r which can be made from acidizing §6Oily Dirt§r, found near §ebedrock oil deposits§r or from the environmental damage the §3Fracking Tower§r does, with §bHigh-Performance Solvent§r.

# Quest: Radar Survey Satellite
betterquesting.quest.xQEUURH0RH-QWqDAqs7Gzw.name=Radar Survey Satellite
betterquesting.quest.xQEUURH0RH-QWqDAqs7Gzw.desc=The §3Radar Survey Satellite§r detects all radar-visible entities - players, rockets, and more - within a 1000-chunk radius of its target position. It compiles results into a searchable list with entity types and exact coordinates, and can filter results by class name without requiring a new scan.%n%nRoR commands: "survey" scans the area and saves results to both a base list and a filtered list. "filter name" replaces the filtered list with only entries matching that class name - the original list is preserved, so this can be run multiple times for different types without rescanning. "count" writes the number of filtered results to RX. "gettargetid index" returns the unique entity ID for a given entry, which can be passed to other satellites for precise targeting. "getposition index" writes exact X/Y/Z coordinates - separated by semicolons - to RX. "getname index" writes the class name of the entry to RX.%n%n§2Pair this satellite with an §3AUTOCAL§r and the §3Orbital Precision Laser§r for automated missile interception.

# Quest: Deuterium Extraction Tower
betterquesting.quest.yYyMBFJrRUOt39If3zFaFg.name=Deuterium Extraction Tower
betterquesting.quest.yYyMBFJrRUOt39If3zFaFg.desc=The §3Deuterium Extraction Tower§r is a much larger version of the Deuterium Extractor, making it an easy and viable way of making cheap fuel for the §b§r§3Fusion Reactor§r.%n%n§2A Ferrouranium Anvil is required.§r


## Quest Line: LV3.5 - Space Age
betterquesting.questline.enTskTtvRdajee3UMSgXKg.name=LV3.5 - Space Age
betterquesting.questline.enTskTtvRdajee3UMSgXKg.desc=Explore Space and colonise planets. This chapter revolves around the content of NTM: Space.

# Quest: Duna
betterquesting.quest.-aAyklEkSHK7wGxEEzQJ9Q.name=Duna
betterquesting.quest.-aAyklEkSHK7wGxEEzQJ9Q.desc=The red planet, home to vast quantities of §6Iron§r. §6Molysite§r and §6Volcano Gems§r can be found here in basaltic caves, found within basins where vast oceans were theorized to once exist.

# Quest: CMB Insert
betterquesting.quest.3fvMK3HASiaG4E0wg7MTrA.name=CMB Insert
betterquesting.quest.3fvMK3HASiaG4E0wg7MTrA.desc=§6CMB Iserts§r are an armor modification which will protect its user from the corrosive atmosphere of §eEve§r. %n%nThe §3Gas Giant Harvester§r will return back with §bJool Air§r, to be processed by the §3Cryogenic Distillation Machine§r.

# Quest: Industrial Greenhouse
betterquesting.quest.4HLGI5HyQtSw1G-iuwI0kg.name=Industrial Greenhouse
betterquesting.quest.4HLGI5HyQtSw1G-iuwI0kg.desc=The §3Industrial Greenhouse§r converts §bCarbon Dioxide§r into §bOxygen§r via crop growth. The greenhouse can also be supplied with §6Fertilizer§r for faster growing.

# Quest: Cryogenic Distillation Machine
betterquesting.quest.7kkbpR6rS4CsUTUFQ5wd7g.name=Cryogenic Distillation Machine
betterquesting.quest.7kkbpR6rS4CsUTUFQ5wd7g.desc=The §3Cryogenic Distillation Machine§r can split atmospheric gases into 4 useful fractions, like for example, taking trace amounts of §bNitrogen§r out of the Dunaian atmosphere to produce soil for planting crops.

# Quest: Teleporter
betterquesting.quest.8j7JCxPeSaaBqlOTrRGtCg.name=Teleporter
betterquesting.quest.8j7JCxPeSaaBqlOTrRGtCg.desc=The §3Teleporter§r can be used to teleport players, and entities in general, to a specific location.%n%nRight-click a block with the §6Telelinker§r to set the desired exit position, then shift-click the teleporter with the telelinker to configure the teleporter.%n%n§2The teleporter is a one way trip so it is advised that multiple are made.%n%nInterdimensional teleportation using teleporters requires a very expensive type of fuel, so it is recommended that other teleportations methods are used, such as AE2 Spatial.

# Quest: Occasionally Heavy Boots
betterquesting.quest.9S1Tw8UTRbi8Z9wq7frVJA.name=Occasionally Heavy Boots
betterquesting.quest.9S1Tw8UTRbi8Z9wq7frVJA.desc=Temporarily increases gravity on low gravity worlds when holding crouch.

# Quest: Steam Radiator
betterquesting.quest.AB-0K2UoQF-7uQ9XiO8mqw.name=Steam Radiator
betterquesting.quest.AB-0K2UoQF-7uQ9XiO8mqw.desc=The §3Steam Radiator§r is a steam condenser that works in the vacuum of space.

# Quest: Tectonic Missile
betterquesting.quest.CRR3Op6SQMefJL6r8uAfrA.name=Tectonic Missile
betterquesting.quest.CRR3Op6SQMefJL6r8uAfrA.desc=When a §6Tectonic Missile§r hits, it creates a volcano that immediately starts to splash volcanic lava everywhere. Which is what you need to get the volcanic gem!

# Quest: Gallium Arsenide
betterquesting.quest.DeOqQyXwQRq5RNcDa5l0ug.name=Gallium Arsenide
betterquesting.quest.DeOqQyXwQRq5RNcDa5l0ug.desc=§6Gallium Arsenide§r is made from mixing §6Gallium§r, which can be procured by processing rich mineral deposits from §eMoho§r or §eIke§r, and §6Arsenic§r which is found on Ike in bedrock ore, or on §eEarth§r via dirt and stone that has been damaged by hydraulic fracking.

# Quest: Gas Giant Harvester
betterquesting.quest.EE3856t_QVu_cAG6P033_Q.name=Gas Giant Harvester
betterquesting.quest.EE3856t_QVu_cAG6P033_Q.desc=The §3Gas Giant Harvester Station§r is a device for collecting atmospheric air samples from gas giants.%n%nThe concept is quite simple: on a planet that is a satellite of the giant (for example, to fly to the green giant Jool, you need to go to Laythe), the station is set up. After refueling with §bLiquid Oxygen§r and §bHydrogen§r, the §3harvester rocket§r is sent for air. In one trip, it delivers 16,000 mB§r. As you can understand, the harvester's§r functionality is completely analogous to the operation of §3MiningModules§r.

# Quest: Mun Cow?!
betterquesting.quest.EVr_kBsgS2Wb6Knw0wuihw.name=Mun Cow?!
betterquesting.quest.EVr_kBsgS2Wb6Knw0wuihw.desc=This is something new; don't ask questions like how a cow survives on the Mun without food or where it got a PLSS module. The fact is, they feel quite well on the Mun, and due to the vacuum, the milk inside them has curdled.

# Quest: Vacuum Solderer
betterquesting.quest.G3Em4SXiQee1Yu-Rd0yGaA.name=Vacuum Solderer
betterquesting.quest.G3Em4SXiQee1Yu-Rd0yGaA.desc=The §3Vacuum Solderer§r is a machine that can only function in a vacuum, and produces vacuum circuits. They can be placed into the §3Drive Processor§r to enable it to process higher tier planetary drives.

# Quest: Space Equipment
betterquesting.quest.HvPzivF4SWWIDt5syO87xA.name=Space Equipment
betterquesting.quest.HvPzivF4SWWIDt5syO87xA.desc=The §6PLSS§r is an armor modification which will allow you to breathe in space. It will only work on airtight sealed suits.%n%nThe §6Heavy Boots§r can be used to quickly descend down in low-gravity environments.

# Quest: Ike
betterquesting.quest.KItM5UOCSNmCMNKnohadaQ.name=Ike
betterquesting.quest.KItM5UOCSNmCMNKnohadaQ.desc=§eIke§r, the sole moon of §eDuna§r, has hints of a past as a significant hazardous waste dump, with large spires and pyramids reminiscent of potential designs on Earth for warning future civilizations of great danger in relation to nuclear waste. §eMeteor dungeons§r spawn more frequently here, and pools of §bAlkyl Bromide§r can be found on the surface.%n

# Quest: Armospheric Liquefaction Tower
betterquesting.quest.KQqx-tttRfG2DNO4tLbSCw.name=Armospheric Liquefaction Tower
betterquesting.quest.KQqx-tttRfG2DNO4tLbSCw.desc=The Air Liquefaction Tower is intended for obtaining liquid nitrogen from compressed air.

# Quest: Drive Processor Tier 3
betterquesting.quest.LKTbDe35Rte7XOisZoywOQ.name=Drive Processor Tier 3
betterquesting.quest.LKTbDe35Rte7XOisZoywOQ.desc=The §3Drive Processor Tier 3§r allows for travel to §eLaythe§r.

# Quest: Atmospheric Scanner
betterquesting.quest.MqqnLpS-RLK6oNw12wzI7Q.name=Atmospheric Scanner
betterquesting.quest.MqqnLpS-RLK6oNw12wzI7Q.desc=The §6Atmospheric Scanner§r shows the atmospheric consistency of planets. Useful for when terraforming.

# Quest: Mobile Orbital Station
betterquesting.quest.NBDAp_kvThGG5C4yE0SiPA.name=Mobile Orbital Station
betterquesting.quest.NBDAp_kvThGG5C4yE0SiPA.desc=By having an orbital station have an §3Orbital Station Computer§r and §3Drop Pods§r, one can move their station to any destination they wish, massively cutting down on material costs needed to make new rockets.

# Quest: Drop Pod
betterquesting.quest.Ou1Dd0LTTgqox9lIWWOLNg.name=Drop Pod
betterquesting.quest.Ou1Dd0LTTgqox9lIWWOLNg.desc=With a §3Drop pod§r, one can access their space station without needing to build new rockets. They can also be used to land on other planets once the station has reached them.%n%n§2Make sure to keep spare drives.§r

# Quest: Stainless Steel
betterquesting.quest.Q0hC3CjIR4GB7MtYPpxXgA.name=Stainless Steel
betterquesting.quest.Q0hC3CjIR4GB7MtYPpxXgA.desc=§6Stainless Steel§r is an alloy made of §6Steel§r and §6Nickel§r.

# Quest: Drive Processor Tier 2
betterquesting.quest.QVJAi3JOR5in6VwMOEyL6w.name=Drive Processor Tier 2
betterquesting.quest.QVJAi3JOR5in6VwMOEyL6w.desc=The §3Drive Processor Tier 2§r allows for travel to §eDres§r and §eEve§r.

# Quest: Jool
betterquesting.quest.Rln_1bNXSHmwrz3lNURhwA.name=Jool
betterquesting.quest.Rln_1bNXSHmwrz3lNURhwA.desc=Jool is a gas giant planet with Laythe and two other small unnamed planets orbiting it.%n%nAs is logical, landing on a gas giant is impossible, but this doesn't prevent us from gathering resources from this giant.%n%n§2Jool's atmosphere consists of §bHelium-3§r §2(25%%), §bLiquid Hydrogen§r §2(25%%), §bChlorine§r §2(20%%), and §bNeon§r §2(12%%). To collect all these gases, we will need a §3Harvester§r.§r

# Quest: Hafnium
betterquesting.quest.S0AQWdCYSeiUnhi2CmLszA.name=Hafnium
betterquesting.quest.S0AQWdCYSeiUnhi2CmLszA.desc=§6Hafnium§r is a rare light metal needed to produce the §6Hafnium chips§r, which at this stage in progression can only be obtained by centrifuging niobium crystals, which must be created from niobium ore, only found on §eDres§r and §eEve§r.

# Quest: Mun/Minmus
betterquesting.quest.SyNchvx5TpG6S7lF4jtiOA.name=Mun/Minmus
betterquesting.quest.SyNchvx5TpG6S7lF4jtiOA.desc=Your first destination! Absolutely chock full of §6Lithium§r, §6Quartz§r and most importantly your first source of §6Nickel§r to start producing §6Stainless Steel§r for space-grade machinery. The §eMun§r is the first atmosphere-less body available in a regular playthrough, necessary for making the first tier of §6Drive Processors§r in the §3Vacuum Solderer§r.%n%nThe B-Side destination alternative to the Mun, §eMinmus§r is characterized by a distinctive mint-choc-chip ice-cream aesthetic. §3Pumps§r function here, but instead of producing §bWater§r, this moon bizarrely produces §bMilk§r, allowing for full automation of §6Butter§r, §6Milkshakes§r and §6Ice-Cream§r.

# Quest: Laythe
betterquesting.quest.Tz9bzhSZQLGbAIEh4Zckbg.name=Laythe
betterquesting.quest.Tz9bzhSZQLGbAIEh4Zckbg.desc=A beautiful water world, teeming with life, oceans lit up with fields of glowgrass. §bJool gas§r can be harvested from here using a §3Gas Giant Harvester§r.

# Quest: Drive Processor Tier 1
betterquesting.quest.VetSLWDYS8OTb7T4X9aAEw.name=Drive Processor Tier 1
betterquesting.quest.VetSLWDYS8OTb7T4X9aAEw.desc=§3Drive Processor Tier 1§r allows for travel to §eDuna§r, §eIke§r and §eMoho§r.

# Quest: Brine Processing
betterquesting.quest.WRZqHx4ZRia4S1zEWYFg-Q.name=Brine Processing
betterquesting.quest.WRZqHx4ZRia4S1zEWYFg-Q.desc=§bBrine§r, which is found in deposits similar to oil ones on earth, can be processed to obtain materials such as §6Nickel§r, §6Copper§r and §6Sulfur§r, and fluids such as §bHydrogen§r and §bOxygen§r.

# Quest: Rocket Preparations
betterquesting.quest.XFyuo3SLQbmHtU7FcYdZ1g.name=Rocket Preparations
betterquesting.quest.XFyuo3SLQbmHtU7FcYdZ1g.desc=Due to the expansive nature of rocket assembly, it is highly recommend that the wiki is checked out as it provides more information.%n%n[url]https://nucleartech.wiki/wiki/Vehicle_Assembly_Base_(NTM:_Space)[/url]

# Quest: The Mun is Cheese...
betterquesting.quest.XzMOPvBIS9uEkD5JEXBvUw.name=The Mun is Cheese...
betterquesting.quest.XzMOPvBIS9uEkD5JEXBvUw.desc=When a century-old joke gets out of hand... At least you can make a juicy quesadilla.

# Quest: CO2 Scrubber
betterquesting.quest.Z-fgT88oSuSYcPPLotHREg.name=CO2 Scrubber
betterquesting.quest.Z-fgT88oSuSYcPPLotHREg.desc=The §3CO2 Scrubber§r is a mechanism for cleaning air in sealed environments under increased pressure.%n%nThe device absorbs §bCarbon Dioxide§r from the surrounding air and collects it. It only works if two conditions are met: the room is sealed and isolated, and the air pressure is elevated (above 1.0 atm). The latter can be achieved by adding a stream of §bOxygen§r from the ventilation to the Earth's air (resulting in a total pressure of 1.1 atm).%n%n§2The maximum number of scrubbers in a room is 5; any additional units placed will not collect carbon dioxide.§r

# Quest: Orbital Station
betterquesting.quest.ZPHsRbLaQm60QluCeA8pVQ.name=Orbital Station
betterquesting.quest.ZPHsRbLaQm60QluCeA8pVQ.desc=The §3Orbital Station§r is a space station which is located at the orbit of §eEarth§r. §3Solar Panels§r in combination with §3Air Vents§r can be used to make a sustainable living environment in the station. Make sure to make airlocks to minimise air loss.

# Quest: Stardar and Drive Processor
betterquesting.quest.ZPfHiJvPQIutgvhSROlbeQ.name=Stardar and Drive Processor
betterquesting.quest.ZPfHiJvPQIutgvhSROlbeQ.desc=The §3StarDar§r is your base of operations for mission planning, helping you to locate and scan potential landing zones on planets, and §6Program Drives§r that can be inserted into your rocket's astronavigational systems to make journeys to said planets.%n%nThe §3Drive Processor§r processes drives that have been programmed by the StarDar, allowing them to be inserted into rocket navigation computers.

# Quest: Atmospheric Compressor
betterquesting.quest.aZBaZGfVRHeXWmLqDHjuUw.name=Atmospheric Compressor
betterquesting.quest.aZBaZGfVRHeXWmLqDHjuUw.desc=The §3Atmospheric Compressor§r collects air from different planets. In combination with a §3Cryogenic Distillation Machine§r it can produce many useful fluids and gasses.

# Quest: Solar Panel
betterquesting.quest.dVwxKlQ5SzaxZjGNcLFMEw.name=Solar Panel
betterquesting.quest.dVwxKlQ5SzaxZjGNcLFMEw.desc=The §3Solar Panel§r converts sunlight into §eelectricity§r. §2(Incredible)§r%n%nIt can operate on planet surfaces or in space. The device uses the general light level, so the panel's spatial orientation does not affect energy production. The energy output port is at the back.%n%n§2Energy production calculations for planets and their orbits:%n%nKerbin - §e2kHE/s§2%nMun - §e2kHE/s§2%nMinmus - §e2kHE/s§2%nDuna - §e880HE/s§2%nIke - §e880HE/s§2%nMoho - §e13.3kHE/s§2%nDres - §e240HE/s§2%nEve - §e3.84kHE/s§2%nLaythe - §e80HE/s§r

# Quest: Space Map
betterquesting.quest.eItNlZ6bRS2kA-0Ymm_pdA.name=Space Map
betterquesting.quest.eItNlZ6bRS2kA-0Ymm_pdA.desc=Here is my own (Bufka2011) map of our Kerbol system!%n[img height=300]resources:SpaceMap_by_Bufka2011.png[/img]

# Quest: Magma Drill
betterquesting.quest.gaeSExcOTaawSPifbbIVtg.name=Magma Drill
betterquesting.quest.gaeSExcOTaawSPifbbIVtg.desc=Unlike its counterpart from the original mod, the Magma Drill does not literally drill into the depths. It is designed for extracting magma from Moho, which, as known, is abundant on this planet both on the surface and in caves. To start working, the mechanism must be installed directly on the surface of a lava lake so that the lava touches the drill head and reaches the edges of the recess. Supply power to the drill, and it will operate automatically.%n%nMagma is output through casting channels into molds. Cooled magma forms Vulcanite, which should then be processed to obtain useful resources.%n%nIn addition to volcanite, the device extracts regular slag (much more than Vulcanite).

# Quest: Orbital Station Computer
betterquesting.quest.hG3STfQVT8uxD0PMB58DOQ.name=Orbital Station Computer
betterquesting.quest.hG3STfQVT8uxD0PMB58DOQ.desc=The §3Orbital Station Computer§r, when having a drive inserted into it, can move the station to its destination.%n%n§3Thrusters§r with fuel are required to be attached to the station.

# Quest: Alkylation Unit
betterquesting.quest.icj9Y8q0QiWjFk2g7dTnww.name=Alkylation Unit
betterquesting.quest.icj9Y8q0QiWjFk2g7dTnww.desc=The §3Alkylation Unit§r is designed to convert lighter hydrocarbons into useful heavier hydrocarbon products. From §bNatural Gas§r it can produce §bUnsaturated§r and §bAromatic hydrocarbons§r, commonly used for §6Rubber§r and §6Bakelite§r, and even produce §bBTX§r via the use of §bHigh-Performance Solvent§r. As a utility, it can also alkylate §bPetroleum Gas§r into §bLight Oil§r.

# Quest: Microgravity Algae Film
betterquesting.quest.nfgxBE2jRE2InE-vMVEfRQ.name=Microgravity Algae Film
betterquesting.quest.nfgxBE2jRE2InE-vMVEfRQ.desc=The §3Microgravity Algae Film§r is a machine is made of specialized layers of laythe plants that will convert §bCarbon Dioxide§r directly into §bLiquid Oxygen§r. They however only function when in orbit.%n%nThe §3CO2 Scrubber§r allows you to recover carbon dioxide from a pressurized room. This is occasionally useful when building space stations.

# Quest: Dres
betterquesting.quest.rkMKa7TCT5u0jJsdH6TWnw.name=Dres
betterquesting.quest.rkMKa7TCT5u0jJsdH6TWnw.desc=This planet has some of the most prized resources in the whole system, with even the primary fraction of bedrock ore consisting of incredibly valuable metals and materials. §6Niobium§r, §6Coltan§r, and §6Lanthanium§r ore is present here in vast quantities.

# Quest: StarDar Remote Access Console
betterquesting.quest.seA5V2QkTCO9NcMwAjcDIA.name=StarDar Remote Access Console
betterquesting.quest.seA5V2QkTCO9NcMwAjcDIA.desc=Enables remote access to StarDar.

# Quest: Tekto
betterquesting.quest.tryLG0jySbGKMHzTFhvWOA.name=Tekto
betterquesting.quest.tryLG0jySbGKMHzTFhvWOA.desc=A strange world, similar to §eEarth§r, where life is different because the vegetation, the only form of life there, is made of complex polymers, like rubber§r and plastic§r.%n%nTekto bedrock ore doesn’t have the non-metal variant; instead, it is replaced by the plastic variant, from which the player can obtain §6Polymer§r, §6Rubber§r, §6Semtex§r and §6PVC§r.

# Quest: My First Volcano!
betterquesting.quest.vTg3C5JATXuER43bG5IiiQ.name=My First Volcano!
betterquesting.quest.vTg3C5JATXuER43bG5IiiQ.desc=The formation of a volcano is driven by the §3volcanic core§r, a block that continuously erupts §blava§r, allowing the volcano to grow. The §blava§r cools quickly, turning into §6basalt§r or §6basaltic ore§r.%n%nThe resulting volcano grows quite slowly, reaching about 60 blocks in height over 20-30 minutes.%n%n§bVolcanic lava§r differs from §bregular lava§r not only in appearance. It "melts" any non-explosion-resistant blocks, so the volcano can extend underground.%n%n§6Basaltic ores§r (§6asbestos§r, §6sulfur§r, §6fluorite§r, §6molysite§r) form when the §blava§r cools, each with a 0.5%% chance.%n%n§6Volcanic gem ore§r spawns with a 5%% chance if the following conditions are met:%n- All 6 blocks around the cooling §blava§r are §6basalt§r or §blava§r;%n- The block 10 blocks above the cooling §blava§r is §6basalt§r or §blava§r;%n- There are fewer than 3 §blava§r blocks around the cooling §blava§r.%n%nThe §6ore§r also forms after §bvolcanic lava§r contacts §6diamond ore§r.%nThis means §6volcanic gems§r most often appear near the §3core§r or §3crater§r of the volcano.%n%n§3Forming a Radioactive Volcano§r%nIf the §3volcanic core§r is exposed to radioactive fallout (e.g., after a nearby nuclear explosion) for some time, the §3core§r will begin generating new §bvolcanic radioactive lava§r (yellow in color), ultimately leading to the formation of a so-called §3radioactive volcano§r. Such a volcano will consist not of §6basalt§r but of various types of §6quenched sellaphite blocks§r and §6sellaphite ores§r. The §blava§r will convert §6diamond ores§r into §6radioactive gem ore§r.

# Quest: Eve
betterquesting.quest.vWpv_FM5QYqYHsRsaNNwog.name=Eve
betterquesting.quest.vWpv_FM5QYqYHsRsaNNwog.desc=While it is possible to travel here with only a tier 2 drive processor to exploit the incredibly powerful schrabidic resources that exist here, players will not last long without the appropriate armor inserts, due to the highly corrosive atmosphere melting any armor it comes into contact with.%n

# Quest: Rocket Assembling and Launching
betterquesting.quest.w4uLB-JtTW-fCQA_qF6_ww.name=Rocket Assembling and Launching
betterquesting.quest.w4uLB-JtTW-fCQA_qF6_ww.desc=The §3Vehicle Assembly Base§r is a structure which is one of the most vital parts of your space-faring efforts. It'll allow you to stack your rockets and plan out each segment of your journey. Note that each rocket stage allows for one launch from a celestial body to another, so a two-stage rocket can make a round-trip between, say, the Earth and the Mun.%n%nThe §3Rocket Launch Pad§r is the only launch pad capable of supporting the various fuel loads and complex requirements of the stacked rockets. This is the only way to fuel up a rocket too, so you'll want to make multiple stages for launching from bodies without a pad. The pad itself has a GUI that'll indicate what your rocket requires to be launched.

# Quest: Volcanic Gem
betterquesting.quest.xbXJIo86R_-J4iKK6DY-6w.name=Volcanic Gem
betterquesting.quest.xbXJIo86R_-J4iKK6DY-6w.desc=A very valuable gemstone that is used to create a §6Cast Pickaxe§r, §6Meteorite Talisman§r, §6Black Diamond§r, §6Composite Euphemium Plates§r and §6Special 227mm Shells§r.

# Quest: Hydrazine
betterquesting.quest.xo0vihnyQgq8RTEi2c_ZZQ.name=Hydrazine
betterquesting.quest.xo0vihnyQgq8RTEi2c_ZZQ.desc=§bHydrazine§r is a powerful rocket fuel which is needed to operate a §3Drop Pod§r.

# Quest: Rocket Transporter Pad
betterquesting.quest.y2yrIQ6QRve-p9fRVJD0YA.name=Rocket Transporter Pad
betterquesting.quest.y2yrIQ6QRve-p9fRVJD0YA.desc=The §3Rocket Transporter Station§r is essential for sending and receiving cargo between celestial bodies.%n%n§3Transport rockets§r, similar to §3resource modules§r or §3Gas Giant Harvesters§r, automatically move various cargoes. To make the system work, you need at least one pair of linked platforms§r.%n%nThe platforms have compartments for outgoing and incoming items (blue and orange, respectively)§r, and they can handle liquids with §3dedicated buffers§r.%n%nTo link platforms, Shift+Right-Click with the §6Rocket Transporter Connector§r on one platform to save it, then Right-Click on another platform. To open the linker interface§r, Right-Click on a platform with the connector: it will display information about the linked platforms' locations.%n%nTo designate one of these points as the receiving point, click the button at the beginning of the row§r.%n%nTo launch the transporter rocket§r, the station must be fueled with §bliquid oxygen§r and §bhydrogen§r.

# Quest: Moho
betterquesting.quest.yWu2LtytQjGg65tFXTo2ow.name=Moho
betterquesting.quest.yWu2LtytQjGg65tFXTo2ow.desc=A fair-dinkum planet, hot as hell, and full of rare resources generally only found in the Nether. §6Australium§r is only found here, in vast quantities deep under the surface. Some of the largest caves ever generated within Minecraft can be found here.


## Quest Line: LV4 - End Game
betterquesting.questline.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAw.name=LV4 - End Game
betterquesting.questline.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAw.desc=Delve into Impossible Physics, Quantum Computing, Magic and maybe even destroy the world.%nThis chapter is about building the most advanced machines to reach the end goal of the mod.

# Quest: ICF Fuels
betterquesting.quest.2BKf-swBTG61f8eVn9ynhw.name=ICF Fuels
betterquesting.quest.2BKf-swBTG61f8eVn9ynhw.desc=The §3ICF§r can process different combinations of fuels at different laser power levels. A cheap and renewable fuel that can be used to gather the §bStellar Flux§r needed for §6Gerald§r and make decent power is §bHelium-4 - Hydrogen§r.%n%nApplying a Muon Particle to a fuel pellet will decrease the power that is needed to run it.

# Quest: Dineurtom amrr
betterquesting.quest.6PZEF2npTwy_exs-JQAKYg.name=Dineurtom amrr
betterquesting.quest.6PZEF2npTwy_exs-JQAKYg.desc=Increasus damge takn by 5x tims%nBestest armr in da wurld!!!!!!1!!1!!%n%nStaje of da gaim - Brayn Partiklz%nProtekshun levl - Funtastick%nFeetchurs - Yoor Btes Chois

# Quest: Particle Capsules
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA8A.name=Particle Capsules
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA8A.desc=Particles are important items required to create exotic materials which are needed for most of the endgame content.

# Quest: Quantum Computer
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFg.name=Quantum Computer
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFg.desc=The §6Quantum Computer§r is the most powerful out of any other control unit. It currently only used to build §6Gerald§r. %n%n§2A whole stack of them will be required, so now would be the time to upgrade circuit crafting infrastructure.

# Quest: Solid State Quantum Processor
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGA.name=Solid State Quantum Processor
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGA.desc=The §6Solid State Quantum Processor§r is the first quantum circuit related component needed to make §6Quantum Processing Units§r and §6Quantum Computers§r.

# Quest: DNT Nanosuit
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANQ.name=DNT Nanosuit
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANQ.desc=The §6DNT Nanosuit§r is final goal of the mod. By crafting this armor you have reached the end of progression.%n%n§5Thanks for playing!

# Quest: DFC
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANw.name=DFC
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANw.desc=The §3DFC§r is the last reactor of the mod and as such is very expensive to craft. Apart from the DFC parts, two §6Catalysts§r are needed for the reactor to work.%n%nIt is recommended that the wiki is checked out.%n%n[url]https://nucleartech.wiki/wiki/DFC[/url]

# Quest: Chicken Nugget
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAATQ.name=Chicken Nugget
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAATQ.desc=The §6Chicken Nugget§r is the best food item in the mod, completely filling up both hunger and saturation. It is made by colliding 2 raw chickens in a §3Particle Accelerator§r.

# Quest: Exposure Chamber
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAZg.name=Exposure Chamber
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAZg.desc=The §3Exposure Chamber§r is a machine in which many materials can be created by exposing ingots to certain particles, most important of which being §6Dineutronium§r.

# Quest: Euphemium
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA_A.name=Euphemium
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA_A.desc=§6Euphemium§r is a fictional material which serves as one of the mod's most endgame materials. It's extremely expensive to produce in large amounts and you will need great advancement through the mod to use it effectively.

# Quest: Dineutronium
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA_Q.name=Dineutronium
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA_Q.desc=§6Dineutronium§r is the mod's (almost) ultimate material. It's a final tier material and is a higher tier than even §6Euphemium§r. It is very difficult to produce and it's used to make the most absurd and broken items this mod has. The only material that is more difficult to make, would be §6Osmiridium§r.

# Quest: The Digamma Particle
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA_g.name=The Digamma Particle
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA_g.desc=The §c§r§4§r§6Digamma Particle§r is created by colliding a §6Sparkticle Capsule§r with a §6Higgs Boson Capsule§r in a §3Particle Accelerator§r. Making it in the particle accelerator will require §6Chlorophyte Coils§r and momentum of 70,000.%n%nThe digamma particle emits a different kind of radiation, §4DRX§r, which currently can only be countered by the use of digamma medication, most notably §6Enteramine Pills§r, which provide full immunity against DRX for 10 minutes. After the §3DFC§r, Fau armor can be crafted which provides full resistance against DRX.

# Quest: Murky Anvil
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA_w.name=Murky Anvil
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA_w.desc=The§3 Murky Anvil§r is the ultimate version of the §3Anvil§r, having all recipes unlocked.

# Quest: Quantum Processing Unit
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAbQ.name=Quantum Processing Unit
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAbQ.desc=The §6Quantum Processing Unit§r is the first quantum circuit one makes, used in the §3Particle Accelerator§r and §3ICF§r reactor.

# Quest: ICF
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAig.name=ICF
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAig.desc=The §3ICF§r reactor is a very expensive and powerful reactor, which can produce a substantial amount of energy. Apart from the multiblock itself, §3ICF Lasers§r must be constructed for the reactor to work. §bStellar Flux§r will be produced during its operation which is needed to craft §6Gerald§r. Consider making use of §bLiquid Lead§r as it is a very efficient coolant for the ICF.%n%nIt is recommended that the wiki is checked out as it has built-in calculators for the laser power consumption and the amount of hot coolant it produces.%n%n[url]https://nucleartech.wiki/wiki/Inertial_Confinement_Fusion_Reactor[/url]

# Quest: Spark Laser Crystal
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABBA.name=Spark Laser Crystal
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABBA.desc=The §6Spark Laser Crystal§r unlocks new recipes, most importantly it is used to create §6Osmiridium§r.

# Quest: The Book of Boxcars
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABBQ.name=The Book of Boxcars
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABBQ.desc=The §6Book of Boxcars§r is an item which allows the crafting of many special items. The book can be found inside §eMeteorite Dungeons§r found randomly in the wilderness on extra-terrestial bodies, indicated by a black pillar, or in §eRed Rooms§r.

# Quest: Digamma Laser Crystal
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABBw.name=Digamma Laser Crystal
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABBw.desc=The §6Digamma Laser Crystal§r is the fastest and final laser crystal which can be used in a SILEX.%n%n§2If the laser touches any block, the surrounding area will be atomized.

# Quest: Dineutronium Anvil
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABEA.name=Dineutronium Anvil
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABEA.desc=An upgraded version of the §3Anvil§r, [T7], which unlocks additional recipes.

# Quest: Spark Singularity
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABFQ.name=Spark Singularity
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABFQ.desc=The §6Spark Singularity§r is a singularity made from combining all the types of singularities with §6Dineutronium§r.

# Quest: FEnSU
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABFg.name=FEnSU
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABFg.desc=The §3FenSU§r is the ultimate energy storage block, being able to store §k1239217§rTHE.

# Quest: Gerald the Construction Android
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABHw.name=Gerald the Construction Android
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABHw.desc=§6Gerald the Construction Android§r is the most powerful weapon in the mod. Using this has the side effect of setting the world on fire but also getting tektite, which contains §6Osmiridium§r.%n%nGerald is the hardest recipe of the mod requiring hundreds of thousands of items, mainly circuit related.%n%nVast quantities of §6Bismuth§r, §6Tantalium§r and §6Silicon§r are needed, so dont hold back on bedrock ore processing and parallelisation of many processes. If you havent already used §dAE2§r, it is highly recommended at this stage of the game.%n%nLaunching Gerald will result in a global firestorm that will decimate all life, including all trees and grass. Make sure to keep a backup of your world before launching him.%n%n§2Blueprints for Gerald and the Orbital Module can be found in structures or purchased from Bobmazon.

# Quest: Osmiridium
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABIQ.name=Osmiridium
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABIQ.desc=§6Osmiridium§r is the second most expensive material and is used primarely in the §3DFC§r.

# Quest: Yharonite Billet
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABKg.name=Yharonite Billet
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABKg.desc=The §6Yharonite Billet§r is created in a tungsten crate that has §6Polonium Billets§r in it while being shot from a §3DFC Emitter§r. This is the final material obtained in the mod.

# Quest: The Crucible
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABLw.name=The Crucible
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABLw.desc=The §6Crucible§r is a weapon that deals extreme amount of damage. It can be recharged inside a Tungsten Crate shot by a §3DFC Emitter§r.

# Quest: Schrabidium Hammer
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABMA.name=Schrabidium Hammer
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABMA.desc=The §6Schrabidium Hammer§r is the most powerful weapon in the mod, being able to one-shot everything.

# Quest: Magnetohydrodynamic Turbines
betterquesting.quest.DOSq2NdFQ3Ojsk2F4OtgMQ.name=Magnetohydrodynamic Turbines
betterquesting.quest.DOSq2NdFQ3Ojsk2F4OtgMQ.desc=§3Magnetohydrodynamic Turbines§r are advanced components of the fusion reactor that make electricity out of the plasma energy directly without needing additional turbines. While more expensive and requiring §bPerfluoromethyl§r cooling, they have a §e+35%%§r convertion bonus from §eTU§r to §eHE§r. In addition, the MDH turbine requires a minimum input of%n§e5MTU/t§r of plasma energy to operate normally, otherwise efficiency will be halved.

# Quest: Done
betterquesting.quest.FmWwl9ntTjeMSWhXcVcTdg.name=§cDone
betterquesting.quest.FmWwl9ntTjeMSWhXcVcTdg.desc=Phew, that was quite a journey... Hopefully there is more to come with some modpack updates!%n%nNow [warn]GO TOUCH SOME GRASS IMMIDIATELY[/warn].%n%n§6§lRATE OUR MODPACK: §r[url]https://moddex.gg/modpack/ntnewhorizons[/url]

# Quest: Secret Catalogue
betterquesting.quest.J9dwgncgSUydHFPUoI85oQ.name=Secret Catalogue
betterquesting.quest.J9dwgncgSUydHFPUoI85oQ.desc=In order to obtain a hidden catalog, you have to do a few things:%n%nGet a regular sign%nAnswer the four questions and put the answers on said sign in the same order (all lowercase)%nRight click the written sign%nThere will be answers with more characters than signs allow, just type out as many as possible.%n%nThere will be no hints, so don't even try it.%nYou'll need the bobmazon level 6 achievement to order anything.%n%n%n%n1%nWhen we scream into the distance, who will answer?%n%n2%nThe invisible force, sometimes subtle and sometimes not, covers our eyes directed at the skies.%n%n3%nThe fluorescent oscilloscope gives us the passcode of random numbers. Who holds the answers?%n%n4%nEver revolving, never still, a sight for the patient that reeks of tobacco, dancing perpetually.

# Quest: Particle Accelerator
betterquesting.quest._nmJ1zrSQp22psctX6Uq2A.name=Particle Accelerator
betterquesting.quest._nmJ1zrSQp22psctX6Uq2A.desc=The §3Particle Accelerator§r is a highly modular machine that uses high strength superconducting magnets to accelerate particles to relativistic speeds in order to collide them together.%n%nDue to the complex and expansive nature of the particle accelerator, it is highly recommend that the wiki is checked out as it provides more information.%n%n[url]https://nucleartech.wiki/wiki/Particle_Accelerator[/url]%n%n§2This quest demands the most essential parts of the particle accelerator, and does not represent the amount needed for it to function.

# Quest: HOW THE FUCK?!
betterquesting.quest.fbvQbC3JTKOtI2b8e3cB0A.name=§c§l§4§lHOW THE FUCK?!
betterquesting.quest.fbvQbC3JTKOtI2b8e3cB0A.desc=Here ya go, your reward

# Quest: ICF Laser Turbocharger
betterquesting.quest.hmwBFeuMQXiUrjE-WdD6-g.name=ICF Laser Turbocharger
betterquesting.quest.hmwBFeuMQXiUrjE-WdD6-g.desc=The §3ICF Laser Turbocharger§r can be placed next to §3ICF Laser Capacitors§r to increase the laser's power by a substantial amount, allowing for the §3ICF§r to run higher grade fuels.

# Quest: Balls-O-Tron
betterquesting.quest.k-HwTdGiQVmikRwAeg_fkQ.name=Balls-O-Tron
betterquesting.quest.k-HwTdGiQVmikRwAeg_fkQ.desc=§4Balls-O-Tron§r is the second boss of §dNTM§r. It can be summoned by interracting the mechanist's circle, found in the §eEnargite Temple§r which spawns in jungles, with a §6Silver Key§r, made using the Maskman Coin, or from crafting the Balls-O-Tron spawn item.

# Quest: ICF Laser
betterquesting.quest.nqmqybchRzWn-T46-3vHmQ.name=ICF Laser
betterquesting.quest.nqmqybchRzWn-T46-3vHmQ.desc=§2This quest provides an optional retrieval task for a small laser capable of running Helium-4 - Hydrogen Fuel at 15MHE.§r

# Quest: UFO
betterquesting.quest.q0Q4S7F-QlCzGWDkdOBMqw.name=UFO
betterquesting.quest.q0Q4S7F-QlCzGWDkdOBMqw.desc=The Martian Invasion Ship is a late-game boss which is killed to get the §6UFO Coin§r, used in crafting Gerald.%n%nThis quest provides an alternative way of obtaining the coin.%n%n§2This quest can be repeated.

# Quest: Welded Osmiridium Plate
betterquesting.quest.xYmNHPDAQkSwXHOow8--4g.name=Welded Osmiridium Plate
betterquesting.quest.xYmNHPDAQkSwXHOow8--4g.desc=§6Welded Osmiridium Plates§r cost 300 Billion §eHE§r to produce, so good energy generation and storage infrastructure is needed.


## Quest Line: Tips and Tricks
betterquesting.questline.MJP4MeAmSTm_Di0iRHoQuw.name=Tips and Tricks
betterquesting.questline.MJP4MeAmSTm_Di0iRHoQuw.desc=Tips and Tricks. It does what it says.

# Quest: Infinite Water Sources
betterquesting.quest.xlNjQwC6S3S5o_B7nIciBQ.name=Infinite Water Sources
betterquesting.quest.xlNjQwC6S3S5o_B7nIciBQ.desc=Tired of using buckets to give water to your machines? Try using water pumps or infinite water tanks!%n%nInfinite Water Tank will give 50mb/t%nEnhanced Infinite Water Tank will give 500mb/t%nPump will give 1000mb/t but requires steam to operate.


## Quest Line: Farming and Cooking
betterquesting.questline.UJ4N6pDhQ5aGBxBW9j-BVw.name=Farming and Cooking
betterquesting.questline.UJ4N6pDhQ5aGBxBW9j-BVw.desc=Everything about how to farm and cook.


## Quest Line: Building and Decorating
betterquesting.questline.7-1bBIkKRc6xhh5bwIGsjg.name=Building and Decorating
betterquesting.questline.7-1bBIkKRc6xhh5bwIGsjg.desc=Improve your builds by using Chisel, Architecturecraft and Better Builder's Wands.

# Quest: Building Gadget
betterquesting.quest.8voIl_BdSZWqZcTPQVjo9Q.name=Building Gadget
betterquesting.quest.8voIl_BdSZWqZcTPQVjo9Q.desc=The §6Building Gadget§r is an advanced building tool which allows the user to create many complex shapes with ease. Press the ALT key to open its menu.%n%n§2It consumes power for blocks placed.§r

# Quest: Auto Chisel
betterquesting.quest.QS-1ophNScaPpKGGoCqFMQ.name=Auto Chisel
betterquesting.quest.QS-1ophNScaPpKGGoCqFMQ.desc=The §3Auto Chisel§r allows for automated chiseling of blocks. Simply insert any chisel in the machine and the block that will act as the template.

# Quest: Chisel
betterquesting.quest.TA6SPr3KTbKsgRFceNMZmA.name=Chisel
betterquesting.quest.TA6SPr3KTbKsgRFceNMZmA.desc=The §6Chisel§r is a building tool which can be used to change the textures of blocks, and even unlock new and unique designs.

# Quest: Schematica
betterquesting.quest.VyF-RUbsSuS8J2hbI5CIkw.name=Schematica
betterquesting.quest.VyF-RUbsSuS8J2hbI5CIkw.desc=With §dSchematica§r, you can create schematics of your builds and post holograms of them on other worlds. Check out the keybinds to get started.

# Quest: Modern Markings
betterquesting.quest.j9eLuGnhRVWn5uJS_KI5lg.name=Modern Markings
betterquesting.quest.j9eLuGnhRVWn5uJS_KI5lg.desc=§dModern Markings§r adds wall and floor decorations suited for many purposes. Use the §6Chisel§r on the floor or wall signs to change their design.

# Quest: Better Builder's Wands
betterquesting.quest.mPZ8D32cT5WrvlKuPNq90g.name=Better Builder's Wands
betterquesting.quest.mPZ8D32cT5WrvlKuPNq90g.desc=The §6Building Wand§r allows one to place many blocks at once, making walls and roads easier to construct. The stronger material the wand is made out of, the more blocks it can place.%n%n§2To replace water blocks using wands bind the key, Change Fluid Mode, in settings.

# Quest: ArchitectureCraft
betterquesting.quest.p7NNm2NvRgWz37LQO6yraw.name=ArchitectureCraft
betterquesting.quest.p7NNm2NvRgWz37LQO6yraw.desc=§dArchitectureCraft§r introduces the §3Architect's Workbench§r which can be used to change the shapes blocks.%n%nThe §6Architect's Hammer§r can be used to easily rotate the blocks.%n%nThe §6Architect's Glowbrush§r can be used to apply light to any block.

# Quest: Sign Pictures
betterquesting.quest.wAu-q390TlKihyp-bEI2lw.name=Sign Pictures
betterquesting.quest.wAu-q390TlKihyp-bEI2lw.desc=The §dSignPicture§r mod allows one to put any image on a sign, opening the door to many unique building designs. Press  to get started.


## Quest Line: Reward Area
betterquesting.questline.VIthQchWRnKIQ6qTwFcPFg.name=Reward Area
betterquesting.questline.VIthQchWRnKIQ6qTwFcPFg.desc=Trade your rewards.

# Quest: LV1 > LV2 Lootbag Trade
betterquesting.quest.8XIrl7C6Q5qBBT6HSgTHIA.name=LV1 > LV2 Lootbag Trade
betterquesting.quest.8XIrl7C6Q5qBBT6HSgTHIA.desc=Trade three LV1 lootbags to get a better one: LV2.

# Quest: LV3 > LV3.5 Lootbag Trade
betterquesting.quest.U9KescpLTHK_XLG4Qil9zw.name=LV3 > LV3.5 Lootbag Trade
betterquesting.quest.U9KescpLTHK_XLG4Qil9zw.desc=Trade two LV3 lootbags to get a LV3.5.

# Quest: LV2 > LV3 Lootbag Trade
betterquesting.quest.b_QkCMniQPmbvS4FX5sq-w.name=LV2 > LV3 Lootbag Trade
betterquesting.quest.b_QkCMniQPmbvS4FX5sq-w.desc=Trade three LV2 lootbags to get a better one: LV3.

# Quest: LV3.5 > LV4 Lootbag Trade
betterquesting.quest.ecBXzr6RQ-i6XoIXFOvd5A.name=LV3.5 > LV4 Lootbag Trade
betterquesting.quest.ecBXzr6RQ-i6XoIXFOvd5A.desc=Trade eight LV3.5 lootbags to get a better one: LV4.

# Quest: LV3 > LV4 Lootbag Trade
betterquesting.quest.qG74J_R9TQub-uWbBzZkoQ.name=LV3 > LV4 Lootbag Trade
betterquesting.quest.qG74J_R9TQub-uWbBzZkoQ.desc=Trade four LV3 lootbags to get a better one: LV4.


## Quest Line: Applied Energistics 2
betterquesting.questline.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABQ.name=Applied Energistics 2
betterquesting.questline.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABQ.desc=Automate your factory using Applied Energistics 2.

# Quest: P2P ME Networking
betterquesting.quest.1bFqt414QEOwMpAVRSd3zg.name=P2P ME Networking
betterquesting.quest.1bFqt414QEOwMpAVRSd3zg.desc=§3P2P ME§r can be used to transport massive amounts of channels without laying many cables.%n%n§2This quest serves as a guide on how to effectively use P2P ME.§r%n%nOnce an §3Energy Acceptor§r has been set up, it is highly recommended (and likely needed) that an §3Energy Cell§r is placed next to it as to ensure that there is enough power going to the system, as more components increase the energy demands of the ME system.%n%nAfter that, 2 §3ME Controllers§r are required, one to provide the channels that machines will use, and another to transport the other's channels by the P2P connections. The top controller can be made bigger by attaching more controllers next to it.%n%n[img height=1000]betterquesting:textures/QB_Controller1.png[/img]%n%nAfter the controllers are placed, on the top controller, a P2P Tunnel - ME needs to be placed on any side. The §9Blue Cable§r will serve as the cable that connects the P2P connections, and as such, it needs to be connected to the bottom controller.%n%n[img height=1000]betterquesting:textures/QB_Controller2.png[/img]%n%nBy linking the P2P connections together using a §6Memory Card§r, the 32 channels from one side of the top controller will only use 1 channel from the bottom controller to be transported to any destination. The §cRed Cable§r now has access to 32 channels.%n%n[img height=1000]betterquesting:textures/QB_Controller3.png[/img]%n%n[img height=1000]betterquesting:textures/QB_Controller4.png[/img]%n%nBy expanding on the previous example, more connections can be added to fully utilize all channels.%n%n[img height=1000]betterquesting:textures/QB_Controller5.png[/img]%n%n[img height=1000]betterquesting:textures/QB_controller6.png[/img]%n

# Quest: P2P Interface Parallelisation
betterquesting.quest.1rIaClFKQbGXrdGi5-Eppg.name=P2P Interface Parallelisation
betterquesting.quest.1rIaClFKQbGXrdGi5-Eppg.desc=Parallelisation of processes can significantly cut down on waiting time and as such it is highly recommended that P2P Interfaces are used.%n%n§2This quest serves as a guide on how to use P2P Interfaces.§r%n%nAs any P2P Connection goes, there needs to be one input, which in this case, holds the §6ME Patterns§r.%n%n[img height=1000]betterquesting:textures/QB_P2P_Interface1.png[/img]%n%nAfter patterns are inserted in the first P2P interface, place down the rest of the output interfaces you want and link them together using a §6Memory Card§r.%n%nIn the image below, the P2P interface highlighted in green stores the patterns, while the ones in blue, are the output ones which will connect machines to the ME system.%n%n[img height=1000]betterquesting:textures/QB_P2P_Interface2.png[/img]%n%nMake sure to have blocking mode enabled on all output P2P interfaces as to prevent clogging and having multiple recipes trying to be executed at once in the same machine.%n%n[img height=1000]betterquesting:textures/QB_P2P_Interface3.png[/img]%n%nFinally, place your desired machines at the output P2P interfaces and add a way of retrieving the items once the operation is done, in this case import buses.%n%n[img height=1000]betterquesting:textures/QB_P2P_Interface4.png[/img]%n

# Quest: ME IO Port
betterquesting.quest.4DM_-wpzThCM_KaSMIPmNA.name=ME IO Port
betterquesting.quest.4DM_-wpzThCM_KaSMIPmNA.desc=The §3ME IO Port§r can transfer the contents of storage cells into an ME Network and back.

# Quest: Spatial IO
betterquesting.quest.5PE7heWhR4qG8AcOcZ0VWQ.name=Spatial IO
betterquesting.quest.5PE7heWhR4qG8AcOcZ0VWQ.desc=§3Spatial IO§r is a way to cut-and-paste physical volumes of space in your world. It works by swapping the defined volume with an identically-sized volume in the spatial storage dimension, sending whatever's in the pylon array to the spatial storage dimension, and whatever's in the dimension to the pylon array.%n%nSpatial IO requires a specific arrangement of its components in order to function, and define the volume to be cut-and-pasted. All of the components must be on the same network in order to function, and you can have only one spatial IO setup on a network. Thus, a subnetwork is recommended.%n%nThe §3Spatial IO Port§r controls the spatial IO operation. It shows stats on the multiblock setup, and holds the spatial cells%n%nTo perform a spatial IO operation, place a §6Spatial Storage Cell§r in the input slot and give the spatial IO port a redstone pulse. It will then swap the volume in the pylons with the volume in the spatial storage dimension. This means that if you send some set of blocks to the spatial storage dimension, then put another set of blocks in the pylons, put the cell back in the input slot, and trigger the IO port again, the 2nd set of blocks will disappear and the 1st set of blcks will reappear.%n%nAny entity in the defined volume, including you, will be carried along, and if you have no way of getting out, you will be trapped in the spatial storage dimension.%n%n§3Spatial Pylons§r are the main part of a spatial IO setup, and define the volume to be affected. The volume is defined by the bounding box of the outside of the pylons, contracted in by 1 block in all directions.

# Quest: AE2 Changes
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAARg.name=AE2 Changes
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAARg.desc=In this modpack, §dApplied Energistics 2§r has been changed to fit in more with §dNTM§r. Many components have been changed to include NTM materials and some machines, like the §3Grinder§r and §3Inscriber§r, have had their functions moved to the §3Shredder§r and §3Press§r. The meteors have also been removed, but §6Skystone§r can still be crafted for building purposes.%n%nThis Chapter of the quests has its information derived from the FTB Wiki. If anything else is missing from the quest book, please visit the wiki.%n%n[url]https://ftbwiki.org/Applied_Energistics_2[/url]

# Quest: Certus Quartz Crystal
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAARw.name=Certus Quartz Crystal
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAARw.desc=§6Certus Quartz§r is an important material in AE2. It is dropped when mining or processing certus quartz ore at the rate of one to four, the yield is affected by a tool's Fortune enchantment. Certus Quartz is often interchangeable with vanilla §6Nether Quartz§r in the recipes for basic tools, such as the §6Quartz Cutting Knife§r. Certus quartz ore can be acidized or centrifuged for an increased yield.%n%n§2Certus quartz can later be made in a Chemical Plant using nether quartz.

# Quest: Crystal Growth Chamber
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAATA.name=Crystal Growth Chamber
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAATA.desc=The§3 Crystal Growth Chamber§r is a machine in which crystals can grow at an increased speed, while also being in a block instead of being dropped in the ground.

# Quest: Wireless Terminal
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAXQ.name=Wireless Terminal
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAXQ.desc=The §3Security Terminal§r can be used to specify what players are allowed to interact with in the ME network which can be useful in multiplayer. It can also be used to link a §6Wireless Terminal§r to the ME network. Atleast one §3Wireless Access Point§r is required, and its range can be expanded using §6Wireless Boosters§r.

# Quest: Storage Components
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAYQ.name=Storage Components
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAYQ.desc=The §6ME Storage Housing§r is the outer shell of a §6Storage Cell§r. There are many tiers of storage cells, all of which require the use of NTM machines to be crafted.

# Quest: Fluix Crystal
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAbA.name=Fluix Crystal
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAbA.desc=§6Fluix Crystals§r are another crystal type which is used in crafting recipes throughout the mod. The crystal comes in two forms, the regular fluix crystal and the §6Pure Fluix Crystal§r.%n%nTo create a fluix crystal, 1§6 Charged Certus Quartz§r, 1 §6Nether Quartz§r, and 1 §6Redstone Dust§r must be dropped into a pool of §bWater§r. They will be consumed and output 2 fluix crystals.%n%n§2Fluix crystals can later be made in a Chemical Plant using charged certus quartz and redstone.

# Quest: Crystal Growth Accelerator
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAcQ.name=Crystal Growth Accelerator
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAcQ.desc=The §3Crystal Growth Accelerator§r is a machine that uses energy to accelerate the process of crystal purification. This process transforms crystal seeds into pure versions of their fully developed counterparts.

# Quest: Charger
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAcw.name=Charger
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAcw.desc=The §3Charger§r is a machine which will charge §6Certus Quartz Crystals§r into their charged form at the expense of power.

# Quest: Cable Fluix
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAeQ.name=Cable Fluix
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAeQ.desc=The §6ME Glass Cable - Fluix§r is a cable used to transmit data and energy between devices in an ME Network. It is capable of transmitting §f§e8 channels§r simultaneously.%n%nThe §6Quartz Fiber§r is used to transfer energy, but not channels.%n%n§6Cable Anchors§r can be used to seperate ME cable connections. They can also be used to make §6Facades§r for the cables.

# Quest: Energy Acceptor
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAew.name=Energy Acceptor
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAew.desc=The §3Energy Acceptor§r transfers energy into the ME system. In combination with an §3HE to RF Converter§r, the ME system can be powered.%n%n[img height=1000]betterquesting:textures/QB_EnergyAcceptor.png[/img]

# Quest: ME Terminal
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAfA.name=ME Terminal
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAfA.desc=The §3ME Terminal§r is used to access all available items in the ME Network, including craftable ones.

# Quest: ME Drive
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAfQ.name=ME Drive
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAfQ.desc=The §3ME Drive§r serves as the storage of the ME system, in which §6Storage Cells§r can be put and store items.

# Quest: ME Interface
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAfg.name=ME Interface
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAfg.desc=The §3ME Interface§r is a block which allows the ME Network to interact with machines and inventories. On their own, they can be used to automatically stock inventories, but can be used with §6ME Patterns§r later on for autocrafting.

# Quest: ME Controller
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAgA.name=ME Controller
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAgA.desc=The ME Controller acts as the routing hub of an ME network. It can support up to 8 devices connected to it.

# Quest: ME Buses
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAgg.name=ME Buses
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAgg.desc=The §3ME Export Bus§r is an ME component which is used to export items from the ME network into a machine or other input inventory. %n%nThe §3ME Import Bus§r is an ME component which is used to import items directly into the ME Network from a machine or other output inventory.%n%n§2It is recommended that Interfaces are used over Export/Import buses for performance reasons.

# Quest: Infinity Booster Card
betterquesting.quest.EPrM6umbSw2e8c3-9XF9Wg.name=Infinity Booster Card
betterquesting.quest.EPrM6umbSw2e8c3-9XF9Wg.desc=The §6Infinity Booster Card§r allows one to access their ME system across any distance and dimension. To apply simply open the §6Wireless Crafting Terminal§r and insert the card in it.

# Quest: P2P
betterquesting.quest.Ig84-U5cRH-rxH76bIGE9A.name=P2P
betterquesting.quest.Ig84-U5cRH-rxH76bIGE9A.desc=§6P2P§r Tunnel or "Point to Point Tunnels" are a versatile configurable system to move items / redstone / power / and fluids from one location to another though an existing ME Network without storage.%n%nTunnels are §e1 input to N outputs§r. This means you can output to as many points as you want, but only input at a single point per tunnel.%n%nNetworks can support any number of tunnels, of any different types, and they all function independently.%n%nME tunnels can be used to carry channels from one location to another, and can carry up to §e32 channels§r, same as a §6ME Dense Cable§r, while only requiring a single channel per point, making tunnels a very powerful tool to expand me networks, especially over a distance. However with the great flex-ability they give you comes a limitation, the channel of a p2p tunnel cannot be carried by another p2p tunnel, meaning that you cannot nest them recursively.%n%nTo configure a P2P tunnel you must first attune the tunnel to carry what you want it to, then you need to configure the outputs to their input. You configure the connections by using the §6Memory Card§r. First Shift+Right Click the input to save it on your memory card, then simply right click the different outputs to store the input onto the outputs. this also sets the type of the output to match the type of the input.%n%n§2An advanced version of the Memory Card can also be made, which interacts with the entire network.

# Quest: Wireless Crafting Terminal
betterquesting.quest.Iyj0bDhVRpCgzmAF4vP30A.name=Wireless Crafting Terminal
betterquesting.quest.Iyj0bDhVRpCgzmAF4vP30A.desc=An upgraded version of the §6Wireless Terminal§r, capable of crafting items on the go.

# Quest: Interface P2P
betterquesting.quest.Kcfw9puQQo-iehBFrlOp4g.name=Interface P2P
betterquesting.quest.Kcfw9puQQo-iehBFrlOp4g.desc=The §3P2P Interface§r is a P2P device which can be used to easily paralellize recipes across many machines.

# Quest: Energy Cell
betterquesting.quest.Npl3Ifl9RvW8JZRicJaP2A.name=Energy Cell
betterquesting.quest.Npl3Ifl9RvW8JZRicJaP2A.desc=The §3Energy Cell§r acts as a battery for the ME network. It becomes useful when the ME system begins to consume large amounts of energy, so a buffer is needed so it doesnt turn on and off constantly.

# Quest: Modifier Cards
betterquesting.quest.Qxy7Wf9WRnG-vIisndmV0g.name=Modifier Cards
betterquesting.quest.Qxy7Wf9WRnG-vIisndmV0g.desc=§6Modifier Cards§r allow for modification to various ME components, such as speeding them up or being able to toggle them on and off using redstone.

# Quest: Wireless Connectors
betterquesting.quest.ReqBRrKdR2WFSp9ILSPk5w.name=Wireless Connectors
betterquesting.quest.ReqBRrKdR2WFSp9ILSPk5w.desc=§3Wireless Connectors§r allow for channel linking without ME cables, making it possible to send channels through walls. The further away the connectors are the more energy consuming they become.%n%nA §3Wireless Hub§r can be used to link channels between multiple wireless connectors.

# Quest: Network Tool
betterquesting.quest.VE7Ty89_SMW45uAVQdD32g.name=Network Tool
betterquesting.quest.VE7Ty89_SMW45uAVQdD32g.desc=The §6Network Tool§r, when right-clicking on any network device will bring up the tool's interface showing all devices connected to the network as well as network details. As any wrench, shift clicking on a cable will remove it.

# Quest: AE2 Autocrafting
betterquesting.quest.WUUIPZ-KQFCpsXAcpOxwqw.name=AE2 Autocrafting
betterquesting.quest.WUUIPZ-KQFCpsXAcpOxwqw.desc=§2This quest serves an a guide on how to order items using the ME system. The example item will be an Analog Circuit.§r%n%nWith an §3ME Drive§r providing item storage, a §3Crafting CPU§r and §3Interfaces§r, one can request any item to be crafted. The image below makes use of a §3Molecular Assembler§r, a §3Soldering Station§r, an §3Electric Press§r aswell as two §3Import Buses§r which serve as an output for the solderer and press.%n%n[img height=1000]betterquesting:textures/BQ_Auto1.png[/img]%n%nThe first step in automating crafting recipes is to encode §6ME Patterns§r. There are two types of patterns, crafting and processing. The crafting pattern is created by having the §3Pattern Terminal§r set to the crafting table. After placing the items in the terminal, press the arrow to finish encoding the recipe.%n%n[img height=1000]betterquesting:textures/BQ_Auto2.png[/img]%n%nFor recipes which arent made in a crafting table, such as the §6Wires§r and the §6Analog Circuit§r itself, the pattern terminal needs to be switched to the processing mode, which has a furnace icon.%n%n[img height=1000]betterquesting:textures/BQ_Auto3.png[/img]%n%nAfter all the patterns have been created, insert them into their respective interfaces.%nMake sure to enable blocking mode on the interfaces as not to have multiple different recipes enter the interface at once.%n%n[img height=1000]betterquesting:textures/BQ_Auto4.png[/img]%n%nFinally, after everything has been set up, the option to order items will be shown in the ME terminal.%n%n[img height=1000]betterquesting:textures/BQ_Auto5.png[/img]%n

# Quest: Cell Workbench
betterquesting.quest._RJ-wMmFRWepNEgav4H2ZQ.name=Cell Workbench
betterquesting.quest._RJ-wMmFRWepNEgav4H2ZQ.desc=The §3Cell Workbench§r allow to filter cells to accept specific items. It can prove useful for when making a subnet for §eBedrock Ore Processing§r.

# Quest: ME Storage Bus
betterquesting.quest.b4Wb4VV0RkSBMjTUJj8Idg.name=ME Storage Bus
betterquesting.quest.b4Wb4VV0RkSBMjTUJj8Idg.desc=The §3ME Storage Bus§r, when attached to an block/tile entity with an inventory (generally a storage unit, such as chests or a §3Drawer Controller§r), will include that inventory's contents in the ME System.%n

# Quest: Pattern Capacity Card
betterquesting.quest.d4NudAjPT3G3f26jL0-SaA.name=Pattern Capacity Card
betterquesting.quest.d4NudAjPT3G3f26jL0-SaA.desc=The §6Pattern Capacity Card§r can be used to add 9 more slots for patterns in an §3ME Interface§r. Up to 3 cards can be inserted.

# Quest: Quantum Network Bridge
betterquesting.quest.di_RfA7kSDGB_3iCgsfVaQ.name=Quantum Network Bridge
betterquesting.quest.di_RfA7kSDGB_3iCgsfVaQ.desc=A §3Quantum Network Bridge§r is a multiblock structure that connects 2 potentially distant, or even in different dimensions, network fragments together. Created by crafting 8 §3ME Quantum Ring§r and a §3ME Quantum Link Chamber§r and placing the ME quantum link chamber in the center, and sourrounding it in the 8 ME quantum rings.%n%n[img height=1000]betterquesting:textures/QB_Qring1.png[/img]%n%nEach quantum network bridge requires power to function. This power must be provided from the network fragment it is attached to until the bridge is linked; at which time power from either side will be available. However if power is lost, connectivity will fail and power will be drained from the side the bridge is on in attempt to restore connection.%n%nTo establish a link between 2 quantum network bridges, you must create a pair of §6Quantum Entangled Singularities§r. One of each will be placed inside of a particular connection. Each Bridge may only connect to one other bridge.%n%n[img height=1000]betterquesting:textures/QB_Qring2.png[/img]%n%nAE2 Singularities are created by dumping 256k of any block inside a §3Matter Condenser§r. Singularities can become quantum entangled by dropping a singularity and ender dust and then exploding them together.

# Quest: Acceleration Card
betterquesting.quest.g0hMKPOqRWKCKtSyhQtPsA.name=Acceleration Card
betterquesting.quest.g0hMKPOqRWKCKtSyhQtPsA.desc=The §6Acceleration Card§r increases the speed of various AE2 devices.

# Quest: Dense ME Cable
betterquesting.quest.gZL_U2jPTZe5oDt8FcJ2QQ.name=Dense ME Cable
betterquesting.quest.gZL_U2jPTZe5oDt8FcJ2QQ.desc=The §6Dense ME Fluix Cables§r can be used to transmit §e32 channels§r from an §3ME Controller§r.%n%nOne controller is capable of connecting up to 6 dense cables, in turn each can branch off to 4 smaller cable lines connecting up to 192 ME devices to the network.%n%nThe §6Smart Dense Cable§r also displays the amount of channels that are been used, but is known to be less performance friendly than the dense covered cables.%n%nIn addition there are 16 colored cables made with the appropriate dye. The colored cables allow contact with other cables without sharing the signal or connecting to any other cable but the ones of the same colour.

# Quest: Molecular Assembler
betterquesting.quest.h0nPHR-TSQWbZhxIF9pAsA.name=Molecular Assembler
betterquesting.quest.h0nPHR-TSQWbZhxIF9pAsA.desc=The §3Molecular Assembler§r is used to autocraft anything that can be made in a crafting table.

# Quest: Crafting CPU
betterquesting.quest.ku71W0ZTQkOsyV4SQ0pPLA.name=Crafting CPU
betterquesting.quest.ku71W0ZTQkOsyV4SQ0pPLA.desc=The Crafting CPU is a multiblock structure composed of §3Crafting Co-Processing Units§r and §3Crafting Storage§r. When placed next to eachother they form one CPU which is used when placing orders via §3Interfaces§r. The more crafting co-processing units the more tasks the CPU can do in parallel while more crafting storage allows for bigger orders to be made.

# Quest: ME Pattern
betterquesting.quest.lFAX1X73QMiTSYhQ3ozq_g.name=ME Pattern
betterquesting.quest.lFAX1X73QMiTSYhQ3ozq_g.desc=§6ME Patterns§r are used to encode recipes to be used in §3Interfaces§r. They can be encoded in a §3Pattern Terminal§r.

# Quest: Network Visualisation Tool
betterquesting.quest.mH0ic-3aRnOZ8FjP-n9qYw.name=Network Visualisation Tool
betterquesting.quest.mH0ic-3aRnOZ8FjP-n9qYw.desc=The §6Network Visualisation Tool§r is used to visuallize an ME Network by right-clicking on any of its blocks, making it very useful when making a large network, especially one that uses §3P2P§r.

# Quest: ME subnetting
betterquesting.quest.n0clnMBkRw2Y4Asw6b1vJQ.name=ME subnetting
betterquesting.quest.n0clnMBkRw2Y4Asw6b1vJQ.desc=§eSubnetworks§r are ME networks which can be accessed from a §eMain Network§r. In §dNTM§r§r they can be useful for storing items from passive processes without flooding the main storage network.%n%n§2This quest serves as a guide on how to set up a subnet, which can be used to store the resourses that Bedrock Ore Processing produces.§r%n%nIn the image below are two ME networks, the §cRed§r one as the §cMainnet§r, and the §9Blue§r one as the §9Subnet§r.%n%n[img height=1000]betterquesting:textures/BQ_NET1.png[/img]%n%nFor the purposes of this quest, the main network will store dirt blocks, while the subnet will store copper blocks.%n%n[img height=1000]betterquesting:textures/BQ_NET2.png[/img]%n%n[img height=1000]betterquesting:textures/BQ_NET3.png[/img]%n%nTo make the contents of the subnet, the copper blocks, visible to the main net, one must make an §3Interface§r-§3Storage Bus§r§r combo. The storage bus must be on the side of the main network.%n%n[img height=1000]betterquesting:textures/BQ_NET4.png[/img]%n%nMake sure to filter the main network storage bus, and to also make it "Extract Only".%n%n[img height=1000]betterquesting:textures/BQ_NET5.png[/img]%n%nNow the main network has access to materials stored on the sub network, which can be used for crafting.%n%n[img height=1000]betterquesting:textures/BQ_NET6.png[/img]

# Quest: Overflow Void Card
betterquesting.quest.xyHVMuUHQjSWbujlx1EMqw.name=Overflow Void Card
betterquesting.quest.xyHVMuUHQjSWbujlx1EMqw.desc=The §6Overflow Void Card§r acts as a voiding upgrade for AE2 §6Storage Cells§r. It can be added to a storage cell using the §3Cell Workbench§r.


## Quest Line: OpenComputers
betterquesting.questline.7qWugdC9QfGJ31NktB0YqA.name=OpenComputers
betterquesting.questline.7qWugdC9QfGJ31NktB0YqA.desc=Use OpenComputers to monitor and control complex machinery.

# Quest: Memory
betterquesting.quest.-0Jqqg9TRmCEikNnquKeuA.name=Memory
betterquesting.quest.-0Jqqg9TRmCEikNnquKeuA.desc=§6Memory§r is like the §6CPU§r, an essential part in all computers.%n%nDepending on the CPU's architecture, the memory has a very essential effect on what a computer can and cannot do. For the standard Lua architecture, for example, it controls the actual amount of memory Lua scripts can use. This means that to run larger and more memory-intensive programs, you will need more memory.

# Quest: CPUs
betterquesting.quest.-SW2UUweSLCzJBCGcIm3nw.name=CPUs
betterquesting.quest.-SW2UUweSLCzJBCGcIm3nw.desc=The §6Central Processing Unit§r (CPU), is a core part for each computer or §6Server§r. It defines the architecture of the computer, and the number of components that can be connected to the computer before it stops working. %nHigher tier CPUs also provide a higher per-tick direct call limit to the computer - in simpler terms: better CPUs run faster.

# Quest: Internet Card
betterquesting.quest.1azNAAjWQLaNJLrVXT0W9w.name=Internet Card
betterquesting.quest.1azNAAjWQLaNJLrVXT0W9w.desc=The §6Internet Card§r grants computers access to the internet. It provides ways to perform simple HTTP requests, as well as to open plain TCP client sockets that can be read and written to.%n%nInstalling an internet card in a computer will also attach a custom file system that contains a few internet related applications, such as one for downloading and uploading snippets from/to pastebin as well as a "wget" clone that allows downloading data from arbitrary HTTP URLs.

# Quest: Transistors
betterquesting.quest.43PzmZVaTwS5ZaPt_fhugg.name=Transistors
betterquesting.quest.43PzmZVaTwS5ZaPt_fhugg.desc=The §6Transistor§r is one of the most basic crafting ingredients in OC. It is mainly used to craft §6Microchips§r and other electronic goods.

# Quest: Microchips
betterquesting.quest.5uHqD8E4RmWlcVca_5CJnQ.name=Microchips
betterquesting.quest.5uHqD8E4RmWlcVca_5CJnQ.desc=§6Microchips§r are the bread and butter of electronic component crafting. They come in different tiers, for crafting different tiers of components.

# Quest: Floppy Disks and Disk Drive
betterquesting.quest.6wQAgmUHTxavpGXJvZVhmA.name=Floppy Disks and Disk Drive
betterquesting.quest.6wQAgmUHTxavpGXJvZVhmA.desc=The §3Disk Drive§r can be used to read §6Floppy Disks§r using a computer connected to it.%n%nThis is useful to get started, since the lower tier §3Computer Cases§r do not have a built-in floppy slot, and you'll need an operating system to boot up the computer.

# Quest: Card Base
betterquesting.quest.70KciiqATFCPJR3s6eoIMg.name=Card Base
betterquesting.quest.70KciiqATFCPJR3s6eoIMg.desc=The §6Card Base§r is a common crafting material for card components in OC, such as §6Graphics Cards§r and §6Network Cards§r.

# Quest: Electronic Assembler
betterquesting.quest.7gCyEqlyTQqqnNxQ1cLt-A.name=Electronic Assembler
betterquesting.quest.7gCyEqlyTQqqnNxQ1cLt-A.desc=The §3Electronic Assembler§r is an advanded workstation that can be used to build more complex electronic devices, such as §3Robots§r, §3Drones§r and §6Tablets§r. %n%nThey require a large amount of energy to assemble devices, so it is recommended to power them sufficiently with a §3Capacitor Bank§r.

# Quest: Wireless Network Card
betterquesting.quest.8Bbui0CiRRm3hXTYH-ELpQ.name=Wireless Network Card
betterquesting.quest.8Bbui0CiRRm3hXTYH-ELpQ.desc=The §6Wireless Network Card§r is an upgraded §6Network Card§r that can send and receive wireless network messages.%n %nTier two cards can also send and receive wired messages. The signal strength directly controls the distance up to which a sent message can be received, where the strength is equal to the distance in blocks.

# Quest: Welcome to OC!
betterquesting.quest.90cLqSYpT8OevVo7UEEaGA.name=Welcome to OC!
betterquesting.quest.90cLqSYpT8OevVo7UEEaGA.desc=§dOpenComputers§r is a very useful mod which will let one automate many processes which normaly couldnt be done even with an ME system.%n%nMake sure to always check the §6OC Manual§r as it provides additional information of stuff that the quest book doesnt cover.

# Quest: Control and Arithmetics Units
betterquesting.quest.ABODDDQgRrGXZdmgdHJ7Sg.name=Control and Arithmetics Units
betterquesting.quest.ABODDDQgRrGXZdmgdHJ7Sg.desc=The §6Control Unit§r is used to create §6CPUs§r and §6Component Buses§r.%n%nThe §6Arithmetic Logic Unit§r is used for crafting components that perform calculations, such as CPUs and §6Graphics Cards§r.

# Quest: PWRangler
betterquesting.quest.DkfWKyKpReuU8BkzSMH3Xw.name=PWRangler
betterquesting.quest.DkfWKyKpReuU8BkzSMH3Xw.desc=§dNTM§r offers a built-in §6Floppy Disk§r for monitoring the §3PWR§r reactor.%n%n§2This quest serves as a guide on how to set up an OC Computer using a PWRangler floppy disk.§r%n%nFirst of all, an OC computer with OpenOS must be constructed. For the purposes of this quest the computer that will be used will make use of §bTier 3§r components.%n%n[img height=1000]betterquesting:textures/QB_OC1.png[/img]%n%n[img height=1000]betterquesting:textures/QB_OC2.png[/img]%n%nAfter booting up the PC, install OpenOS.%n%nOnce the PC has been rebooted, switch out the OpenOS floppy disk with the PWRangler one. Once inserted, type §oinstall§r to install the PWRangler on the system.%n%nThe PWR needs to be linked to the computer using OC Cables directly on the controller.%n%n[img height=1000]betterquesting:textures/QB_OC3.png[/img]%n%nFinally, type §oPWRangler§r in the computer to start the program.%n%n[img height=1000]betterquesting:textures/QB_OC4.png[/img]%n

# Quest: Hard Drives
betterquesting.quest.EdeL97xNTSmiLfPQpCJiow.name=Hard Drives
betterquesting.quest.EdeL97xNTSmiLfPQpCJiow.desc=The §6Hard Disk Drives§r are a higher tier storage medium in OC.%n%nAll storage media perform at the same speed: higher tier storage provides more space. There are also some devices that can only use disk drives (although servers could use an external disk drive, for example). Hard drives can be placed inside a §3Raid§r, allowing multiple drives to share the same file system. Note that placing a hard drive in a raid wipes the drive of its contents.

# Quest: Component Buses
betterquesting.quest.GWpBgrTUR6aiNelNbOLRWQ.name=Component Buses
betterquesting.quest.GWpBgrTUR6aiNelNbOLRWQ.desc=A §6Component Bus§r is a server-specific upgrade that allows the server to communicate with more components at the same time, without shutting down. %n%nLike with §6CPUs§r, higher tier buses provide higher component limits. Higher tier servers are also capable of taking more component buses, allowing for communication with many more components.

# Quest: Servers
betterquesting.quest.QFKT5L7RSrKQIz-qYhUsVg.name=Servers
betterquesting.quest.QFKT5L7RSrKQIz-qYhUsVg.desc=§6Servers§r are a form of higher tier computer. %n%nThey can be configured by holding them in the hand and using them - like opening a backpack for example. Servers can also be configured after having been installed into a Rack by activating them (aiming at the corresponding position on the frong face on the rack). To operate, the server has to be placed inside a §3Rack§r.

# Quest: Computer Casings
betterquesting.quest.XfkIHFJDRgSIyYD_F5b05g.name=Computer Casings
betterquesting.quest.XfkIHFJDRgSIyYD_F5b05g.desc=§3Computer Casings§r come in 3 different tiers, which limit the amount of components that ca be placed inside of them.

# Quest: Graphics Cards
betterquesting.quest.b14L2QcPTRiHysGkQNkTUQ.name=Graphics Cards
betterquesting.quest.b14L2QcPTRiHysGkQNkTUQ.desc=The §6Graphics Card§r is an essential part for most computers and allows the computer to display text on a connected §6Screen§r. %n%nGraphics cards come in several tiers, and like screens, support different resolutions and color depths.

# Quest: Screens
betterquesting.quest.fS6P083FQGWwxARPYM4eaA.name=Screens
betterquesting.quest.fS6P083FQGWwxARPYM4eaA.desc=A §3Screen§r is used in combination with a §6Graphics Card§r, to allow computers to display text. Different screen tiers have different capabilities, such as supporting different resolutions and olor depths. Screens range from low-resolution, monochrome displays to high-resolution displays with up to 256 colors.

# Quest: OC Power
betterquesting.quest.l3OJx_niTg-UyYUoyOXYfg.name=OC Power
betterquesting.quest.l3OJx_niTg-UyYUoyOXYfg.desc=The §6Cable§r serves as a way of connecting computers and machines that are far apart. If you have a compact build where all components touch each other (directly or indirectly, most blocks also behave the same way as cables) you will usually not need cables.%n%nThe §3Power Converter§r serves as the fastest way to convert energy from other mods' power systems to OpenComputers' internal energy. Placing an §3HE to RF Converter§r next to the PC will also work.%n%nThe §3Capacitor Stores§r energy to be used by the network, acting as an energy buffer when needed. It is very useful for tasks that demand a lot of energy, such as assembling or charging devices such as robots and drones.

# Quest: Computer
betterquesting.quest.zElcW5PDQwGOvbKnyroWEQ.name=Computer
betterquesting.quest.zElcW5PDQwGOvbKnyroWEQ.desc=A §3Keyboard§r is needed to type text on §3Screens§r, be they in the world or built into devices such as §3Robots§r or §6Tablets§r.%n%nFor the keyboard to work with a screen in the world, it has to be placed next to the screen, facing that screen, or placed directly on the screen (on top or on one of the sides).%n%nThe §6EEPROM§r is what contains the code used to initialize a computer when it is being booted. %n%nThis data is stored as plain byte array, and may mean different things to different §6CPU§r architectures. For example, for Lua it is usually a small script that searches for a file systems with an init script, for other architectures it may be actual machine code.%n%nAn §6OpenOS Disk§r can be crafted using an empty floppy disk and a manual.


